rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If no card of the chosen type is found before your library empties, you don\'t get a card, but you do get to order all the cards in your library any way you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you use this on a multi-card draw, each replaced draw is handled separately. In other words, you reveal and then put on the bottom of the library for the first card, then do the same for the second, and so on. In a multi-card draw you do not have to choose how many of those draws will be replaced before you do any drawing or use of this card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'This replacement effect replaces the draw, so nothing that triggers on a draw will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "If your library is empty, Abundance can prevent you from losing the game for being unable to draw a card. If an effect or turn-based action would cause you to draw a card, you can replace that draw with Abundance\'s replacement effect. (It doesn\'t matter that you\'d be unable to actually draw a card.) Since Abundance\'s effect has you put a card into your hand instead of drawing a card, you\'ll never be forced to draw a card with an empty library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'A spell you cast that’s both creature types costs {1} less to cast, not {2} less.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The effect reduces the total cost of the spell, regardless of whether you chose to pay additional or alternative costs. For example, if you cast a Rogue spell by paying its prowl cost, Frogtosser Banneret causes that spell to cost {1} less.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If Oona’s Blackguard enters the battlefield at the same time as another Rogue (due to Living End, for example), that creature doesn’t get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a Rogue would normally enter the battlefield with a certain number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters plus one on it instead. If a Rogue would normally enter the battlefield with no +1/+1 counters on it, it enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The creature gets the counter if it would enter the battlefield under your control. It doesn’t matter who owns the creature or what zone it enters the battlefield from (such as your opponent’s graveyard, for example).'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The effects from more than one of these cards are cumulative. That is, if you have two Oona’s Blackguard on the battlefield, Rogue creatures you control enter the battlefield with two additional +1/+1 counters on them.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Note that this spell counts the number of permanents you control of the chosen type, not just the number of creatures you control. It will also take your tribal permanents into account.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers after blockers are declared during the declare blockers step. Each attacking Rogue you control gets +2/+1 if no creatures were assigned to block it. That creature will get the bonus even if an effect causes it to become blocked.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'To determine the value of X, this spell looks back over the course of the turn and counts all damage dealt by all sources to players who are currently your opponents, as well as damage dealt by all sources to players who were your opponents at the time they left the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As the end step begins, Sygg’s ability checks whether a player who is currently your opponent, or a player who was your opponent at the time they left the game, has lost 3 or more life over the course of the turn. If so, the ability will trigger. If not, it won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter how the opponent lost life or who caused it, as long as the total loss of life is 3 or more.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability checks only whether life was lost. It doesn’t care whether life was also gained. For example, if an opponent lost 4 life and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with — but Sygg’s ability will trigger anyway.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability checks to see if it triggers at the end of every turn. It doesn’t have to be your turn, and it doesn’t have to be the turn of the opponent that lost life.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability will trigger even if Sygg wasn’t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the life was lost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You don’t specify an opponent when the ability triggers. If multiple opponents have lost 3 or more life over the course of the turn, the ability will trigger only once.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The tokens enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "You target the opponent when you activate Oona\'s ability. You don\'t choose the color until the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don\'t exist. You don\'t choose targets for those modes."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can\'t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can\'t cast the spell."}]', "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose both modes, you choose their targets at the same time. You can’t counter your own creature spell and then return that card from your graveyard to your hand.'}, {'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'You may choose just the first mode (targeting a creature spell), just the second mode (targeting a creature card in your graveyard), or both modes (targeting a creature spell and a creature card in your graveyard). You can’t choose a mode unless there’s a legal target for it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The effect from the ability overwrites other effects that set power and/or toughness if and only if those effects existed before the ability resolved. It will not overwrite effects that modify power or toughness (whether from a static ability, counters, or a resolved spell or ability), nor will it overwrite effects that set power and toughness which come into existence after the ability resolves. Effects that switch the creature’s power and toughness are always applied after any other power or toughness changing effects, including this one, regardless of the order in which they are created.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "Admonition Angel\'s landfall ability and its last ability are linked. The last ability refers only to cards exiled with its landfall ability."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If Admonition Angel\'s landfall ability triggers, but the Angel leaves the battlefield before it resolves, its last ability will trigger and resolve first. All previously exiled cards will be returned to the battlefield. Then the landfall ability will resolve and exile the targeted permanent forever."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to pay {2} as the ability resolves. You may pay {2} only once per resolution.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The affected creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Although creature tokens go to the graveyard before ceasing to exist, they never count as creature cards and won\'t increase the bonus granted by Bonehoard, however briefly."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If lethal damage is dealt simultaneously to the equipped creature and another creature, both creatures are put into the graveyard at the same time. The equipped creature won\'t get an additional bonus from the other creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If there are no creature cards in any graveyard when Bonehoard\'s living weapon ability resolves, the Germ will be 0/0 and put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is calculated continuously as the number of creature cards in graveyards changes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Master Thief ceases to be under your control before its ability resolves, you won’t gain control of the targeted artifact at all.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Master Thief leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it, and its control-change effect ends.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Master Thief, its control-change effect ends. Regaining control of Master Thief won’t cause you to regain control of the artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'All Rats you control have deathtouch while Ogre Slumlord is on the battlefield, not just the ones created by Ogre Slumlord.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If the copied permanent is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If the token you create is a copy of a creature, you can exile Stolen Identity encoded on that token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact or creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether it is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If a creature with an encoded card deals combat damage to more than one player simultaneously (perhaps because some of the combat damage was redirected), the triggered ability will trigger once for each player it deals combat damage to. Each ability will create a copy of the exiled card and allow you to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If another player gains control of the creature, that player will control the triggered ability. That player will create a copy of the encoded card and may cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If the creature leaves the battlefield, the exiled card will no longer be encoded on any creature. It will stay exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If the spell with cipher doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects will happen, including cipher. The card will go to its owner\'s graveyard and won\'t be encoded on a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If you choose not to cast the copy, or you can\'t cast it (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the copy will cease to exist the next time state-based actions are performed. You won\'t get a chance to cast the copy at a later time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If you want to encode the card with cipher onto a noncreature permanent such as a Keyrune that can turn into a creature, that permanent has to be a creature before the spell with cipher starts resolving. You can choose only a creature to encode the card onto.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'The copy of the card with cipher is created in and cast from exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The exiled card with cipher grants a triggered ability to the creature it\'s encoded on. If that creature loses that ability and subsequently deals combat damage to a player, the triggered ability won\'t trigger. However, the exiled card will continue to be encoded on that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The spell with cipher is encoded on the creature as part of that spell\'s resolution, just after the spell\'s other effects. That card goes directly from the stack to exile. It never goes to the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "You cast the copy of the card with cipher during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore timing restrictions based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "You choose the creature as the spell resolves. The cipher ability doesn\'t target that creature, although the spell with cipher may target that creature (or a different creature) because of its other abilities."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Enters-the-battlefield abilities of the creature card Lazav is copying won’t trigger as Lazav is already on the battlefield when it becomes a copy of that creature card.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple creature cards are put into an opponent’s graveyard at the same time, you choose the order that Lazav’s triggered abilities go on the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Lazav, Dimir Mastermind becomes a copy of the creature card in the graveyard. If that card is no longer in the graveyard when Lazav’s ability resolves, use the characteristics of that card as it last existed in the graveyard. Notably, copy effects that applied to the creature card when it was on the battlefield won’t be copied by Lazav. For example, if a Clone is put into an opponent’s graveyard from the battlefield and you use Lazav’s ability, it will become 0/0. It won’t become a copy of whatever Clone was copying.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Token creatures dying won’t cause Lazav’s triggered ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The creature cards enter the battlefield simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You can choose a number of targets up to the number of opponents you have, one target per opponent.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Activating the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature while it\'s already a creature will override any effects that set its power and/or toughness to another number, but effects that modify power and/or toughness without directly setting them will still apply."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'Until the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature resolves, the Keyrune is colorless.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Gate is not a basic land type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The subtype Gate has no special rules significance, but other spells and abilities may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Sporemound\'s ability triggers whenever you play a land and also whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for some other reason, such as the ability of Into the Wilds."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Nighthowler\'s last ability functions only from the battlefield. In other zones, Nighthowler is a 0/0 enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}]', "[{'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability’s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t scry.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you’ll scry last. For others, that means you’ll scry and then perform other actions.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'The effect that causes the creature to gain indestructible doesn’t have a duration. It lasts until the creature leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'The indestructible granted by Fated Return isn’t part of the creature’s copiable values. If the creature is copied, the copy won’t have indestructible (unless the creature otherwise has indestructible).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-04-26', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Once the ability triggers, it doesn’t matter how many creatures are still attacking when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creatures don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The choice of creature type is made as Obelisk of Urd enters the battlefield. Players can’t respond to this choice. The bonus starts applying immediately.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Worldsoul Colossus (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{W}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{W}. If you tap two green creatures and two white creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You can tap an untapped creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn to convoke a spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "The cost to activate a creature\'s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature\'s outlast ability can\'t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can\'t be both black and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Necromantic Selection doesn\'t overwrite any of the creature\'s colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another creature type."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Bolster itself doesn\'t target any creature, though some spells and abilities that bolster may have other effects that target creatures. For example, you could put counters on a creature with protection from white with Abzan Skycaptain\'s bolster ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'You determine which creature to put counters on as the spell or ability that instructs you to bolster resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'As the spell resolves, follow the instructions of the modes you chose in the order they are printed on the card. For example, if you chose the second and fourth modes of Ojutai’s Command, you would gain 4 life and then draw a card. (The order won’t matter in most cases.)'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a Command is copied, the effect that creates the copy will usually allow you to choose new targets for the copy, but you can’t choose new modes.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If all targets for the chosen modes become illegal before the Command resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If at least one target is still legal, the spell will resolve but will have no effect on any illegal targets.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. Ignore the targeting requirements for modes that aren’t chosen. For example, you can cast Ojutai’s Command without targeting a creature spell provided you don’t choose the third mode.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You choose the two modes as you cast the spell. You must choose two different modes. Once modes are chosen, they can’t be changed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A “nonland creature” is a creature that isn\'t also a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Awaken doesn\'t give the land you control a color. As most lands are colorless, in most cases the resulting land creature will also be colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a spell with awaken has multiple targets (including the land you control), and some but not all of those targets become illegal by the time the spell tries to resolve, the spell won\'t affect the illegal targets in any way."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the non-awaken part of the spell doesn\'t require a target and you cast the spell for its awaken cost, then the spell won\'t resolve if the target land you control becomes illegal before the spell resolves (such as due to being destroyed in response to the spell being cast)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the non-awaken part of the spell requires a target, you must choose a legal target. You can\'t cast the spell if you can\'t choose a legal target for each instance of the word “target” (though you only need a legal target for the awaken ability if you\'re casting the spell for its awaken cost)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "The land will retain any other types, subtypes, or supertypes it previously had. It will also retain any mana abilities it had as a result of those subtypes. For example, a Forest that\'s turned into a creature this way can still be tapped for {G}."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You can cast a spell with awaken for its mana cost and get only its first effect. If you cast a spell for its awaken cost, you\'ll get both effects."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If Omnath dies at the same time as any other Elementals you control, Omnath\'s last ability will trigger for each of them (and once for itself)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land\'s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Omanth doesn\'t have the land type Locus."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land\'s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A “nonland permanent card” is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If you return an Aura to the battlefield this way, you choose what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. This doesn’t target any player or permanent, so you could attach an Aura to a permanent with hexproof controlled by an opponent, for example. If there’s nothing the Aura can legally enchant, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Scytheclaw\'s triggered ability triggers and resolves after combat damage is dealt. For example, if the Germ token deals 1 combat damage to a player with 10 life, combat damage will reduce that player\'s life total to 9. Then Scytheclaw\'s ability will cause the player to lose 5 life, leaving the player at 4."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'A land that becomes a creature may be affected by "summoning sickness." You can\\\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Needle Spires has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 5/4 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'A “land creature” is a permanent that’s both a land and a creature.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Damage remains marked on creatures until the turn ends. If Sylvan Advocate’s ability stops applying (because Sylvan Advocate leaves the battlefield or you no longer control six or more lands), then any land creatures that needed the toughness bonus to stay alive will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'A “land creature” is a permanent that’s both a land and a creature.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'You may target a land that’s already a creature. For example, if you target a land that’s also a 0/0 creature and has three +1/+1 counters on it, the resulting land creature will be 6/6.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re activating the last ability, it’s too late for anyone to interrupt you by trying to remove the land you returned.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Extract from Darkness doesn\'t target a creature card. You choose which card you\'re putting onto the battlefield as it resolves. You can choose any creature card in a graveyard at that time, including one just put into a graveyard by Extract from Darkness. If there are no creature cards in graveyards at that time, Extract from Darkness simply finishes resolving."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gonti doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the card remains exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast that card (and spend mana as though it were mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can\'t look at or cast the card, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless. Snow mana is not a type of mana. Gonti, Lord of Luxury won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a player has no cards in their graveyard when Survive resolves, that player just shuffles their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You determine the cost to cast Hour of Revelation before you pay any of that cost. For example, if the only nonland permanents on the battlefield are Tezzeret the Schemer and nine Etherium Cells he’s given you, Hour of Revelation costs {W}{W}{W} to cast. You may sacrifice three Etherium Cells to pay this cost, even though there are no longer ten or more nonland permanents after you produce {W}{W}{W}.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'"Artifact" isn\\\'t a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Compare the revealed cards to the creature as it last existed before it died, not to the creature card as it exists in its owner\'s graveyard, to determine which one you put into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If Heirloom Blade leaves the battlefield at the same time that the equipped creature dies, its triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature has no creature type, no card can share a creature type with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card that shares a type with the creature that died, you\'ll just reveal and randomize your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You\'ll reveal cards until you find one that shares at least one creature type with the creature that died. For example, if a Cat Wizard dies, you\'ll stop if you reveal a Human Wizard or Cat Soldier."}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If the ability targets a land that’s already a creature, that land creature’s base power and toughness will become 0/0, overwriting its previous base power and toughness. Other effects that modify its power and/or toughness (including any +1/+1 counters that were on it) will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'The land-animation effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step or when you lose control of Waker of the Wilds.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Creatures you control that have +1/+1 counters put on them after Inspiring Call resolves won\'t gain indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Once a creature gains indestructible, it will have it for the turn, even if it loses all its +1/+1 counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat. There\\\'s no such thing as an attacking creature outside of the combat phase.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If an opponent is instructed to draw a card then discard a card, and Notion Thief causes you to draw a card instead, that opponent still discards a card. The same is true of any other actions that opponent is instructed to do.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If two or more players each control a Notion Thief and a player would draw a card other than the first one in their draw step, that player chooses one of the applicable Notion Thief effects to apply. Then the player whose Notion Thief\'s effect was chosen repeats this process among the remaining Notion Thief effects, and so on, until there are no more possible such effects to apply. Each effect can be applied to the card draw only once this way."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The above procedure means that if each player in a two-player game controls a Notion Thief and one would draw a card, it really will be that player who draws a card.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'"Equip [quality] creature" is a variant of the equip keyword. "Equip [quality] creature [cost]" means "[Cost]: Attach this Equipment to target [quality] creature you control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Whether the target creature is legendary is checked only as Blackblade Reforged\'s first equip ability is activated and as that ability resolves. If the creature somehow becomes nonlegendary later, Blackblade Reforged remains attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Multani’s ability that modifies its power and toughness applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 0/0 creature card.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'To activate Multani’s last ability, you must return lands you control from the battlefield to their owner’s hand. Land cards in your graveyard can’t be returned this way.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If a creature without counters receives enough -1/-1 counters to reduce its toughness to 0 or less, Together Forever\'s ability can\'t be activated before state-based actions put that creature into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'If a spell with support has other abilities that target creatures, those abilities and the support ability can target the same creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If some, but not all, targets for a spell become illegal, the remaining targets are affected as appropriate. If all of a spell\'s targets become illegal, that spell doesn\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'Support can target a creature another player controls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "Together Forever\'s activated ability checks whether the target creature has a counter on it as the ability is activated and as the ability resolves. If the creature loses its counters later in the turn, the delayed triggered ability will still return it to its owner\'s hand when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t put more than one +1/+1 counter on any one target using the support action."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A later effect that changes the affected creature’s colors will overwrite that part of Rise from the Grave’s effect; the creature will be only the new color. The same is true about an effect that changes the affected creature’s types or subtypes.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can’t be both black and colorless.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Rise from the Grave doesn’t overwrite any previous colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another subtype.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If you\'ve chosen both modes and one of Crush Contraband\'s targets becomes an illegal target, the other is still exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Price of Fame can target a creature that\'s indestructible. It won\'t be destroyed, but you\'ll surveil."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Price of Fame\'s mana value is 4, even if it costs {2} less to cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You\'ll surveil before resolving any abilities that trigger on the target creature dying."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Some spells that instruct you to surveil require targets. You can\'t cast a spell without choosing legal targets. If all of those targets become illegal, the spell doesn\'t resolve and you won\'t surveil."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'When you surveil, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards into your graveyard, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them into your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Worldsoul Colossus (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{W}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{W}. If you tap two green creatures and two white creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You can tap an untapped creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn to convoke a spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Marang River Prowler checks if you control a black or green permanent only as you begin to cast it. Once you begin to cast Marang River Prowler from your graveyard, it doesn’t matter what happens to the black or green permanents you control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions and pay its cost to cast Marang River Prowler from your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "While resolving Springbloom Druid\'s triggered ability, you can\'t sacrifice multiple lands to search for more than two basic land cards."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Cryptic Caves can be one of the five lands you control. You don’t need to control five other lands. It’s okay that you’ll only control four lands as you finish activating Cryptic Caves’s last ability.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If you control two Cryptic Caves and exactly three other lands, you can activate the last ability of only one of the Cryptic Caves. As soon as the cost for that ability is paid, you will no longer control enough lands to activate the ability of the second Cryptic Caves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If Scaretiller becomes tapped while casting a spell or activating an ability, that spell or ability resolves after Scaretiller\'s triggered ability has resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Neither mode of Scaretiller\'s ability counts as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you\'ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it\'s not your turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Scaretiller\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap it whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Beanstalk Giant\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because creatures with first strike deal combat damage before creatures without first strike, Keeper of Fables\'s ability can trigger twice during one combat if your creatures deal combat damage to one player at different times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If non-Human creatures you control deal combat damage to two or more players at the same time, Keeper of Fables\'s ability triggers for each of those players."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Keeper of Fables\'s ability triggers even if it\'s dealt lethal damage at the same time that non-Humans you control deal combat damage to a player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures die at the same time as Syr Konrad, its first ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Syr Konrad\'s first ability causes it to deal 1 damage twice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "A landfall ability doesn\'t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield or come under the target player\'s control after Geode Rager\'s ability has resolved won\'t be goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack, and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you leave the game, any creatures you\'ve goaded remain goaded until your next turn would have begun. They don\'t immediately stop being goaded and don\'t remain goaded indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability doesn’t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Effects that modify the power or toughness of the land creature without setting it will apply to its new base power and toughness no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Obuun’s first ability can target a land that’s already a creature. This overwrites any previous effects that set the land creature’s power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite that part of the effect.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Obuun’s first ability doesn’t remove any abilities the land creature has.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability doesn’t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to other Rogues you control may become lethal if Anowon leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If Rogues you control deal combat damage to two players at once, Anowon’s ability triggers twice.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'The player dealt combat damage mills cards only for the damage dealt by your Rogues, not for any other combat damage dealt to them at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You draw just one card, no matter how many creature cards the player mills beyond the first.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a nonland permanent changes control while it’s the target of Enigma Thief’s ability, that permanent won’t be a legal target as the ability resolves. Any remaining legal targets will be returned to their owners’ hand.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Prowl compares the creature types of the spell with the creature types of the creatures that dealt combat damage to players this turn. Normally this means that you can cast Enigma Thief for its prowl cost only if a Sphinx or Rogue dealt combat damage to a player, but if an effect causes the spell to have other creature types, the prowl ability is also satisfied by a creature with those additional types having dealt combat damage to a player.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a prowl cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You can cast a spell for its prowl cost any time in a turn after a creature you control of a matching type has dealt combat damage to a player. It doesn’t matter if that player left the game, if that creature left the battlefield or left your control, or if that creature no longer has a matching type.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells and/or permanents you control from Whispersteel Dagger’s ability are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You don’t choose a card to cast as Whispersteel Dagger’s ability resolves. You simply get a permission to cast one later.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the spell you wish to cast.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although the targeted player doesn\'t need to find a basic land card if they don\'t want to, that player must shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Armorcraft Judge\'s ability counts the number of creatures, not the number of counters. A creature with more than one +1/+1 counter won\'t cause you to draw more than one card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The number of creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them is counted only as Armorcraft Judge\'s triggered ability resolves. Players may respond to the triggered ability by trying to change that number."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To draw cards equal to the difference, first determine how many cards you\'ll draw, then draw that many cards, as modified by replacement effects. For example, if you have two cards in hand and the chosen opponent has five, Thought Reflection will cause you to draw six cards instead of three."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose an opponent while Sandstone Oracle\'s ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you make this choice and the time you draw cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Banishing Light leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an Aura is exiled this way, its owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in exile for the rest of the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an opponent has no land cards in their library, all the cards from that library will be revealed and put into their graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Consuming Aberration\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another creature you control dies at the same time as Zulaport Cutthroat, its ability triggers for that creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you activate Yavimaya Elder\'s last ability, its triggered ability will trigger and go on the stack. It will resolve first, meaning you\'ll do the search and shuffle before drawing a card."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You must sacrifice the creature if you still control it as the delayed triggered ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, you\'ll surveil last. For others, you\'ll surveil and then perform other actions."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Falkner\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {W} ({W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Der schnellste Weg durch die Dünen führt darüber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f288c99-73c8-4517-a13a-0a3a366a83c6\', \'multiverseId\': 496081}, \'multiverseid\': 496081}, {\'name\': \'Halconero abzano\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {W}. ({W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'El camino más rápido para cruzar las dunas es por encima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8ff850-8961-4fb0-867c-74ef9c26f216\', \'multiverseId\': 496215}, \'multiverseid\': 496215}, {\'name\': \'Fauconnier abzan\', \'text\': "Résilience {W} ({W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Le moyen le plus rapide de traverser les dunes reste encore de les survoler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'335f38a6-572c-466b-9ef1-ee4855654d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 496349}, \'multiverseid\': 496349}, {\'name\': \'Falconiere Abzan\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {W} ({W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La via più breve attraverso le dune è il cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cceef30-a1e1-4649-bbd1-94cd021137ca\', \'multiverseId\': 496483}, \'multiverseid\': 496483}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの鷹匠\', \'text\': \'長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'砂丘群を越えるのに最も速い手段は、上から行くことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07bf5ff1-f491-4d7e-929f-d248d1903844\', \'multiverseId\': 496617}, \'multiverseid\': 496617}, {\'name\': \'Falcoeiro Abzan\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {W} ({W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura com um marcador +1/+1 que você controla tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'O modo mais rápido de cruzar as dunas é por cima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ce89b5-28ae-48a8-bb5f-de80bd77002c\', \'multiverseId\': 496751}, \'multiverseid\': 496751}, {\'name\': \'Абзанский Сокольничий\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {W} ({W}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Самый быстрый путь через дюны — над ними.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caec2e23-d3dd-403e-ab54-041ca473bf80\', \'multiverseId\': 496885}, \'multiverseid\': 496885}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞训隼兵\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'横跨沙丘的捷径在空中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3bf7092-b5d3-4fef-9f77-5dc755c6d73b\', \'multiverseId\': 497019}, \'multiverseid\': 497019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Naya\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Amulett aus Naya fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Tappe alle Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496167&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c27974c-80bb-4839-860e-7b3270f8bfb6\', \'multiverseId\': 496167}, \'multiverseid\': 496167}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto nayano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto nayano hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Regresa la carta objetivo de un cementerio a la mano de su propietario.\\n• Gira todas las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb5e25e-ec03-43f0-97c7-64b0c557bc3c\', \'multiverseId\': 496301}, \'multiverseid\': 496301}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Naya\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Naya inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Engagez toutes les créatures que le joueur ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ceedfba-6010-4497-ac06-ad81aafe1fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 496435}, \'multiverseid\': 496435}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Naya\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Monile di Naya infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Fai riprendere in mano al suo proprietario una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n• TAPpa tutte le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49423a9f-4544-444e-b037-f07d22f61bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 496569}, \'multiverseid\': 496569}, {\'name\': \'ナヤの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ナヤの魔除けはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• 墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーをすべてタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11cbb66-4095-4109-83bf-f2121a06e0be\', \'multiverseId\': 496703}, \'multiverseid\': 496703}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Naya\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Medalhão de Naya causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Devolva o card alvo de um cemitério para a mão de seu dono.\\n• Vire todas as criaturas que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a89a47e-dff7-4418-bf8e-4f11c086a3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 496837}, \'multiverseid\': 496837}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Найи\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Талисман Найи наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу.\\n• Верните целевую карту из кладбища в руку ее владельца.\\n• Поверните все существа под контролем целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55630e6f-9cf3-4945-943f-611853dd7313\', \'multiverseId\': 496971}, \'multiverseid\': 496971}, {\'name\': \'纳雅护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•纳雅护符对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n•将目标牌从坟墓场移回其拥有者手上。\\n•横置由目标牌手操控的所有生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a57922d-6c53-4e68-91bb-4e8a0c434003\', \'multiverseId\': 497105}, \'multiverseid\': 497105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anowon, der Dieb der Ruine\', \'text\': \'Andere Räuber, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Räuber, den bzw. die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, millt der Spieler für jeden 1 Schadenspunkt, der ihm zugefügt wurde, eine Karte. Falls der Spieler auf diese Weise mindestens eine Kreaturenkarte millt, ziehst du eine Karte. (Um eine Karte zu millen, legt der Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b763c2-6d3a-4c60-a738-98c3fe931c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 495899}, \'multiverseid\': 495899}, {\'name\': \'Anowon, el Ladrón de las Ruinas\', \'text\': \'Los otros Bribones que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que uno o más Bribones que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador muele una carta por cada punto de daño que se le haga. Si el jugador muele al menos una carta de criatura de esta manera, robas una carta. (Para moler una carta, un jugador pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fe011d-aa02-4c40-ab63-8de8944f9907\', \'multiverseId\': 495905}, \'multiverseid\': 495905}, {\'name\': \'Anowon, le voleur des ruines\', \'text\': "Les autres gredins que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un gredin que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur meule une carte pour chaque 1 blessure qui lui est infligée. Si ce joueur meule au moins une carte de créature de cette manière, vous piochez une carte. (Pour meuler une carte, un joueur met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b3ee2f-86a6-4ffa-872f-9d9c19bb91c0\', \'multiverseId\': 495911}, \'multiverseid\': 495911}, {\'name\': \'Anowon, il Ladro delle Rovine\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Farabutti che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta uno o più Farabutti che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore macina una carta per ogni danno che gli viene inflitto. Se il giocatore macina almeno una carta creatura in questo modo, peschi una carta. (Per macinare una carta, un giocatore mette nel suo cimitero la prima carta del suo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04925b6-5fe0-4ade-aa10-98c834a5a94f\', \'multiverseId\': 495917}, \'multiverseid\': 495917}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の盗人、アノワン\', \'text\': \'他の、あなたがコントロールしているならず者は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているならず者１体以上がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分が受けたダメージ１点につきカードを１枚切削する。これによりそのプレイヤーがクリーチャー・カードを１枚以上切削したなら、あなたはカードを１枚引く。（カードを１枚切削するとは、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdde35e2-c7d8-49be-96d7-14f79d2367e8\', \'multiverseId\': 495923}, \'multiverseid\': 495923}, {\'name\': \'Anowon, o Ladrão da Ruína\', \'text\': \'Os outros Ladinos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que um ou mais Ladinos que você controla causam dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador tritura um card para cada 1 ponto de dano causado a ele. Se o jogador triturar ao menos um card de criatura dessa forma, você comprará um card. (Para triturar um card, um jogador coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57b9be6-b7fa-4795-adf7-8c5c41cfc3da\', \'multiverseId\': 495929}, \'multiverseid\': 495929}, {\'name\': \'Ановон, Вор Руин\', \'text\': \'Другие Бродяги под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда один или более Бродяг под вашим контролем наносят боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок скручивает одну карту за каждое 1 нанесенное ему повреждение. Если тот игрок таким образом скручивает хотя бы одну карту существа, вы берете карту. (Чтобы скрутить карту, игрок кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbdd31d-e3f7-45f0-807e-09fac4c26f68\', \'multiverseId\': 495935}, \'multiverseid\': 495935}, {\'name\': \'遗迹窃贼亚诺文\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他浪客得+1/+1。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个浪客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手每受到1点伤害，他便磨一张牌。如果该牌手以此法磨掉至少一张生物牌，则你抓一张牌。（磨一张牌的流程是牌手将其牌库顶的牌置入其坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eac2049-87dd-494e-8bee-cd86600e59c6\', \'multiverseId\': 495941}, \'multiverseid\': 495941}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspornender Ruf\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, eine Karte. Jene Kreaturen erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jetzt ist die Stunde gekommen. Es ist unsere Pflicht. Für den Sieg und die Familie — Angriff!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496142&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96cbb12-06c1-446f-aed4-5b5485fe4a73\', \'multiverseId\': 496142}, \'multiverseid\': 496142}, {\'name\': \'Llamada inspiradora\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. Esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruye" no las destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es el momento. Es nuestro deber. Por la victoria y la familia: ¡a la carga!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc0b7009-e738-40f6-b8c2-59a93d837c04\', \'multiverseId\': 496276}, \'multiverseid\': 496276}, {\'name\': \'Appel inspirateur\', \'text\': "Piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Ces créatures acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne les détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'heure est proche. C\'est notre devoir. Pour la victoire et la famille : chargez ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ad2195-0f94-4f59-b280-1b0c5292ca12\', \'multiverseId\': 496410}, \'multiverseid\': 496410}, {\'name\': \'Chiamata Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli. Quelle creature hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non le distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È giunto il momento, dobbiamo compiere il nostro dovere. Per la vittoria e la famiglia, alla carica!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3608b4be-ac67-4a0c-bac1-4087d6fc0c45\', \'multiverseId\': 496544}, \'multiverseid\': 496544}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する呼び声\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につき、カードを１枚引く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊する」と書かれた効果では、それらは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「時は来た。務めを果たすのだ。家族のため、勝利のために、突撃！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'911d8f0f-024b-466a-b307-48c501f1ce0d\', \'multiverseId\': 496678}, \'multiverseid\': 496678}, {\'name\': \'Chamado Inspirador\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1. Essas criaturas ganham indestrutível até o final do turno. (Nem dano nem efeitos que dizem "destrua" podem destruí-las.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A hora é essa. O dever é nosso. Pela vitória! Pela família! Atacar!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6055055f-26a1-4ac9-be69-3ed022f2c562\', \'multiverseId\': 496812}, \'multiverseid\': 496812}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющий Клич\', \'text\': \'Возьмите одну карту за каждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1. Те существа получают Неразрушимость до конца хода. (Повреждения и эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают их.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Час настал. Исполним же долг. Во имя победы, во имя наших семей — в бой!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f83a7a5-2e8b-4ef2-81ef-53d941dde566\', \'multiverseId\': 496946}, \'multiverseid\': 496946}, {\'name\': \'振奋呼号\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，便抓一张牌。这些生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它们消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「时机就在眼前。眼前只有荣誉。为了胜利与家人～前进！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97edd248-2c12-4f34-a589-ec114e8ac649\', \'multiverseId\': 497080}, \'multiverseid\': 497080}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496178&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d8a9039-cac0-4a94-87d8-1031803fb297\', \'multiverseId\': 496178}, \'multiverseid\': 496178}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e1ab82-896d-4d06-a7e4-80733e957713\', \'multiverseId\': 496312}, \'multiverseid\': 496312}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b549dda-8ef9-4ccf-a8ef-426a3a316e22\', \'multiverseId\': 496446}, \'multiverseid\': 496446}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43f1764-8044-4cd3-ba30-c87316f428c7\', \'multiverseId\': 496580}, \'multiverseid\': 496580}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af77ed0-b057-4228-8e17-e950cd5887cb\', \'multiverseId\': 496714}, \'multiverseid\': 496714}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': "Começou como uma simples gota d\'água. O Espelho Mágico a cristalizou em algo muito maior.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1173046c-933f-4d0d-872a-74d4faf2170e\', \'multiverseId\': 496848}, \'multiverseid\': 496848}, {\'name\': \'Магическая Печать\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва это была простая капля воды. Волшебное Зеркало превратило ее в нечто большее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'873b4b97-233c-4a09-939d-c2a79d504c25\', \'multiverseId\': 496982}, \'multiverseid\': 496982}, {\'name\': \'秘法印记\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明镜将之晶化为更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce68f61-0934-40d4-a3d2-effc9c56efe2\', \'multiverseId\': 497116}, \'multiverseid\': 497116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Garruks Pfad\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die du nicht kontrollierst, und alle Planeswalker, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jenseits des Schmerzes, der Besessenheit und der wilden Verzweiflung existiert ein Ort perverser Macht, den nur die gequältesten Seelen erreichen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496117&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26430ca-7fdd-46bf-88c1-b47914f03294\', \'multiverseId\': 496117}, \'multiverseid\': 496117}, {\'name\': \'Tras los pasos de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no controlas y todos los planeswalkers que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Más allá del dolor, más allá de la obsesión y de la desesperanza incontrolable, existe un lugar de retorcido poder que solo pueden alcanzar las almas más atormentadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4adaeff6-e76d-493e-b17a-fe7ff2bddbd8\', \'multiverseId\': 496251}, \'multiverseid\': 496251}, {\'name\': \'Dans le sillage de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures que vous ne contrôlez pas et tous les planeswalkers que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au-delà de la souffrance, de l\'obsession et du noir désespoir existe un lieu de corruption que seules les âmes les plus tourmentées peuvent atteindre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed929523-56f9-4bd5-a801-ec1856eab07a\', \'multiverseId\': 496385}, \'multiverseid\': 496385}, {\'name\': \'Sulla Scia di Garruk\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non controlli e tutti i planeswalker che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Oltre il dolore, oltre l\'ossessione e la pura disperazione, si trova un luogo dal potere corrotto che solo le anime più tormentate possono raggiungere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf235aa-bec7-40e3-9598-f5e097ef8d54\', \'multiverseId\': 496519}, \'multiverseid\': 496519}, {\'name\': \'ガラクの目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャーすべてと、あなたがコントロールしていないプレインズウォーカーすべてを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'苦痛や執着、そして激しい無念を超越したある場所に、極限まで苛まれた魂のみが到達することができる所があるという。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b3adde-d69f-4ad7-8016-0b6941258f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 496653}, \'multiverseid\': 496653}, {\'name\': \'No Rastro de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que você não controla e todos os planeswalkers que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Além da dor, da obsessão e do desespero selvagem, há um lugar de poder distorcido que só as almas mais atormentadas conseguem alcançar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa64ad3-391f-4b57-9265-a9f55ba55af0\', \'multiverseId\': 496787}, \'multiverseid\': 496787}, {\'name\': \'Где Прошел Гаррук\', \'text\': "Уничтожьте все существа не под вашим контролем и всех planeswalker\'ов не под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'За болью, одержимостью и бездной отчаяния есть место средоточия неописуемой силы, до которого могут добраться лишь самые измученные души.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b787c71-bbbf-426d-bb2f-87232effb733\', \'multiverseId\': 496921}, \'multiverseid\': 496921}, {\'name\': \'贾路开道\', \'text\': \'消灭所有不由你操控的生物和鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有一处超越痛苦，超越执着与绝望，充满扭曲力量的所在，只有遭受折磨最深的灵魂才能到达。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c10ec22d-e81b-4698-a40d-f0d47e56bd9f\', \'multiverseId\': 497055}, \'multiverseid\': 497055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus der Dunkelheit herausziehen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler millt zwei Karten. Dann bringst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. (Um eine Karte zu millen, legt der Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du oben Unheil anrichten möchtest, ist es manchmal ratsam, nach unten zu schauen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546c833c-fca5-4b65-a0e6-6e947117b870\', \'multiverseId\': 496162}, \'multiverseid\': 496162}, {\'name\': \'Extraer de la oscuridad\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador muele dos cartas. Luego, pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de un cementerio. (Para moler una carta, un jugador pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Si quieres sembrar el caos arriba, a veces es mejor mirar abajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41d65813-67f5-4244-aefa-f89591beecad\', \'multiverseId\': 496296}, \'multiverseid\': 496296}, {\'name\': \'Extraire des ténèbres\', \'text\': \'Chaque joueur meule deux cartes. Ensuite, vous mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature depuis un cimetière. (Pour meuler une carte, un joueur met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Pour semer le chaos à la surface, il faut parfois regarder dans les profondeurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a12729e-3cef-4425-b08a-3ec7f08a67a9\', \'multiverseId\': 496430}, \'multiverseid\': 496430}, {\'name\': "Estrarre dall\'Oscurità", \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore macina due carte. Poi metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura da un cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, un giocatore mette nel suo cimitero la prima carta del suo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Se vuoi seminare il caos in superficie, a volte è meglio guardare in profondità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3602ac84-7a40-4224-8f62-af64b828fdd1\', \'multiverseId\': 496564}, \'multiverseid\': 496564}, {\'name\': \'闇からの摘出\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを２枚切削する。その後、あなたは墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。（カードを切削するとは、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'上で混乱を引き起こしたいのなら、時には下を見ることも必要である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d476842f-4038-450b-9b56-9a05e45bc60b\', \'multiverseId\': 496698}, \'multiverseid\': 496698}, {\'name\': \'Extrair das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador tritura dois cards. Em seguida, você coloca um card de criatura de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. (Para triturar um card, um jogador coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Para semear o caos na superfície, às vezes é melhor olhar para as profundezas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e5c9d9-2290-4829-a5c9-7a2a1e2aa43a\', \'multiverseId\': 496832}, \'multiverseid\': 496832}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение из Тьмы\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок скручивает 2 карты. Затем вы кладете карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем. (Чтобы скрутить карту, игрок кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы устроить хаос наверху, иногда стоит поискать внизу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'332864dd-a2c4-4cee-8137-e0335f2b8c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 496966}, \'multiverseid\': 496966}, {\'name\': \'黯域掘力\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各磨两张牌。然后你将一张生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。（磨一张牌的流程是牌手将其牌库顶的牌置入其坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'如果想在上面搞破坏，有时最好先低头看一看。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d56fcd-1ab1-49f7-a715-e2c2257320ad\', \'multiverseId\': 497100}, \'multiverseid\': 497100}]', "[{'name': 'Ausgestoßener Wandelwicht', 'text': 'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nDer Ausgestoßene Wandelwicht kann nicht blocken und nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': 'Ein wechselhaftes Gesicht sät Misstrauen und erntet ein Leben in Einsamkeit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496112&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6210f2fc-f978-43fa-b1ff-42b3275cabfa', 'multiverseId': 496112}, 'multiverseid': 496112}, {'name': 'Cambiaformas desterrado', 'text': 'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEl Cambiaformas desterrado no puede bloquear y no puede ser bloqueado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': 'Un rostro volátil siembra desconfianza, y la desconfianza conlleva una vida solitaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496246&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1acce3f1-2d74-4d86-850c-4dc40d9f07b1', 'multiverseId': 496246}, 'multiverseid': 496246}, {'name': 'Proscrit changelin', 'text': 'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nLe Proscrit changelin ne peut pas bloquer et ne peut pas être bloqué.', 'type': 'Créature : changeforme', 'flavor': 'Un visage changeant inspire la méfiance. La méfiance suscite la solitude.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496380&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2649cf86-fda7-44cd-8548-3c4e091e32b1', 'multiverseId': 496380}, 'multiverseid': 496380}, {'name': 'Cangiante Reietto', 'text': 'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nIl Cangiante Reietto non può bloccare e non può essere bloccato.', 'type': 'Creatura — Polimorfo', 'flavor': 'Un volto mutevole semina diffidenza, che a sua volta raccoglie una vita solitaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496514&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7402924-3f57-4299-ac24-ea5afecbff1d', 'multiverseId': 496514}, 'multiverseid': 496514}, {'name': '変わり身ののけ者', 'text': '多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n変わり身ののけ者ではブロックできず、変わり身ののけ者はブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': '移り気な表情が不信を蒔く。不信は孤独な命を刈り取る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496648&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2b2ec6f-d5b0-4606-8f6e-62ad429365f5', 'multiverseId': 496648}, 'multiverseid': 496648}, {'name': 'Pária Morfoloide', 'text': 'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nPária Morfoloide não pode bloquear e não pode ser bloqueado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': 'Um rosto inconstante semeia desconfiança, cujo fruto a colher é uma vida solitária.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496782&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5cd2039-7e33-4079-8ac4-89ecd41af2f7', 'multiverseId': 496782}, 'multiverseid': 496782}, {'name': 'Перевертыш-Изгой', 'text': 'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nПеревертыш-Изгой не может блокировать и не может быть заблокирован.', 'type': 'Существо — Имитатор', 'flavor': 'Переменчивое лицо порождает недоверие. Недоверие оборачивается одинокой жизнью.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496916&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20658acc-cb70-4253-9e60-27827a700cac', 'multiverseId': 496916}, 'multiverseid': 496916}, {'name': '化形黜人', 'text': '化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n化形黜人不能进行阻挡，也不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～变形兽', 'flavor': '变幻面容埋下猜疑祸根。猜疑祸根长出孤独人生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497050&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c592aea-90c7-463b-b8bb-27603ca4afc8', 'multiverseId': 497050}, 'multiverseid': 497050}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bannendes Licht\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bannende Licht ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis das Bannende Licht das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auserwählte griff nach einem Stein und Heliod legte ihr die Sonne in die Hand.\\n—*Die Theriaden*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496083&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234f17d9-2867-4088-9b08-6ffd9c0a26d1\', \'multiverseId\': 496083}, \'multiverseid\': 496083}, {\'name\': \'Luz de destierro\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Luz de destierro entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que la Luz de destierro deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La Campeona tomó una piedra y Heliod puso el sol en su mano.\\n—*La Theríada*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'133925a5-8bde-4742-9272-1de1a45f0a07\', \'multiverseId\': 496217}, \'multiverseid\': 496217}, {\'name\': \'Lumière de bannissement\', \'text\': "Quand la Lumière de bannissement arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Lumière de bannissement quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La championne voulut ramasser une pierre, Héliode plaça le soleil dans sa main.\\n—*La Thériade*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496351&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee3aeca3-2525-403e-8af2-46b68bf9de8e\', \'multiverseId\': 496351}, \'multiverseid\': 496351}, {\'name\': \'Luce Esiliatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Luce Esiliatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché la Luce Esiliatrice non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La Campionessa stese la mano per afferrare una pietra, ed Eliod le porse il sole.\\n—*La Theriade*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c033d6d-5b48-4198-93ac-d936c3543609\', \'multiverseId\': 496485}, \'multiverseid\': 496485}, {\'name\': \'払拭の光\', \'text\': \'払拭の光が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。払拭の光が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'女勇者は石に手を伸ばした。ヘリオッドは太陽を彼女の手に委ねた。\\n――*「テーリアス」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fcecf12-949b-4ae2-9e2b-7f7ef5a19bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 496619}, \'multiverseid\': 496619}, {\'name\': \'Luz Banidora\', \'text\': \'Quando Luz Banidora entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno que um oponente controla até que Luz Banidora deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A Campeã procurou uma pedra e Heliode pôs o sol em suas mãos.\\n— *A Teríada*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4dd001-a821-4f44-9c1f-6c07e90275c3\', \'multiverseId\': 496753}, \'multiverseid\': 496753}, {\'name\': \'Изгоняющий Свет\', \'text\': \'Когда Изгоняющий Свет выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Изгоняющий Свет не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Поборница потянулась за камнем, и Гелиод положил солнце ей в руку.\\n— *«Териада»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d646704a-eeb4-41d2-8baf-f882aabc67ff\', \'multiverseId\': 496887}, \'multiverseid\': 496887}, {\'name\': \'驱逐明光\', \'text\': \'当驱逐明光进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物，直到驱逐明光离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'天尊伸手想要去拿石块，赫利欧德则将整个太阳递到她掌心。\\n～*《塞洛亚特》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1283f5-e398-463c-8e65-590ff10d98d6\', \'multiverseId\': 497021}, \'multiverseid\': 497021}]', "[{'name': 'Bannerträger der Froschwerfer', 'text': 'Eile\\nGoblin- und Räuber-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Die Froschwerfer weben Federn, Knochen und Trophäen ihrer letzten Beutezüge in ihre Standarten und glauben, dass sie ihre Baracken mit dem Ärger ihrer Opfer heizen können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496115&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93dee19c-9e2e-44ea-ac9b-e2d96b79b183', 'multiverseId': 496115}, 'multiverseid': 496115}, {'name': 'Banderola de Lanza rana', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de Trasgo y de Bribón.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón trasgo', 'flavor': 'Los Lanza rana cosen plumas, huesos y trofeos de incursiones anteriores en sus estandartes, creyendo que ayudan al barracón con la ira de sus víctimas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496249&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28986f16-e90d-40e2-900a-67ae7c56abcc', 'multiverseId': 496249}, 'multiverseid': 496249}, {'name': 'Banneret de Lancegrenouille', 'text': 'Célérité\\nLes sorts de gobelin et de gredin que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin et gredin', 'flavor': 'Les gobelins de Lancegrenouille rajoutent à leurs étendards des plumes, des os et des trophées de leurs raids précédents, espérant ainsi donner au terrier la puissance de la rage de leurs victimes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496383&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11561820-c9e1-46b7-9e44-5a1b20ce18b0', 'multiverseId': 496383}, 'multiverseid': 496383}, {'name': 'Stendardiere del Lancio della Rana', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nLe magie Goblin e le magie Farabutto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.', 'type': 'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin', 'flavor': 'I boggart del Lancio della Rana cuciono piume, ossa e trofei delle precedenti incursioni nei loro stendardi, credendo di nutrire il cunicolo con la rabbia delle sue vittime.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496517&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f8647c8-e896-49b6-9591-7e38d76690de', 'multiverseId': 496517}, 'multiverseid': 496517}, {'name': '蛙投げの旗騎士', 'text': '速攻\\nあなたがゴブリン・呪文やならず者・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者', 'flavor': '蛙投げは羽根や骨や過去の襲撃での戦利品を軍旗に縫い付けることで、犠牲者の怒りが巣穴に満ちると信じている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496651&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c856ced1-d942-49ae-bd04-1441ffabd65a', 'multiverseId': 496651}, 'multiverseid': 496651}, {'name': 'Alferes de Lança-sapos', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nAs mágicas de Goblin e de Ladino que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin Ladino', 'flavor': 'Os moradores de Lança-sapos costuram penas, ossos e troféus dos ataques passados em seus estandartes, na crença de que eles incitam o vilarejo com a raiva das vítimas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496785&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be00e03e-910b-4d71-8e52-6236a2150402', 'multiverseId': 496785}, 'multiverseid': 496785}, {'name': 'Знаменосец Жабокидателей', 'text': 'Ускорение\\nРазыгрываемые вами заклинания Гоблинов и заклинания Бродяг стоят на {1} меньше.', 'type': 'Существо — Гоблин Бродяга', 'flavor': 'Жабокидатели пришивают к своим знаменам перья, кости и трофеи, добытые в предыдущих набегах. Они верят, что эти вещицы подпитывают муравейник гневом жертв.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496919&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '733c2220-f562-4b22-9d4b-5b34be6377c3', 'multiverseId': 496919}, 'multiverseid': 496919}, {'name': '掷蛙掌旗', 'text': '敏捷\\n你施放的鬼怪咒语和浪客咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪／浪客', 'flavor': '掷蛙人把羽毛，骨头，以及过去劫掠的战利品缝在战旗上，相信这些倒楣鬼的愤怒会让繁殖地更强大。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497053&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ce08ca8-d455-4312-9ccf-9a72890534e3', 'multiverseId': 497053}, 'multiverseid': 497053}]", '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be9cc88-ffa4-4878-909f-4e2b419de27c\', \'multiverseId\': 496196}, \'multiverseid\': 496196}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dea67c4-55af-43f7-b61d-83216e3d48a7\', \'multiverseId\': 496330}, \'multiverseid\': 496330}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf9600f-6c0d-4fb9-909a-37c59cd8a11f\', \'multiverseId\': 496464}, \'multiverseid\': 496464}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f529c0d8-bf4c-4d71-a80f-e18f98127cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 496598}, \'multiverseid\': 496598}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344ae91c-6c70-41c3-a93a-51fd7bea1c72\', \'multiverseId\': 496732}, \'multiverseid\': 496732}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a derrota está próxima e as orientações são escassas, todos os olhos miram uma direção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af3800b-0c9f-4117-8171-d704ea208b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 496866}, \'multiverseid\': 496866}, {\'name\': \'Командная Башня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Когда поражение близко, а командовать некому, все взгляды обращаются в одном направлении.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c0e5bf8-b4a2-4b0a-9f9a-15dd1b2b9b94\', \'multiverseId\': 497000}, \'multiverseid\': 497000}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'当落败已成定局，当指引无处可寻，全军目光便会聚集一处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca4af8f-50ff-47a7-8cc6-0b59e7e3887f\', \'multiverseId\': 497134}, \'multiverseid\': 497134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berüchtigte Schar\', \'text\': \'Beutezug {5}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Beutezugkosten wirken, falls du in diesem Zug mit einem Räuber einem Spieler Kampfschaden zugefügt hast.)\\nErzeuge X 1/1 schwarze Feenwesen-Räuber-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit, wobei X gleich dem Schaden ist, der deinen Gegnern in diesem Zug zugefügt wurde. Falls die Beutezugkosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, erhältst du nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\', \'type\': \'Stammes-Hexerei — Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fdab184-4f7f-4b0f-ade6-e743bc66109c\', \'multiverseId\': 496105}, \'multiverseid\': 496105}, {\'name\': \'Multitud notoria\', \'text\': \'Rondar {5}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta por su coste de rondar si hiciste daño de combate a un jugador este turno con un Bribón.)\\nCrea X fichas de criatura Bribón Hada negras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar, donde X es el daño hecho a tus oponentes este turno. Si se pagó el coste de rondar de este hechizo, juega un turno adicional después de este.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro tribal — Bribón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79cdb489-2313-4bcb-9753-22a9bafe3b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 496239}, \'multiverseid\': 496239}, {\'name\': \'Cohue notoire\', \'text\': "Incursion {5}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût d\'incursion si vous avez infligé des blessures de combat à un joueur ce tour-ci avec un gredin.)\\nCréez X jetons de créature 1/1 noire Peuple fée et Gredin avec le vol, X étant le nombre de blessures infligées à vos adversaires ce tour-ci. Si le coût d\'incursion de ce sort a été payé, jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel tribal : gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496373&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b458d6c2-c2da-4bc1-8190-135a2239810a\', \'multiverseId\': 496373}, \'multiverseid\': 496373}, {\'name\': \'Folla Famigerata\', \'text\': \'Predatore {5}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di predatore se hai inflitto danno da combattimento a un giocatore con un Farabutto in questo turno.)\\nCrea X pedine creatura Farabutto Spiritello 1/1 nere con volare, dove X è il danno inflitto ai tuoi avversari in questo turno. Se è stato pagato il costo di predatore di questa magia, gioca un turno extra dopo questo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria Tribale — Farabutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5fd751d-19e8-4496-a519-83bdc7b39a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 496507}, \'multiverseid\': 496507}, {\'name\': \'悪名高き群れ\', \'text\': \'徘徊{5}{U}（このターン、あなたがならず者によってプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えているなら、あなたはこれをその徘徊コストで唱えてもよい。）\\n飛行を持つ黒の１/１のフェアリー・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘはこのターン、対戦相手が受けたダメージに等しい。この呪文の徘徊コストが支払われていたなら、このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\', \'type\': \'部族・ソーサリー — ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3d1c43-ebad-4a78-9ffa-3f1135d73f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 496641}, \'multiverseid\': 496641}, {\'name\': \'Multidão Infame\', \'text\': \'Espreitar {5}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de espreitar se você causou dano de combate a um jogador neste turno com um Ladino.)\\nCrie X fichas de criatura pretas 1/1 do tipo Fada Ladino com voar, sendo X o dano causado aos seus oponentes neste turno. Se o custo de espreitar desta mágica tiver sido pago, jogue um turno extra após este.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço Tribal — Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f186fb-18cc-43b9-8b65-7a23080e8509\', \'multiverseId\': 496775}, \'multiverseid\': 496775}, {\'name\': \'Пресловутая Ватага\', \'text\': \'Мародерство {5}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту за ее стоимость Мародерства, если в этом ходу вы нанесли игроку боевые повреждения с помощью Бродяги.)\\nСоздайте X фишек существа 1/1 черная Фея Бродяга с Полетом, где X — количество повреждений, нанесенных вашим оппонентам в этом ходу. Если стоимость Мародерства этого заклинания была оплачена, сделайте дополнительный ход вслед за этим.\', \'type\': \'Племенное Волшебство — Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef45f5bd-1527-49da-ba8c-013483b02d66\', \'multiverseId\': 496909}, \'multiverseid\': 496909}, {\'name\': \'恶名大群\', \'text\': \'伺机{5}{U}（如果你本回合中曾以浪客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害，则你可以支付此咒语的伺机费用来施放它。）\\n派出X个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的仙灵／浪客衍生生物，X为所有对手本回合中受过的伤害数量。如果曾支付此咒语的伺机费用，则在本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\', \'type\': \'部族法术 ～浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3da3825a-b939-44fb-b9a8-80fc318609fa\', \'multiverseId\': 497043}, \'multiverseid\': 497043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodenangriff\', \'text\': \'Der Bodenangriff fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Einen Drachen zu besiegen ist ganz leicht. Man braucht nur genügend Platz, um ordentlich weit ausholen zu können."\\n—Narbulg Neunfinger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496163&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f842f0ce-1498-453f-9a80-14f531424546\', \'multiverseId\': 496163}, \'multiverseid\': 496163}, {\'name\': \'Asalto terrestre\', \'text\': \'El Asalto terrestre hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Abatir a un dragón es fácil. Lo único que hace falta es el espacio suficiente para dar impulso a un buen golpe".\\n—Narbulg Nuevededos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4f1546-0aa9-4581-9118-f6167dbb28db\', \'multiverseId\': 496297}, \'multiverseid\': 496297}, {\'name\': \'Assaut terrestre\', \'text\': "L\'Assaut terrestre inflige à une créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Terrasser un dragon, c\'est facile. Il suffit d\'avoir suffisamment d\'espace pour armer sa frappe. »\\n—Narbulg Neuf Doigts", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186fd14f-328f-4db3-841a-11063c4a7d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 496431}, \'multiverseid\': 496431}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Terrestre\', \'text\': "L\'Assalto Terrestre infligge a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di terre che controlli.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È facile abbattere un drago. Ti serve solo abbastanza spazio per un buon fendente."\\n—Narbulg Nove Dita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'756ed178-91ce-4153-9d08-0566aeef6044\', \'multiverseId\': 496565}, \'multiverseid\': 496565}, {\'name\': \'地上の突撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。地上の突撃はそれにあなたがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ドラゴンを倒すなんて簡単なことさ。思い切り振り抜けるだけの空間さえあればいいんだ。」\\n――九本指のナーブルグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a25854-8bd0-40ce-b944-7c2a08aa8307\', \'multiverseId\': 496699}, \'multiverseid\': 496699}, {\'name\': \'Ataque por Terra\', \'text\': \'Ataque por Terra causa à criatura alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Derrubar um dragão é fácil. Você só precisa de espaço o bastante para conseguir encaixar um bom golpe."\\n— Narbulg Nove Dedos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9562ba-7df3-426e-83db-db3b60a91d07\', \'multiverseId\': 496833}, \'multiverseid\': 496833}, {\'name\': \'Атака с Земли\', \'text\': \'Атака с Земли наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные количеству земель под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Завалить дракона проще простого. Главное, чтобы было достаточно места для хорошего замаха».\\n— Нарбулг Девятипалый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a3f7ede-ba71-4734-92af-66a382bfd252\', \'multiverseId\': 496967}, \'multiverseid\': 496967}, {\'name\': \'地面袭击\', \'text\': \'地面袭击对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的地数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「击倒龙很容易。你只需要有足够的空间来出手。」\\n～九指纳博\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205bcd7d-b6d9-4341-8b82-67d5700f9fff\', \'multiverseId\': 497101}, \'multiverseid\': 497101}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bohnenranken-Riese // Blühender Schritt\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Bohnenranken-Riesen sind gleich der Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Bohnenranken-Riese\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496133&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0904b7-45bc-48d4-8449-357fa22660f8\', \'multiverseId\': 496133}, \'multiverseid\': 496133}, {\'name\': \'Gigante tallo de habichuelas // Pasos fértiles\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Gigante tallo de habichuelas son iguales a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gigante tallo de habichuelas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4238c97-e25c-4450-b37c-8fb554e9c1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 496267}, \'multiverseid\': 496267}, {\'name\': \'Géant de tige de haricot // Pas fertiles\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Géant de tige de haricot sont chacune égales au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Géant de tige de haricot\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad6d9de-cd50-4dba-9e33-5b7ec24eb255\', \'multiverseId\': 496401}, \'multiverseid\': 496401}, {\'name\': \'Gigante dei Fagioli // Passi Fertili\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione del Gigante dei Fagioli sono pari al numero di terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gigante dei Fagioli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94fc1a26-aa6d-4b83-adc5-0005f0a3b891\', \'multiverseId\': 496535}, \'multiverseid\': 496535}, {\'name\': \'豆の木の巨人 // 肥（ひ）沃（よく）な足（あし）跡（あと）\', \'text\': \'豆の木の巨人のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'豆の木の巨人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14d6f7b8-3a78-42ed-8bc9-59f330d689fb\', \'multiverseId\': 496669}, \'multiverseid\': 496669}, {\'name\': \'Gigante do Pé de Feijão // Pegadas Férteis\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Gigante do Pé de Feijão são ambos iguais ao número de terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Gigante do Pé de Feijão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb853d1f-7c1c-4c4a-aed5-df63dc00ca33\', \'multiverseId\': 496803}, \'multiverseid\': 496803}, {\'name\': \'Великан Бобового Ростка // Шаги Плодородия\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Великана Бобового Ростка равны количеству земель под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Великан Бобового Ростка\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67c1d43-8937-4a20-8b3b-af5a4bdef432\', \'multiverseId\': 496937}, \'multiverseid\': 496937}, {\'name\': \'豆茎巨人 // 丰沃脚步\', \'text\': \'豆茎巨人的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的地数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'豆茎巨人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc95265-1530-4763-9f27-a5e9deb62f49\', \'multiverseId\': 497071}, \'multiverseid\': 497071}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496194&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f00354f1-9447-49a9-a465-c74b9d8517d7', 'multiverseId': 496194}, 'multiverseid': 496194}, {'name': 'Fuerte boros', 'text': 'El Fuerte boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Fuerte boros entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496328&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c6cd8dd-dea2-4bde-a139-702c64e29905', 'multiverseId': 496328}, 'multiverseid': 496328}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496462&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddae2ac7-2fdc-4c9f-83bb-18bf06fa8cf0', 'multiverseId': 496462}, 'multiverseid': 496462}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496596&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc3f0fde-360a-4215-bee5-e112e6cb7e93', 'multiverseId': 496596}, 'multiverseid': 496596}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496730&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '035d3e30-f458-4d86-a9a9-8ba6ba3e13d0', 'multiverseId': 496730}, 'multiverseid': 496730}, {'name': 'Guarnição Boros', 'text': 'Guarnição Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Guarnição Boros entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496864&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c6acb3c-56fe-4abf-afda-cc8ac443d0ad', 'multiverseId': 496864}, 'multiverseid': 496864}, {'name': 'Гарнизон Боросов', 'text': 'Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496998&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41745a3c-862d-4c97-9eca-a6bcc5d32de2', 'multiverseId': 496998}, 'multiverseid': 496998}, {'name': '波洛斯驻防地', 'text': '波洛斯驻防地须横置进战场。\\n当波洛斯驻防地进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497132&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08bf06af-05d9-4eba-90dc-6e9b965cbaaf', 'multiverseId': 497132}, 'multiverseid': 497132}]", "[{'name': 'Boros-Gildeneingang', 'text': 'Der Boros-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land — Tor', 'flavor': 'Tritt ein, zögere nicht! Keine Zeit für Gnade, sei bereit für den Krieg!', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496195&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63827acd-1cdc-49c0-b55d-1c7a483a6769', 'multiverseId': 496195}, 'multiverseid': 496195}, {'name': 'Portal del Gremio Boros', 'text': 'El Portal del Gremio Boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Portal', 'flavor': 'Únete con un corazón piadoso. Regresa con un grito de batalla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496329&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b01388c5-1381-4b5f-aadc-de6f985f1108', 'multiverseId': 496329}, 'multiverseid': 496329}, {'name': 'Porte de la guilde de Boros', 'text': 'La Porte de la guilde de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain : porte', 'flavor': 'Entrez, le cœur plein de pitié. Sortez, un cri de bataille dans la gorge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496463&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aabdf131-dfb5-44ac-b441-9041d9b88cb4', 'multiverseId': 496463}, 'multiverseid': 496463}, {'name': 'Cancello della Gilda Boros', 'text': 'Il Cancello della Gilda Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra — Cancello', 'flavor': 'Entrate con cuori misericordiosi. Uscite con un grido di battaglia possente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496597&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '245d762a-784b-4935-b5e9-2b73f32961b3', 'multiverseId': 496597}, 'multiverseid': 496597}, {'name': 'ボロスのギルド門', 'text': 'ボロスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 門', 'flavor': '慈悲の心で入れ。喊声をあげて出よ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496731&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79152045-8c04-4589-a112-db373f6ebb8f', 'multiverseId': 496731}, 'multiverseid': 496731}, {'name': 'Portão da Guilda Boros', 'text': 'Portão da Guilda Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno — Portão', 'flavor': 'Entrem com corações piedosos. Saiam com gritos de guerra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496865&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3eb7fd6-4669-49f4-880b-3b6347fdbe78', 'multiverseId': 496865}, 'multiverseid': 496865}, {'name': 'Врата Гильдии Боросов', 'text': 'Врата Гильдии Боросов выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {W}.', 'type': 'Земля — Врата', 'flavor': 'Войдите с чутким сердцем. Выйдите с боевым кличем на устах.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496999&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ac79aa7-3cd6-460d-b289-0d608c39a26d', 'multiverseId': 496999}, 'multiverseid': 496999}, {'name': '波洛斯公会门', 'text': '波洛斯公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。', 'type': '地 ～门', 'flavor': '此门前来时尚存慈悲胸怀，归去时锻出响亮战嚎。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497133&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3abd21c-c1d3-496a-a2b1-09f186f1a5fd', 'multiverseId': 497133}, 'multiverseid': 497133}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brandrodung\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Turbulenz erschafft beim Vorbeiziehen die Welt neu und lässt nur die Polyeder unverändert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496141&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1085a113-8646-4cb2-b2d7-7ef3c4c2c88a\', \'multiverseId\': 496141}, \'multiverseid\': 496141}, {\'name\': \'Gradar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La Turbulencia rediseña el mundo a su paso, dejando solo los edros intactos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3708cc3f-b8e8-4066-8882-170dd7e21ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 496275}, \'multiverseid\': 496275}, {\'name\': \'Hersage\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Le Roulis redessine le monde sur son passage, ne laissant derrière lui que les hèdrons inchangés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffed438-52c3-4cdb-92da-5fa7b36b446a\', \'multiverseId\': 496409}, \'multiverseid\': 496409}, {\'name\': \'Erpice\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una terra.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il Torbido ridisegna il mondo mentre passa, lasciando immutati solo gli edri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f994eb0-7ad1-4914-944d-d23ea06e4610\', \'multiverseId\': 496543}, \'multiverseid\': 496543}, {\'name\': \'砕土\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'乱動は通り過ぎた世界を一変させてしまう。変わらないのは面晶体だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'781283c3-7a02-49c1-92fc-24d074d8030d\', \'multiverseId\': 496677}, \'multiverseid\': 496677}, {\'name\': \'Estorrar\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique um terreno.\\nProcure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O Turbilhão redesenha o mundo com sua passagem, deixando somente os edros inalterados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'660c6328-79a9-403b-bf13-ed1c7bf32f07\', \'multiverseId\': 496811}, \'multiverseid\': 496811}, {\'name\': \'Боронение\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте землю.\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Великий Вал перекраивает карту мира на своем пути, оставляя неизменными лишь эдры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e0793c1-8cc1-4296-8cbf-d6b6d68d79c5\', \'multiverseId\': 496945}, \'multiverseid\': 496945}, {\'name\': \'整地\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个地，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'狂搅所经之处，地貌为之改写，只有晶石维持不变。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2297a515-7837-4ef0-b84f-845248c0ca89\', \'multiverseId\': 497079}, \'multiverseid\': 497079}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wiederherstellung Dominarias', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II, — Mille zwei Karten. Dann kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\\nIII — Bringe alle Länderkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück und mische dann deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496146&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f31c735-ab9f-4ace-96d2-eec72254d82f', 'multiverseId': 496146}, 'multiverseid': 496146}, {'name': 'La Reparación de Dominaria', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — Muele dos cartas, luego puedes regresar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nIII — Regresa todas las cartas de tierra de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Luego, baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496280&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5610a3e8-ecab-475a-ab2d-cb4f60581e01', 'multiverseId': 496280}, 'multiverseid': 496280}, {'name': 'La Restauration de Dominaria', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Meulez deux cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nIII — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de terrain depuis votre cimetière, puis mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496414&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b0a011a-605a-4b8f-8994-935ae98452a7', 'multiverseId': 496414}, 'multiverseid': 496414}, {'name': 'La Riparazione di Dominaria', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Macina due carte, poi puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\nIII — Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte terra dal tuo cimitero, poi rimescola il tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496548&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a5bd61d-3e6a-43fe-b9f5-df0a02893aa2', 'multiverseId': 496548}, 'multiverseid': 496548}, {'name': 'ドミナリアの大修復', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― カードを２枚切削する。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地から土地・カードをすべて戦場に戻す。その後、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20e3b08c-fe0b-443e-8e58-cc29bb1be826', 'multiverseId': 496682}, 'multiverseid': 496682}, {'name': 'A Emenda de Dominária', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Triture dois cards. Em seguida você pode devolver um card de criatura de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nIII — Devolva todos os cards de terreno de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu cemitério em seu grimório.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496816&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8a4df45-a4ef-40ab-a15b-64dc14487597', 'multiverseId': 496816}, 'multiverseid': 496816}, {'name': 'Исцеление Доминарии', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI, II — Скрутите две карты, затем вы можете вернуть карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nIII — Верните все карты земель из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, затем втасуйте ваше кладбище в вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496950&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5127e0c-a38e-4185-b5b7-21c1d50ca091', 'multiverseId': 496950}, 'multiverseid': 496950}, {'name': '多明纳里亚愈合', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 磨两张牌，然后你可以将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\nIII — 将所有地牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，然后将你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497084&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b2c770a-2098-4ca3-9f00-4ed7b17a2a7f', 'multiverseId': 497084}, 'multiverseid': 497084}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06027094-3290-4ae9-ba94-6cd3ef484bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 496198}, \'multiverseid\': 496198}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbe0def-f1f0-4a39-80c6-8fe3bbb6d538\', \'multiverseId\': 496332}, \'multiverseid\': 496332}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6803da1d-c456-4a96-93cb-fb665ffef0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 496466}, \'multiverseid\': 496466}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4e6423-9809-4620-8805-9bfcce6a24ee\', \'multiverseId\': 496600}, \'multiverseid\': 496600}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf842aa7-7e8a-4fbf-80cb-5c1fbbdc4a11\', \'multiverseId\': 496734}, \'multiverseid\': 496734}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduto Dimir\', \'text\': \'Aqueduto Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Aqueduto Dimir entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3665198-0898-4a9e-bd5f-35a72c92ccc5\', \'multiverseId\': 496868}, \'multiverseid\': 496868}, {\'name\': \'Акведук Димиров\', \'text\': \'Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffbcbf7b-6a0b-4cb7-96eb-db482a9b6789\', \'multiverseId\': 497002}, \'multiverseid\': 497002}, {\'name\': \'底密尔下水道\', \'text\': \'底密尔下水道须横置进战场。\\n当底密尔下水道进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0818b10f-1f50-47cb-98fc-08fd21bdde78\', \'multiverseId\': 497136}, \'multiverseid\': 497136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Dimir-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'In den kalten Korridoren der Unterstadt verbreiten sich von Dämmerhülle aus Fehlinformationen wie auslaufendes Öl.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496199&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb2cff4-4199-4b40-b824-68bae896f46f\', \'multiverseId\': 496199}, \'multiverseid\': 496199}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'En los fríos corredores de la subciudad, la desinformación desde Mantoscuro se extiende como una mancha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'699e6a6c-c810-4bf7-a4f3-7e4ba8305454\', \'multiverseId\': 496333}, \'multiverseid\': 496333}, {\'name\': \'Porte de la guilde de Dimir\', \'text\': \'La Porte de la guilde de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': "Dans les couloirs froids de la Citerraine, la mésinformation s\'épand telle une tache autour de Manteaubrune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b02a43-346c-4b03-a28d-0fd8fda7bcee\', \'multiverseId\': 496467}, \'multiverseid\': 496467}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': "Nei freddi tunnel della città sepolta, le false notizie si diffondono da Mantoscuro come macchie d\'olio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8717ca09-1ae5-481a-b762-d41a36bb77d3\', \'multiverseId\': 496601}, \'multiverseid\': 496601}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのギルド門\', \'text\': \'ディミーアのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'地下の寒い回廊で、ダスクマントルからの誤報が染みのように伝播し、広がっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a5105b-bebd-4292-9bf1-3606ac0ae517\', \'multiverseId\': 496735}, \'multiverseid\': 496735}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Nos frios corredores do submundo, a desinformação alastra-se de Manto do Crepúsculo como uma doença.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'784228ce-8007-4907-85a0-c89fb6ffe862\', \'multiverseId\': 496869}, \'multiverseid\': 496869}, {\'name\': \'Врата Гильдии Димиров\', \'text\': \'Врата Гильдии Димиров выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Врата\', \'flavor\': \'В холодных коридорах подземного города байки и вымыслы растекаются из Мантии Сумрака, словно пятно грязи.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7990431c-fc1e-47c5-9d5e-2a03cc87fc38\', \'multiverseId\': 497003}, \'multiverseid\': 497003}, {\'name\': \'底密尔公会门\', \'text\': \'底密尔公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地 ～门\', \'flavor\': \'伪造迷讯自暮篷始发，藉由地底城的寒冷走廊四处传播，有如污迹向外扩散。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8e89af-8a0e-407b-b608-f81cad2e2bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 497137}, \'multiverseid\': 497137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Medaillon\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, opfere das Dimir-Medaillon: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Trage dies und nimm deinen Platz in den Schatten ein — weise, tödlich und unsichtbar."\\n—Ivrelya, Dimir-Meisterspionin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496183&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe246edd-e41d-4020-8752-6be58a1fd278\', \'multiverseId\': 496183}, \'multiverseid\': 496183}, {\'name\': \'Relicario dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, sacrificar el Relicario dimir: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Lleva esto y ocupa tu lugar entre las sombras: inteligente, letal e invisible".\\n—Ivrelya, maestra de espías dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7820ad19-2a04-4d13-89e6-893559c2efb5\', \'multiverseId\': 496317}, \'multiverseid\': 496317}, {\'name\': \'Médaillon de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, sacrifiez le Médaillon de Dimir : Piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Portez-le, et prenez place parmi les ombres pour une vie sage, létale et invisible. »\\n—Ivrelya, maîtresse-espionne de Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa12561-793e-431a-928c-4419e19dc662\', \'multiverseId\': 496451}, \'multiverseid\': 496451}, {\'name\': \'Medaglione Dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, Sacrifica il Medaglione Dimir: Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Indossalo e reclama il tuo posto tra le ombre: sii saggio, letale e invisibile."\\n—Ivrelya, capospia Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b56f1d0-a6f0-4215-9c10-629cb822a413\', \'multiverseId\': 496585}, \'multiverseid\': 496585}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアのロケット\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, ディミーアのロケットを生け贄に捧げる：カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「これを着けて、影の中に身を置け。賢く、殺人的に、そして人目に触れないように。」\\n――ディミーアの密偵長、イヴレーリャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff28399-7971-4d70-89dc-eacfe0345338\', \'multiverseId\': 496719}, \'multiverseid\': 496719}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão Dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, sacrifique Medalhão Dimir: Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Use isto, e tome seu lugar entre as sombras, sábias, letais, ocultas."\\n— Ivrelya, espiã-mestre Dimir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'078388d2-da4a-4c30-bc38-a62194d8b7c1\', \'multiverseId\': 496853}, \'multiverseid\': 496853}, {\'name\': \'Медальон Димиров\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Медальон Димиров: возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Носи его и займи свое место среди теней — мудрый, смертоносный и невидимый».\\n— Иврелия, верховная шпионка Димиров\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8562e55-3346-441c-aede-aedf9b477357\', \'multiverseId\': 496987}, \'multiverseid\': 496987}, {\'name\': \'底密尔坠饰\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}或{B}。\\n{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}{U/B}，{T}，牺牲底密尔坠饰：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「戴上此物，与阴影同行～机敏、致命、隐密。」\\n～底密尔间谍大师依蕾娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4c91918-92f0-4a69-a311-db1c10c6e124\', \'multiverseId\': 497121}, \'multiverseid\': 497121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Symbol der Dimir bekommen nur die eigenen Mitglieder als Erkennungszeichen der geheimen Gilde zu sehen — und die Verdammten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496184&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d60435-1bb9-45f0-9a1b-41a1814e5515\', \'multiverseId\': 496184}, \'multiverseid\': 496184}, {\'name\': \'Sello dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Como emblema de un gremio secreto, la insignia dimir solo la conocen sus propios miembros... y los condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d7e4ea-1839-4c27-a38e-81a516d40cf7\', \'multiverseId\': 496318}, \'multiverseid\': 496318}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'insigne de Dimir est l\'emblème d\'une guilde secrète, et seuls ses membres le voient — ses membres, mais aussi ses victimes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea55d34-1f3d-4d1f-a4fa-186d453b2530\', \'multiverseId\': 496452}, \'multiverseid\': 496452}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema di una gilda segreta, le insegne dei Dimir possono essere viste solo dai suoi membri e da coloro che sono condannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8eef327-e11e-4d77-89c6-554ee9f7952a\', \'multiverseId\': 496586}, \'multiverseid\': 496586}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち、そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1edfc999-741f-4e8b-ba64-6ece8dddfbff\', \'multiverseId\': 496720}, \'multiverseid\': 496720}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema de uma guilda secreta, a insígnia Dimir só é vista por seus próprios membros — e pelos condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50ba6ceb-bfc0-415c-891a-c59ac48ad151\', \'multiverseId\': 496854}, \'multiverseid\': 496854}, {\'name\': \'Печать Димиров\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Будучи эмблемой тайной гильдии, печать Димиров открыта только ее членам. И обреченным.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558b6229-6656-4b98-ba88-1b67801aa702\', \'multiverseId\': 496988}, \'multiverseid\': 496988}, {\'name\': \'底密尔印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'秘密存在的底密尔公会，其徽记没有外人见过～除了手底亡魂之外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bdef8d3-e601-498b-ae30-54bcdadf4fac\', \'multiverseId\': 497122}, \'multiverseid\': 497122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Runenschlüssel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\\n{U}{B}: Der Dimir-Runenschlüssel wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 blauen und schwarzen Schrecken-Artefaktkreatur und kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Schlüssel, der in jedes Schloss schlüpft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496182&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c44ea57-dd06-46c1-bbf7-3fad9ff4372e\', \'multiverseId\': 496182}, \'multiverseid\': 496182}, {\'name\': \'Llave rúnica dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\\n{U}{B}: La Llave rúnica dimir se convierte en una criatura artefacto Horror azul y negra 2/2 hasta el final del turno y no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Una llave que encaja en todas las cerraduras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f673951f-4a14-4228-a3f1-d786a9ce6e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 496316}, \'multiverseid\': 496316}, {\'name\': \'Runeclé de Dimir\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\\n{U}{B} : La Runeclé de Dimir devient une créature-artefact 2/2 bleue et noire Horreur jusqu\'à la fin du tour et ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Une clé qui se glisse dans toutes les serrures.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4c18d45-760c-4de3-b586-7cdb85244db1\', \'multiverseId\': 496450}, \'multiverseid\': 496450}, {\'name\': \'Runachiave Dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.\\n{U}{B}: La Runachiave Dimir diventa una creatura artefatto Orrore 2/2 blu e nera fino alla fine del turno e non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Una chiave adatta a ogni serratura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b87602-64a1-4247-98e3-2c6ac9852490\', \'multiverseId\': 496584}, \'multiverseid\': 496584}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの魔鍵\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\\n{U}{B}：ターン終了時まで、ディミーアの魔鍵は青であり黒である２/２のホラー・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。このターン、これはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'あらゆる錠をすり抜ける鍵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6bce7d-640f-4b23-a8c7-f021d665c5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 496718}, \'multiverseid\': 496718}, {\'name\': \'Chave Rúnica Dimir\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\\n{U}{B}: Chave Rúnica Dimir torna-se uma criatura artefato azul e preta 2/2 do tipo Horror até o final do turno e não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma chave que entra em qualquer fechadura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a07fb7b4-099a-4114-a7a1-4bba7eef1181\', \'multiverseId\': 496852}, \'multiverseid\': 496852}, {\'name\': \'Рунный Ключ Димиров\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\\n{U}{B}: Рунный Ключ Димиров становится артефактом существом 2/2 синий и черный Ужас до конца хода и не может быть заблокирован в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Этот ключ проскользнет в любой замок.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2095b51-9858-44db-8391-255064bf142b\', \'multiverseId\': 496986}, \'multiverseid\': 496986}, {\'name\': \'底密尔符镇兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}或{B}。\\n{U}{B}：底密尔符镇兵成为2/2，蓝黑双色的惊惧兽神器生物直到回合结束，且本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'一把无锁不能开的钥匙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6dfa852-4f26-4b73-8f9e-9d982a291f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 497120}, \'multiverseid\': 497120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dolch aus Flüsterstahl\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du in diesem Zug einen Kreaturenzauber aus dem Friedhof des Spielers wirken, und um ihn zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e13dd47-8811-4327-810e-54ecdd94cb14\', \'multiverseId\': 495903}, \'multiverseid\': 495903}, {\'name\': \'Daga de acero susurrante\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes lanzar un hechizo de criatura desde el cementerio de ese jugador este turno y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar ese hechizo.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f547bfbd-5a34-4711-8c79-4969c763c985\', \'multiverseId\': 495909}, \'multiverseid\': 495909}, {\'name\': \'Dague de murmacier\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez lancer un sort de créature depuis le cimetière de ce joueur ce tour-ci, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6b3c47-61f5-4265-8556-57b633fd9c91\', \'multiverseId\': 495915}, \'multiverseid\': 495915}, {\'name\': \'Pugnale di Mormoracciaio\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi lanciare una magia creatura dal cimitero di quel giocatore in questo turno e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ee21c2-4299-4156-abd3-af7edb033a26\', \'multiverseId\': 495921}, \'multiverseid\': 495921}, {\'name\': \'囁き鋼の短剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、このターン、あなたはそのプレイヤーの墓地からクリーチャー・呪文１つを、その呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払って唱えてもよい。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bcec27c-9422-4f86-a77d-29bbd68b6f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 495927}, \'multiverseid\': 495927}, {\'name\': \'Adaga de Aço Sussurrante\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode conjurar uma mágica de criatura do cemitério daquele jogador neste turno, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquela mágica.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae879c4-0b1d-4d97-b160-b9036d965e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 495933}, \'multiverseid\': 495933}, {\'name\': \'Кинжал Шепчущей Стали\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете разыграть заклинание существа из кладбища того игрока в этом ходу и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого цвета.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c3434f-9b10-4156-ae9f-0c234c932fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 495939}, \'multiverseid\': 495939}, {\'name\': \'幽钢匕首\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，本回合中你可以从该牌手的坟墓场施放一个生物咒语，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b83394-1183-498f-afdf-564446e8d5ed\', \'multiverseId\': 495945}, \'multiverseid\': 495945}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a65df4e-7552-4f3b-acfe-65b9e31f2d06\', \'multiverseId\': 496204}, \'multiverseid\': 496204}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la jungla\', \'text\': \'El Altar de la jungla entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Naya, la ambición y la traición no son corrientes, llevadas casi a la extinción por la veneración a los dioses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1943d0-8e85-4d95-9cf3-f665debcb395\', \'multiverseId\': 496338}, \'multiverseid\': 496338}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les a presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2074b81f-fd7e-4e01-8684-53c61f6cb5de\', \'multiverseId\': 496472}, \'multiverseid\': 496472}, {\'name\': \'Santuario nella Giungla\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "In Naya, l\'ambizione e il tradimento sono rari, cacciati quasi fino all\'estinzione dal timore reverenziale dimostrato verso gli dei terreni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2375c18e-0099-4f47-a27d-430ff2314577\', \'multiverseId\': 496606}, \'multiverseid\': 496606}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf44d227-1368-4459-b776-aad51f9a5379\', \'multiverseId\': 496740}, \'multiverseid\': 496740}, {\'name\': \'Sacrário da Selva\', \'text\': \'Sacrário da Selva entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}, {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Naya, a ambição e a traição são raras, pois foram caçadas até sua extinção pelo respeito devido aos deuses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d864d14-c5b0-4ca4-8464-ed83055ae827\', \'multiverseId\': 496874}, \'multiverseid\': 496874}, {\'name\': \'Святыня Джунглей\', \'text\': \'Святыня Джунглей выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}, {G} или {W}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'На Найе редко встречаются честолюбие и предательство, доведенные до грани исчезновения благоговейным страхом пред земными богами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfb912e-9422-4f13-ac7d-a64c4a45e6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 497008}, \'multiverseid\': 497008}, {\'name\': \'丛林祭祠\', \'text\': \'丛林祭祠须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}，{G}或{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'野心与背叛在纳雅并不常见，早已被对现世神明的崇敬猎捕得近乎灭绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb24a7e-4fdd-4dd4-a4a6-e1c9f8f7ed75\', \'multiverseId\': 497142}, \'multiverseid\': 497142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsteres Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\\nWenn das Düstere Urwesen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus dessen Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83839227-4d65-45d4-81a9-4d1cd0700c98\', \'multiverseId\': 496126}, \'multiverseid\': 496126}, {\'name\': \'Primordial sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\\nCuando el Primordial sepulcral entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, puedes poner en el campo de batalla bajo tu control hasta una carta de criatura objetivo del cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c55bb72-e9c3-43bb-9b44-1ae11ee8cb8a\', \'multiverseId\': 496260}, \'multiverseid\': 496260}, {\'name\': \'Primordial sépulcral\', \'text\': "Intimidation (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\\nQuand le Primordial sépulcral arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée du cimetière de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d56370-97ea-47bf-919c-e5866d49549c\', \'multiverseId\': 496394}, \'multiverseid\': 496394}, {\'name\': \'Primordiale Sepolcrale\', \'text\': \'Intimidire (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\\nQuando il Primordiale Sepolcrale entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo fino a una carta creatura bersaglio dal cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d0776eb-a33c-4e9e-996d-91aac9a488e2\', \'multiverseId\': 496528}, \'multiverseid\': 496528}, {\'name\': \'陰鬱の始源体\', \'text\': \'威嚇（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクト・クリーチャーやこれと共通の色を持つクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\\n陰鬱の始源体が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それらをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682a866a-5cd4-4c7f-b376-f507c55b296e\', \'multiverseId\': 496662}, \'multiverseid\': 496662}, {\'name\': \'Primordial Sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Intimidar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilhem uma cor com ela.)\\nQuando Primordial Sepulcral entra no campo de batalha, para cada oponente, você pode colocar até um card de criatura alvo do cemitério daquele jogador no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36923d68-d4b6-46ce-b007-e14768fbc09e\', \'multiverseId\': 496796}, \'multiverseid\': 496796}, {\'name\': \'Первородный Дух Погребения\', \'text\': \'Устрашение (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактами существами и/или существами, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\\nКогда Первородный Дух Погребения выходит на поле битвы, для каждого оппонента вы можете положить не более одной целевой карты существа из кладбища того игрока на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74a192d-5ef5-4509-8f83-4ca3134e72be\', \'multiverseId\': 496930}, \'multiverseid\': 496930}, {\'name\': \'阴森原祖\', \'text\': \'威吓（此生物只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）\\n当阴森原祖进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～你可以将至多一张目标生物牌在你的操控下从该牌手的坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3f8613-dcb8-4017-87e7-10664aeb6e9f\', \'multiverseId\': 497064}, \'multiverseid\': 497064}]', "[{'name': 'Elfischer Verjüngerer', 'text': 'Wenn der Elfische Verjüngerer ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496135&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9aa97421-a813-4104-8810-7d8e6b77c47e', 'multiverseId': 496135}, 'multiverseid': 496135}, {'name': 'Elfo rejuvenecedor', 'text': 'Cuando el Elfo rejuvenecedor entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496269&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd5c66dd-0447-4c2f-a533-d0a484624df5', 'multiverseId': 496269}, 'multiverseid': 496269}, {'name': 'Rajeunisseur elfe', 'text': 'Quand le Rajeunisseur elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496403&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2d9ed85-f7ad-4fda-8a9c-d1fb842cc00d', 'multiverseId': 496403}, 'multiverseid': 496403}, {'name': 'Rinvigoritore Elfico', 'text': 'Quando il Rinvigoritore Elfico entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere una carta terra scelta tra esse sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496537&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7aac300-86e6-4d7f-a90b-e77aa147dde3', 'multiverseId': 496537}, 'multiverseid': 496537}, {'name': 'エルフの再生者', 'text': 'エルフの再生者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0634e22-fee0-47a7-ae16-da70b74a8672', 'multiverseId': 496671}, 'multiverseid': 496671}, {'name': 'Rejuvenescedor Élfico', 'text': 'Quando Rejuvenescedor Élfico entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de terreno dentre eles no campo de batalha virado. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Druida', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496805&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '821001fe-0132-419e-940f-ea5f28e2ef02', 'multiverseId': 496805}, 'multiverseid': 496805}, {'name': 'Эльфийский Омолодитель', 'text': 'Когда Эльфийский Омолодитель выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту земли на поле битвы повернутой. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.', 'type': 'Существо — Эльф Друид', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496939&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b61372a-15ab-402b-8359-9fa88d9f9180', 'multiverseId': 496939}, 'multiverseid': 496939}, {'name': '回春妖精', 'text': '当回春妖精进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以将其中的一张地牌横置放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497073&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a8dcad5-7b3d-4f53-99e7-67c341c5b2ff', 'multiverseId': 497073}, 'multiverseid': 497073}]", '[{\'name\': \'Emerias Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Erde erbebt, wird es im Himmel voll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496087&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9841b6-fbca-4849-9665-18639d881ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 496087}, \'multiverseid\': 496087}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando la tierra tiembla, el cielo desborda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d23b66-23f5-4686-bd34-34bd65013b85\', \'multiverseId\': 496221}, \'multiverseid\': 496221}, {\'name\': "Ange d\'Éméria", \'text\': "Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la terre tremble, le ciel déborde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496355&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51299d6f-fded-4be7-a9f2-bfd49fe4bac4\', \'multiverseId\': 496355}, \'multiverseid\': 496355}, {\'name\': \'Angelo di Emeria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi creare una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la terra freme, il cielo straripa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09de6c8-f145-4885-b9f2-81ca50bd7f65\', \'multiverseId\': 496489}, \'multiverseid\': 496489}, {\'name\': \'エメリアの天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'地が震えるとき、空は溢れ返る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc92424-df68-431a-9ff3-d0b868f917be\', \'multiverseId\': 496623}, \'multiverseid\': 496623}, {\'name\': \'Anjo de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Ave com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a terra estremece, o céu transborda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c34f10d0-af19-49a0-bb46-6525a330a0fd\', \'multiverseId\': 496757}, \'multiverseid\': 496757}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Эмерии\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете создать одну фишку существа 1/1 белая Птица с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Когда содрогается земля, переполняется небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0113e4d6-b40f-4dd4-b757-4615e57da0a5\', \'multiverseId\': 496891}, \'multiverseid\': 496891}, {\'name\': \'伊美黎天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'当大地颤动，天空便将充溢。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083a476e-369b-44dc-86ca-fcfb22412f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 497025}, \'multiverseid\': 497025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emerias Hirtin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, aus deinem Friedhof zurück auf deine Hand bringen. Falls das Land eine Ebene ist, kannst du die bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist, stattdessen zurück ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63acb0c-b275-4aa8-a48c-6bb392d6b2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 496088}, \'multiverseid\': 496088}, {\'name\': \'Pastora de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes regresar de tu cementerio a tu mano la carta de permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Si esa tierra es una Llanura, en vez de eso, puedes regresar al campo de batalla esa carta de permanente que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d83bd0d-082a-435f-8bf8-7be893003d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 496222}, \'multiverseid\': 496222}, {\'name\': "Bergère d\'Éméria", \'text\': "Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de permanent non-terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Si ce terrain est une plaine, vous pouvez renvoyer cette carte de permanent non-terrain sur le champ de bataille à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd3cf62b-9b12-4802-b1f4-c7498b443e90\', \'multiverseId\': 496356}, \'multiverseid\': 496356}, {\'name\': \'Pastore di Emeria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi riprendere in mano una carta permanente non terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se quella terra è una Pianura, puoi invece rimettere quella carta permanente non terra sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffdd02db-0d69-41bf-b0bc-6d89cd9085b8\', \'multiverseId\': 496490}, \'multiverseid\': 496490}, {\'name\': \'エメリアの番人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの墓地から土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。その土地が平地であるなら、あなたはその土地でないパーマネント・カードを代わりに戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56f302e-34a3-4888-bf7b-9bfadac35fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 496624}, \'multiverseid\': 496624}, {\'name\': \'Pastora de Emeria\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode devolver o card de permanente alvo que não seja um terreno de seu cemitério para sua mão. Se aquele terreno for uma Planície, você pode, em vez disso, devolver aquele card de permanente que não seja um terreno para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7967ec9-29a6-459b-99a1-3f8521133ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 496758}, \'multiverseid\': 496758}, {\'name\': \'Пастырь Эмерии\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете вернуть целевую не являющуюся землей карту перманента из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Если та земля является Равниной, вы можете вместо этого вернуть ту не являющуюся землей карту перманента на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d3afe0-9b85-44a0-9988-900011d3a2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 496892}, \'multiverseid\': 496892}, {\'name\': \'伊美黎牧者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将目标非地永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。若该地是平原，则你可以改为将该非地永久物牌移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1547cd0c-ce4b-40a1-862d-6f131fb6167d\', \'multiverseId\': 497026}, \'multiverseid\': 497026}]', '[{\'name\': \'Enigma-Diebin\', \'text\': \'Beutezug {3}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Beutezugkosten wirken, falls du einem Gegner in diesem Zug mit einer Sphinx oder einem Räuber Kampfschaden zugefügt hast.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn die Enigma-Diebin ins Spiel kommt, bringe für jeden Gegner bis zu eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die jener Spieler kontrolliert, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2003791b-e8ff-4bc9-9dce-3b7a70eba9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 495902}, \'multiverseid\': 495902}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge ladrona\', \'text\': \'Rondar {3}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de rondar si hiciste daño de combate a un oponente con una Esfinge o un Bribón este turno.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando la Esfinge ladrona entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, regresa hasta un permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla ese jugador a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9120c4-5f2a-480a-ae79-f1f92a2a4672\', \'multiverseId\': 495908}, \'multiverseid\': 495908}, {\'name\': \'Voleur du logogriphe\', \'text\': "Incursion {3}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'incursion si vous avez infligé des blessures de combat à un adversaire ce tour-ci avec un sphinx ou un gredin.)\\nVol\\nQuand le Voleur du logogriphe arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, renvoyez jusqu\'à un permanent non-terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e5a6cc-9759-4d17-80ec-88a5813c1e34\', \'multiverseId\': 495914}, \'multiverseid\': 495914}, {\'name\': \'Ladro Enigmatico\', \'text\': \'Predatore {3}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di predatore se hai inflitto danno da combattimento a un avversario con una Sfinge o un Farabutto in questo turno.)\\nVolare\\nQuando il Ladro Enigmatico entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, fai tornare fino a un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e6a4df-7753-481c-918d-de1a159a4c96\', \'multiverseId\': 495920}, \'multiverseid\': 495920}, {\'name\': \'謎の盗人\', \'text\': \'徘徊{3}{U}（このターン、あなたがスフィンクスかならず者によって対戦相手に戦闘ダメージを与えているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれの徘徊コストで唱えてもよい。）\\n飛行\\n謎の盗人が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント最大１つを対象とする。それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ab0361-d8e7-4411-b50d-09acac872fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 495926}, \'multiverseid\': 495926}, {\'name\': \'Ladra Enigmática\', \'text\': \'Espreitar {3}{U} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de espreitar se você causou dano de combate a um oponente neste turno com uma Esfinge ou um Ladino.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Ladra Enigmática entrar no campo de batalha, para cada oponente, devolva até uma permanente alvo que não seja um terreno que aquele jogador controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd34a182-5ba3-4a09-b698-4229b486c359\', \'multiverseId\': 495932}, \'multiverseid\': 495932}, {\'name\': \'Похититель Загадок\', \'text\': \'Мародерство {3}{U} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Мародерства, если в этом ходу вы нанесли оппоненту боевые повреждения с помощью Сфинкса или Бродяги.)\\nПолет\\nКогда Похититель Загадок выходит на поле битвы, за каждого оппонента верните не более одного целевого не являющегося землей перманента под контролем того игрока в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914c7da9-76a8-4829-90b8-18ccd668c413\', \'multiverseId\': 495938}, \'multiverseid\': 495938}, {\'name\': \'窃谜史芬斯\', \'text\': \'伺机{3}{U}（如果你本回合中曾以史芬斯或浪客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害，则你可以支付此咒语的伺机费用来施放它。）\\n飞行\\n当窃谜史芬斯进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～将至多一个目标由该牌手操控的非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e6b142-c5ae-4155-946b-56396b2bc13d\', \'multiverseId\': 495944}, \'multiverseid\': 495944}]', "[{'name': 'Ergiebigmacher', 'text': 'Der Ergiebigmacher kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{1}{G}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Ergiebigmacher: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl durchsucht seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringt sie getappt ins Spiel und mischt dann seine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496139&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9982a9a0-9a85-4003-aa85-838ad3b352df', 'multiverseId': 496139}, 'multiverseid': 496139}, {'name': 'Fertílido', 'text': 'El Fertílido entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\n{1}{G}, remover un contador +1/+1 del Fertílido: El jugador objetivo busca en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, la pone en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja su biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496273&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31ae7a7e-01c6-4379-bf52-8d3ab7eeed41', 'multiverseId': 496273}, 'multiverseid': 496273}, {'name': 'Fertilide', 'text': 'Le Fertilide arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{1}{G}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Fertilide : Le joueur ciblé cherche dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la met sur le champ de bataille engagée, et mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496407&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3c4b437-fcde-43cb-8405-1ff6891ae7e4', 'multiverseId': 496407}, 'multiverseid': 496407}, {'name': 'Fertilid', 'text': 'Il Fertilid entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\n{1}{G}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dal Fertilid: Un giocatore bersaglio passa in rassegna il suo grimorio per una carta terra base, la mette sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il suo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496541&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6daa5ea9-5613-46f9-9714-7f71efdea180', 'multiverseId': 496541}, 'multiverseid': 496541}, {'name': 'ファーティリド', 'text': 'ファーティリドは、＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}{G}, ファーティリドの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後自分のライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cf49753-63b6-4802-9995-fa7627b1cd3e', 'multiverseId': 496675}, 'multiverseid': 496675}, {'name': 'Fertilídio', 'text': 'Fertilídio entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.\\n{1}{G}, remova um marcador +1/+1 de Fertilídio: O jogador alvo procura no próprio grimório um card de terreno básico, coloca-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralha o próprio grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496809&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44c57eaa-9266-4d2c-b475-19988cbb35ec', 'multiverseId': 496809}, 'multiverseid': 496809}, {'name': 'Фертилид', 'text': 'Фертилид выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\\n{1}{G}, удалите один жетон +1/+1 с Фертилида: целевой игрок находит в своей библиотеке карту базовой земли, кладет ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем тасует свою библиотеку.', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496943&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70270b43-62c3-4e9b-b80c-60ad406bb1af', 'multiverseId': 496943}, 'multiverseid': 496943}, {'name': '沃壤灵', 'text': '沃壤灵进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{G}，从沃壤灵上移去一个+1/+1指示物：目标牌手从其牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将其牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497077&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92b9bce7-6430-4fc1-844f-cc80f69026bf', 'multiverseId': 497077}, 'multiverseid': 497077}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erweckerin der Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}: Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Das Land wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Feinde mögen uns zahlenmäßig überlegen sein, doch nicht den Bäumen des Dschungels und den Wellen des Meeres."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496158&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d87bae-01ff-40ff-a629-9c7768449869\', \'multiverseId\': 496158}, \'multiverseid\': 496158}, {\'name\': \'Despertadora de lo salvaje\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}: Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas. Esa tierra se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestros enemigos son muchos y poderosos, pero no tantos como los árboles ni tan poderosos como el mar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f4e379-19e9-44ef-acd2-337f89edd96f\', \'multiverseId\': 496292}, \'multiverseid\': 496292}, {\'name\': \'Éveilleuse des étendues sauvages\', \'text\': "{X}{G}{G} : Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez. Ce terrain devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Nos ennemis sont puissants et nombreux, mais loin d\'être aussi nombreux que les arbres, ou aussi puissants que la mer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60fd3d1-e4fd-4ae7-be36-0f454eecbde2\', \'multiverseId\': 496426}, \'multiverseid\': 496426}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliatrice delle Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}: Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli. Quella terra diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri nemici sono numerosi e potenti, ma non numerosi come gli alberi, né potenti come il mare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ec5979-71ff-48ce-89b3-e381a953a708\', \'multiverseId\': 496560}, \'multiverseid\': 496560}, {\'name\': \'原野を目覚めさせる者\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}：あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。その土地は、速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちの敵は多く、また強い。だが、木々より多くはなく、海より強くもない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8218396e-d5f1-4996-b270-28e93bf05bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 496694}, \'multiverseid\': 496694}, {\'name\': \'Despertadora das Forças Selvagens\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}: Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla. Aquele terreno se torna uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossos inimigos são muitos e poderosos, mas não tantos quanto as árvores nem tão poderosos quanto o mar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0dac92-c9c2-45ff-81aa-d6ab530c6020\', \'multiverseId\': 496828}, \'multiverseid\': 496828}, {\'name\': \'Пробуждающая Дебри\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}: положите X жетонов +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем. Та земля становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши враги многочисленны и сильны, но они не так многочисленны, как деревья, и не так сильны, как морская стихия».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d877a12a-a610-4bff-aab2-6e52406009a9\', \'multiverseId\': 496962}, \'multiverseid\': 496962}, {\'name\': \'蛮荒醒眠师\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}：在目标由你操控的地上放置X个+1/+1指示物。该地成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「敌人虽众，但比不过丛林繁木；对手虽强，但比不过大海汪洋。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e24f5bac-ad94-465c-bd34-352d6b80f287\', \'multiverseId\': 497096}, \'multiverseid\': 497096}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf die Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen legen.\\nEntferne drei Quest-Marken von der Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen und opfere sie: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe11fcc6-65c5-43de-bb0c-5d14c62cce27\', \'multiverseId\': 496144}, \'multiverseid\': 496144}, {\'name\': \'Expedición al Corazón de Khalni\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni.\\nRemover tres contadores de búsqueda de la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni y sacrificarla: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b55a18-c04f-43cf-ac7c-c6017575d3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 496278}, \'multiverseid\': 496278}, {\'name\': \'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni.\\nRetirez trois marqueurs « quête » de l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni et sacrifiez-la : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'925381a5-8e10-4e45-b1ba-42e3a41a575e\', \'multiverseId\': 496412}, \'multiverseid\': 496412}, {\'name\': \'Spedizione al Cuore Khalni\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi mettere un segnalino ricerca sulla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni.\\nRimuovi tre segnalini ricerca dalla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni e sacrificala: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98eeb85-65c2-4379-9d34-407bf00e86c4\', \'multiverseId\': 496546}, \'multiverseid\': 496546}, {\'name\': \'カルニの心臓の探検\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカルニの心臓の探検の上に探索カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\nカルニの心臓の探検の上から探索カウンターを３個取り除き、これを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7201e4-c4dc-4325-811e-6e188defb6e7\', \'multiverseId\': 496680}, \'multiverseid\': 496680}, {\'name\': \'Expedição ao Coração de Khalni\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode colocar um marcador de busca em Expedição ao Coração de Khalni.\\nRemova três marcadores de busca de Expedição ao Coração de Khalni e sacrifique-o: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa450cc-6b25-4f9b-8dd1-cc147d5dda4e\', \'multiverseId\': 496814}, \'multiverseid\': 496814}, {\'name\': \'Экспедиция к Сердцу Кални\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете положить один жетон странствий на Экспедицию к Сердцу Кални.\\nУдалите три жетона странствий с Экспедиции к Сердцу Кални и пожертвуйте ее: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1363a460-a3f0-4d0b-8b1f-3bcdb77747f7\', \'multiverseId\': 496948}, \'multiverseid\': 496948}, {\'name\': \'坎尼之心探险\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以在坎尼之心探险上放置一个探索指示物。\\n从坎尼之心探险上移去三个探索指示物并牺牲它：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb794af-8c0a-49d8-858b-08260bc57941\', \'multiverseId\': 497082}, \'multiverseid\': 497082}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm die Karten des einen Haufens auf deine Hand und lege die anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Tu wenigstens so, als ob du verstündest, was wichtig ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d7b54d-4da3-48d9-bb88-a44d07301ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 496097}, \'multiverseid\': 496097}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Intenta fingir que entiendes lo que es importante".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c6077e-ca1a-4ff1-93f0-67bd3c51f424\', \'multiverseId\': 496231}, \'multiverseid\': 496231}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Fais au moins semblant de suivre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496365&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78919c39-0ba0-45de-bac8-91c5ea0f15ae\', \'multiverseId\': 496365}, \'multiverseid\': 496365}, {\'name\': \'Certezza o Finzione\', \'text\': "Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerca di far finta di capire cosa è importante."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7713367e-1727-4756-a801-409476faeb62\', \'multiverseId\': 496499}, \'multiverseid\': 496499}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「何が重要かわかっているふりでもするがいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43b3efc4-f53e-4f45-bfb2-2b6217189926\', \'multiverseId\': 496633}, \'multiverseid\': 496633}, {\'name\': \'Fato ou Ficção\', \'text\': \'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Um oponente separa aqueles cards em dois montes. Você coloca um monte na própria mão e o outro no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tente fingir que entende o que é importante."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6e7b2d-4628-4f27-a862-62c4e51d5d21\', \'multiverseId\': 496767}, \'multiverseid\': 496767}, {\'name\': \'Факт или Вымысел\', \'text\': \'Покажите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Оппонент делит те карты на две стопки. Положите одну стопку в вашу руку, а другую — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Постарайся сделать вид, будто ты понимаешь, что важно, а что нет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c487fa8-68d7-4a1e-938d-651411d05081\', \'multiverseId\': 496901}, \'multiverseid\': 496901}, {\'name\': \'真伪莫辨\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「就试着假装你知道什么比较重要好了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d376de27-2c3c-463e-a313-44d681a9b335\', \'multiverseId\': 497035}, \'multiverseid\': 497035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Vandale\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Feen-Vandalen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte mag von den Siegern geschrieben werden, aber sie wird häufig von den Störenfrieden umgeschrieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'885545fc-49b7-42e7-bf4e-59e6ae105634\', \'multiverseId\': 496098}, \'multiverseid\': 496098}, {\'name\': \'Vándalo hada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Vándalo hada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que la historia la escriban los vencedores, pero suelen reescribirla los agitadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a31c5da-5294-4122-8e0d-08975e1c17a2\', \'multiverseId\': 496232}, \'multiverseid\': 496232}, {\'name\': \'Vandale faerie\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Vandale faerie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': "L\'Histoire est peut-être écrite par les vainqueurs, mais elle est souvent réécrite par les fauteurs de troubles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496366&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f31211f9-a520-43d4-a4c0-9411b80f0489\', \'multiverseId\': 496366}, \'multiverseid\': 496366}, {\'name\': \'Spiritello Vandalo\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sullo Spiritello Vandalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'La storia sarà scritta dai trionfatori, ma spesso viene riscritta dai seccatori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd209297-aa5b-42fa-a6e2-5d3d524705f5\', \'multiverseId\': 496500}, \'multiverseid\': 496500}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの荒らし屋\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nあなたが各ターンのあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、フェアリーの荒らし屋の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は勝者によって綴られるというが、厄介な者に書き換えられることも多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252a0a0c-415c-41e4-b1df-bc4bd579dc83\', \'multiverseId\': 496634}, \'multiverseid\': 496634}, {\'name\': \'Vândalo Fada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nToda vez que você comprar seu segundo card a cada turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Vândalo Fada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'A história pode ser escrita pelos vencedores, mas é frequentemente reescrita pelos encrenqueiros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7382c9-4c8f-4421-9d6d-c2b9c91a4f72\', \'multiverseId\': 496768}, \'multiverseid\': 496768}, {\'name\': \'Фея-Вандал\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете вашу вторую карту в каждом ходу, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Фею-Вандала.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Историю пишет победитель, а хулиганы зачастую переписывают.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bfa97db-a95a-4ce0-8d8d-e0d13b48767f\', \'multiverseId\': 496902}, \'multiverseid\': 496902}, {\'name\': \'莽撞仙灵\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在莽撞仙灵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'虽然历史由胜利者写就，但却经常会被捣乱者改写。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16feeaaa-2b11-4642-99a9-84d75e8056fe\', \'multiverseId\': 497036}, \'multiverseid\': 497036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ferne Melodie\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Ziehe für jede bleibende Karte dieses Typs, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Oonas Gesang klingt wie ein pervertierter Essensgong. Alle Feen kehren heim, doch nur Oona schlemmt — sie genießt die gestohlenen Träume und Gerüchte, die ihr aufgetischt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5980747e-ae37-419a-986c-c5a2fd3a2ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 496096}, \'multiverseid\': 496096}, {\'name\': \'Melodía distante\', \'text\': \'Elige un tipo de criatura. Roba una carta por cada permanente que controlas de ese tipo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La canción de Oona es como una retorcida campanilla de cena. Todas las hadas regresan a casa, pero solo Oona disfruta el festín de los sueños robados y rumores que le sirven.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415b48c6-d620-4228-8f90-4461851fdfdd\', \'multiverseId\': 496230}, \'multiverseid\': 496230}, {\'name\': \'Mélodie lointaine\', \'text\': \'Choisissez un type de créature. Piochez une carte pour chaque permanent de ce type que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le chant d\'Oona invite au dîner. Toutes les færies rentrent au bercail, mais c\'est Oona qui festoie des rêves et des rumeurs qu\'elles lui rapportent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496364&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8257dbb-9503-4344-aa9b-727d411d0d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 496364}, \'multiverseid\': 496364}, {\'name\': \'Melodia Lontana\', \'text\': \'Scegli un tipo di creatura. Pesca una carta per ogni permanente che controlli del tipo scelto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La canzone di Oona assomiglia a uno strano campanello per la cena. Tutti gli spiritelli tornano a casa, ma è Oona che banchetta... con i sogni rubati e le dicerie che le offrono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a193c15-2f9e-4842-9910-a7f55771d271\', \'multiverseId\': 496498}, \'multiverseid\': 496498}, {\'name\': \'遠くの旋律\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。あなたがコントロールしていてそのタイプを持つパーマネント１つにつきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウーナの歌は、奇妙な夕食のベルのようだ。妖精はすべて住処に帰るが、ご馳走にあずかるのはウーナ自身だ。彼らが持ってきた盗まれた夢や噂話をいただくのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e55de7-f780-47eb-8cee-a4e2c89fdf4d\', \'multiverseId\': 496632}, \'multiverseid\': 496632}, {\'name\': \'Melodia Distante\', \'text\': \'Escolha um tipo de criatura. Compre um card para cada permanente daquele tipo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A canção de Oona é como um sininho de jantar distorcido. Todas as fadas voltam para casa, mas é Oona quem se alimenta devorando os sonhos e boatos roubados que elas lhe servem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2558de6-4374-4da3-986a-e6528b2fc4d2\', \'multiverseId\': 496766}, \'multiverseid\': 496766}, {\'name\': \'Далекая Мелодия\', \'text\': \'Выберите тип существа. Возьмите одну карту за каждый находящийся под вашим контролем перманент с таким типом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Песнь Уны звенит как колокольчик, зовущий к странному обеду. Все феи возвращаются домой, но пирует одна лишь Уна, вкушая украденные сновидения и сплетни, которыми ее потчуют.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4e436f-bd7a-4211-9950-9eadab31faee\', \'multiverseId\': 496900}, \'multiverseid\': 496900}, {\'name\': \'遥远旋律\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。你每操控一个该类别的永久物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'欧娜之歌有如走调的晚餐铃声。所有仙灵都回到家中，只留下欧娜进餐，享用着他们献上的窃来眠梦与流言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37619553-650d-490f-b227-d1547bf62b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 497034}, \'multiverseid\': 497034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frühlingsblüten-Druide\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Frühlingsblüten-Druide ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land opfern. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Neues Wachstum legt einen heilenden Verband über vernarbte Wunden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496155&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe02d982-791a-48c8-a10c-e857983415cc\', \'multiverseId\': 496155}, \'multiverseid\': 496155}, {\'name\': \'Druida broteflorecedor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Druida broteflorecedor entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar una tierra. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El crecimiento de brotes nuevos es una cataplasma para heridas que llevan demasiado tiempo sin cicatrizar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c182e434-b37b-43d8-83f5-1147493b97d4\', \'multiverseId\': 496289}, \'multiverseid\': 496289}, {\'name\': \'Druide du printemps\', \'text\': "Quand le Druide du printemps arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un terrain. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« La première pousse applique un cataplasme qui soulage les plaies cicatrisées depuis longtemps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496423&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca10a504-d228-497e-96c3-d3fab355725b\', \'multiverseId\': 496423}, \'multiverseid\': 496423}, {\'name\': \'Druido dei Germogli Primaverili\', \'text\': \'Quando il Druido dei Germogli Primaverili entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare una terra. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La nuova vegetazione applica un impiastro curativo a ferite mai rimarginate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3bdd96-afb3-42df-a27e-7d219b04b21f\', \'multiverseId\': 496557}, \'multiverseid\': 496557}, {\'name\': \'春花のドルイド\', \'text\': \'春花のドルイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたは土地１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「新たなる成長が長くかさぶたになっていた傷跡を癒すのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf4cf48-4d67-4460-afd9-c0df1e2c59c5\', \'multiverseId\': 496691}, \'multiverseid\': 496691}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Florescimento\', \'text\': \'Quando Druida do Florescimento entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um terreno. Se fizer isso, procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O crescimento de novos brotos é um cataplasma para feridas há muito cicatrizadas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'734df0ef-5f70-4c5e-b6c2-2fa640b16ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 496825}, \'multiverseid\': 496825}, {\'name\': \'Друид Весеннего Роста\', \'text\': \'Когда Друид Весеннего Роста выходит на поле битвы, вы можете пожертвовать землю. Если вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Новая поросль — как целительный бальзам на давно покрывшиеся струпьями раны».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3fad66-8bd3-4342-917f-e5dbbcbb07e4\', \'multiverseId\': 496959}, \'multiverseid\': 496959}, {\'name\': \'春华德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'当春华德鲁伊进战场时，你可以牺牲一个地。若你如此作，则从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「全新生机为早已结痂的伤口涂上治疗药膏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07b7391-ac78-4854-b389-0b015b7e7c81\', \'multiverseId\': 497093}, \'multiverseid\': 497093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für immer zusammen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Für immer zusammen ins Spiel kommt, wende Beistand 2 an. (Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.)\\n{1}: Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der mindestens eine Marke liegt. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe sie auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da726135-59dc-409a-ac8b-6892ad20ecae\', \'multiverseId\': 496094}, \'multiverseid\': 496094}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para siempre\', \'text\': \'Cuando Juntos para siempre entre al campo de batalla, apoya 2. (Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.)\\n{1}: Elige una criatura objetivo que tenga un contador sobre ella. Cuando la criatura muera este turno, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ee91fd5-2ec5-40da-8e13-13ae95712a45\', \'multiverseId\': 496228}, \'multiverseid\': 496228}, {\'name\': \'Ensemble pour toujours\', \'text\': "Quand Ensemble pour toujours arrive sur le champ de bataille, soutenez 2. (Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.)\\n{1} : Choisissez une créature ciblée avec un marqueur sur elle. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9f76e1-a312-4816-aa8d-fb8d1b83388f\', \'multiverseId\': 496362}, \'multiverseid\': 496362}, {\'name\': \'Per Sempre Insieme\', \'text\': \'Quando Per Sempre Insieme entra nel campo di battaglia, soccorri 2. (Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.)\\n{1}: Scegli una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, fai tornare quella carta in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fe3883-fa8f-4939-bb51-2a8701d935da\', \'multiverseId\': 496496}, \'multiverseid\': 496496}, {\'name\': \'いつまでも共に\', \'text\': \'いつまでも共にが戦場に出たとき、支援２を行う。（クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。）\\n{1}：カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca44627c-e42a-4ae3-8e8a-b3f317d6ebb9\', \'multiverseId\': 496630}, \'multiverseid\': 496630}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para Sempre\', \'text\': \'Quando Juntos para Sempre entrar no campo de batalha, suporte 2. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.)\\n{1}: Escolha uma criatura alvo com um marcador. Quando aquela criatura morrer neste turno, devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa9040e6-3bdc-46d2-8cde-5a8afb629160\', \'multiverseId\': 496764}, \'multiverseid\': 496764}, {\'name\': \'Навеки Вместе\', \'text\': \'Когда Навеки Вместе выходит на поле битвы, используйте Содействие 2. (Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.)\\n{1}: выберите целевое существо с жетоном на нем. Когда то существо умирает в этом ходу, верните ту карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f9b1d4-1886-4aa9-9bf9-90acbbac5894\', \'multiverseId\': 496898}, \'multiverseid\': 496898}, {\'name\': \'永结同心\', \'text\': \'当永结同心进战场时，支援2。（在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}：选择目标其上有指示物的生物。本回合中，当该生物死去时，将该牌移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12426b5f-77d9-44a2-8e43-0ab4a15aaab2\', \'multiverseId\': 497032}, \'multiverseid\': 497032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürsprecher des Waldes\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nSolange du sechs oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, erhalten der Fürsprecher des Waldes und Landkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land ist großzügig. Sein Reichtum versorgt uns selbst in Zeiten des Chaos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496156&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3abfae-1db0-43ac-8e67-518ade57eb10\', \'multiverseId\': 496156}, \'multiverseid\': 496156}, {\'name\': \'Defensor silvano\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nMientras controles seis o más tierras, el Defensor silvano y las criaturas tierra que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra es generosa. Su abundancia siempre proporciona sustento, incluso en épocas de caos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc289712-fee9-4deb-b3dc-4e3e5bf43cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 496290}, \'multiverseid\': 496290}, {\'name\': \'Partisan sylvestre\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nTant que vous contrôlez au moins six terrains, le Partisan sylvestre et les créatures-terrains que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide et allié\', \'flavor\': "« La terre donne d\'elle-même. Son abondance subvient à nos besoins, même en période de chaos. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be7a60fc-99aa-4e62-ba24-c061c2aa5a92\', \'multiverseId\': 496424}, \'multiverseid\': 496424}, {\'name\': \'Difensore Silvano\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nFintanto che controlli sei o più terre, il Difensore Silvano e le creature terra che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La terra dona se stessa. La sua abbondanza ci sostenta, anche in tempi di caos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b57e94-b8be-4229-9972-35e1e93c6ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 496558}, \'multiverseid\': 496558}, {\'name\': \'森の代言者\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたが土地を６つ以上コントロールしているかぎり、森の代言者とあなたがコントロールしている土地・クリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「土地は自らを惜しみなく与える。混乱の時代にあっても、土地はやはり豊潤だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0742e6cd-c6c1-42bf-ab3d-3109ac2bbeef\', \'multiverseId\': 496692}, \'multiverseid\': 496692}, {\'name\': \'Advogado Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nEnquanto você controlar seis ou mais terrenos, Advogado Silvestre e as criaturas terreno que você controla receberão +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra é generosa. Sua abundância é nosso sustento, mesmo em tempo de caos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48aa9666-1dfe-43d0-82a7-9a52f14d46c2\', \'multiverseId\': 496826}, \'multiverseid\': 496826}, {\'name\': \'Лесной Заступник\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nПока вы контролируете не менее шести земель, Лесной Заступник и земли существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Земля несет нам свои дары. Ее изобилие дает нам пищу даже во времена хаоса».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f5b6201-a8fe-4f35-af72-54438d2dade4\', \'multiverseId\': 496960}, \'multiverseid\': 496960}, {\'name\': \'森林拥护人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n只要你操控六个或更多地，森林拥护人和由你操控的地生物便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「大地自给自足。纵是混乱时期，仍有丰裕收成。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6db8b67c-219b-4fb7-a2d5-fa5f97ce38f7\', \'multiverseId\': 497094}, \'multiverseid\': 497094}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankendieb\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls ein Gegner eine Karte ziehen würde, abgesehen von der ersten, die er in jedem seiner Ziehsegmente zieht, übergeht er stattdessen jenes Kartenziehen und du ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496168&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b36817ac-b45f-44ac-bd7d-5079c2ab6462\', \'multiverseId\': 496168}, \'multiverseid\': 496168}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de creencias\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSi un oponente fuera a robar una carta excepto la primera que roba en sus pasos de robar, en vez de eso, ese jugador se salta ese robo y tú robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254bf3d7-3148-4251-ae61-5a7b2b38b278\', \'multiverseId\': 496302}, \'multiverseid\': 496302}, {\'name\': \'Voleur de notion\', \'text\': "Flash\\nSi un adversaire devait piocher une carte excepté la première qu\'il pioche à chacune de ses étapes de pioche, ce joueur passe cette pioche et vous piochez une carte à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d57101f7-7fbc-400f-b97f-f5f86a41e2bf\', \'multiverseId\': 496436}, \'multiverseid\': 496436}, {\'name\': \'Ladro di Concetti\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nSe un avversario sta per pescare una carta, tranne la prima che pesca in ogni sua sottofase di acquisizione, quel giocatore salta invece quella pescata e tu peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4fcc394-7e75-4765-ada0-0a101c35d2e8\', \'multiverseId\': 496570}, \'multiverseid\': 496570}, {\'name\': \'概念泥棒\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手が、自分の各ドロー・ステップ内で初めて引くカード以外のカードを１枚引くなら、代わりに、そのプレイヤーはそれを飛ばし、あなたはカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f9455fc-f06d-4d4b-a3e0-d7080795ba81\', \'multiverseId\': 496704}, \'multiverseid\': 496704}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão de Noção\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nSe um oponente for comprar um card que não seja o primeiro de cada fase de compra, em vez disso, aquele jogador pula aquela compra e você compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e768a4b0-fd00-4f08-9c13-b297c8d3a0e4\', \'multiverseId\': 496838}, \'multiverseid\': 496838}, {\'name\': \'Вор Принципов\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЕсли оппонент должен взять карту, помимо первой карты, которую он берет на каждом своем шаге взятия карты, вместо этого тот игрок пропускает то взятие, а вы берете карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f5d0f2-62a6-452d-a458-c880a8028795\', \'multiverseId\': 496972}, \'multiverseid\': 496972}, {\'name\': \'心念盗贼\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n如果某对手将抓一张牌，且这不是其于自己的每个抓牌步骤中所抓的第一张牌，则改为该牌手略过该次抓牌且你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be79d4f6-a910-4268-9dad-54ecd851123e\', \'multiverseId\': 497106}, \'multiverseid\': 497106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496186&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c738a2f-ca7c-4680-b595-fd9f8f306748\', \'multiverseId\': 496186}, \'multiverseid\': 496186}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab464f81-173c-4977-8b00-47b0368bd932\', \'multiverseId\': 496320}, \'multiverseid\': 496320}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcfa2dc1-7822-4887-8b45-2123f02feab0\', \'multiverseId\': 496454}, \'multiverseid\': 496454}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09db7e3a-9a17-48e2-892e-087692b59af2\', \'multiverseId\': 496588}, \'multiverseid\': 496588}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6b9bf1-f4bf-42b4-924b-938b0fd8f7b8\', \'multiverseId\': 496722}, \'multiverseid\': 496722}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é o mana senão o possível, uma ideia à qual ainda não se deu forma?"\\n— Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cd54501-9276-4066-abe9-daabd86e7212\', \'multiverseId\': 496856}, \'multiverseid\': 496856}, {\'name\': \'Камень Разума\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Камень Разума: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Что есть мана, как не возможность, не идея, еще не обретшая форму?»\\n— Джойра, мастер-механик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7ccaee-2432-4b8b-b60f-8d3f513fd484\', \'multiverseId\': 496990}, \'multiverseid\': 496990}, {\'name\': \'心灵石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲心灵石：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「法术力是尚无定形的理念，那这无穷的可能性又是什么？」\\n～神器大师尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12150c6b-58c5-4c38-99a8-7a36e7a9f56f\', \'multiverseId\': 497124}, \'multiverseid\': 497124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gehorsam ohne Ende\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nBringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d92237-c8e2-4d22-9fad-0fe74d0a3613\', \'multiverseId\': 496113}, \'multiverseid\': 496113}, {\'name\': \'Obediencia eterna\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nPon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6f17d2-8d80-446c-b9cd-b6998bb6be72\', \'multiverseId\': 496247}, \'multiverseid\': 496247}, {\'name\': \'Obéissance perpétuelle\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nMettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée d\'un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4457b423-8c14-432f-bb2b-1c2be71a29d8\', \'multiverseId\': 496381}, \'multiverseid\': 496381}, {\'name\': \'Obbedienza Eterna\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nMetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2a7fdb-68cb-4b55-8d88-7b948972907e\', \'multiverseId\': 496515}, \'multiverseid\': 496515}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき従順\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11106e4c-248b-4019-9e45-c3ec64423396\', \'multiverseId\': 496649}, \'multiverseid\': 496649}, {\'name\': \'Obediência Sem Fim\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nColoque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa3ba2e1-e552-4354-94d7-05278671fc8f\', \'multiverseId\': 496783}, \'multiverseid\': 496783}, {\'name\': \'Бесконечное Повиновение\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nПоложите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5075d61f-0e6e-49ed-aa6c-a84e9591d7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 496917}, \'multiverseid\': 496917}, {\'name\': \'无尽服从\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d9c58e-47b4-47f6-98fc-9cc9a0149c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 497051}, \'multiverseid\': 497051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel der Flotten\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geißel der Flotten ins Spiel kommt, bringe alle Kreaturen mit Widerstandskraft X oder weniger, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Inseln ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496107&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d17ba6-4811-461f-b76c-8a5323bc67e6\', \'multiverseId\': 496107}, \'multiverseid\': 496107}, {\'name\': \'Azote de las flotas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Azote de las flotas entre al campo de batalla, regresa cada criatura con resistencia de X o menos que controlan tus oponentes a la mano de su propietario, donde X es la cantidad de Islas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd2f761-1536-4305-9a4a-13fbf584cc09\', \'multiverseId\': 496241}, \'multiverseid\': 496241}, {\'name\': \'Fléau des flottes\', \'text\': "Quand le Fléau des flottes arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent avec une endurance inférieure ou égale à X dans la main de son propriétaire, X étant le nombre d\'îles que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496375&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e608af-2c87-490e-b444-99337ba3c98e\', \'multiverseId\': 496375}, \'multiverseid\': 496375}, {\'name\': \'Flagello delle Flotte\', \'text\': \'Quando il Flagello delle Flotte entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari con costituzione pari o inferiore a X in mano al suo proprietario, dove X è il numero di Isole che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41bda32d-19ae-4981-a61b-682ffef56f09\', \'multiverseId\': 496509}, \'multiverseid\': 496509}, {\'name\': \'船団の災い魔\', \'text\': \'船団の災い魔が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていてタフネスがＸ以下の各クリーチャーをそれぞれオーナーの手札に戻す。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている島の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a2ee9fb-1f78-4285-a607-1cf36b217286\', \'multiverseId\': 496643}, \'multiverseid\': 496643}, {\'name\': \'Flagelo das Frotas\', \'text\': \'Quando Flagelo das Frotas entrar no campo de batalha, devolva cada criatura controlada pelos seus oponentes com resistência X ou menos para a mão de seu dono, sendo X o número de Ilhas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855797b3-3fd6-4068-8a0c-6bcaf1641287\', \'multiverseId\': 496777}, \'multiverseid\': 496777}, {\'name\': \'Бич Кораблей\', \'text\': \'Когда Бич Кораблей выходит на поле битвы, верните каждое существо под контролем ваших оппонентов с выносливостью X или меньше в руку его владельца, где X — количество Островов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кракен\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5213e95-5530-4715-8825-bae84baa70e2\', \'multiverseId\': 496911}, \'multiverseid\': 496911}, {\'name\': \'船舰祸害\', \'text\': \'当船舰祸害进战场时，将所有由对手操控且防御力等于或小于X的生物移回其拥有者手上，X为由你操控的海岛数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b919a910-067c-4555-8faa-9d5a7be98f41\', \'multiverseId\': 497045}, \'multiverseid\': 497045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geoden-Wüterich\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, stachle alle Kreaturen an, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Sein kristalliner Kern bricht Licht zu Chaos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74830041-e434-4f18-abc4-734f71fd4498\', \'multiverseId\': 495904}, \'multiverseid\': 495904}, {\'name\': \'Iracundo de geodas\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, incita a cada criatura que controla el jugador objetivo. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas atacan cada combate si pueden y atacan a un jugador que no seas tú si pueden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Su interior cristalino refracta la luz hacia el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf460f01-6000-468f-b0c2-2ca5fc70499e\', \'multiverseId\': 495910}, \'multiverseid\': 495910}, {\'name\': \'Furie de géode\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, incitez chaque créature que le joueur ciblé contrôle. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Son cœur de cristal convertit la lumière en chaos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa58771e-53c8-4a73-b293-6d334902261e\', \'multiverseId\': 495916}, \'multiverseid\': 495916}, {\'name\': \'Furioso dei Geodi\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, sprona ogni creatura controllata da un giocatore bersaglio. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo nucleo cristallino rifrange la luce nel caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b0016b-17fb-4ec3-8527-4c4bc578e2ee\', \'multiverseId\': 495922}, \'multiverseid\': 495922}, {\'name\': \'晶洞石の憤怒獣\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーをそれぞれ使嗾する。（あなたの次のターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'その結晶質の核は、光を混沌へと屈折させる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35383ed-085e-4c72-8d3b-257503adf9d2\', \'multiverseId\': 495928}, \'multiverseid\': 495928}, {\'name\': \'Raivoso do Geodo\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, atice cada criatura que o jogador alvo controla. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas e atacam um jogador que não seja você se estiverem aptas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Seu núcleo cristalino refrata a luz e gera o caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef2d2e3-f978-4064-8607-47afc964f757\', \'multiverseId\': 495934}, \'multiverseid\': 495934}, {\'name\': \'Яростная Жеода\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, разъярите каждое существо под контролем целевого игрока. (До вашего следующего хода те существа атакуют в каждом бою, если могут, и атакуют не вас, а другого игрока, если могут.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Его кристальная сердцевина преломляет свет в хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3cd2f9b-f169-4634-9b04-77f8eaeb3b90\', \'multiverseId\': 495940}, \'multiverseid\': 495940}, {\'name\': \'晶岩怒兽\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，煽惑由目标牌手操控的每个生物。（直到你的下一个回合，那些生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'它的晶状核心能将明澈射线折成混沌散光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb20eca-5a30-43ae-a09f-86ff91db6dca\', \'multiverseId\': 495946}, \'multiverseid\': 495946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestohlene Identität\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Artefakts oder einer Kreatur deiner Wahl ist.\\nChiffrieren (Dann kannst du diese Zauberspruchkarte auf eine Kreatur codiert, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken. Immer wenn jene Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher eine Kopie der codierten Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e611ba-58fc-4945-8ce7-f81b39731606\', \'multiverseId\': 496109}, \'multiverseid\': 496109}, {\'name\': \'Identidad usurpada\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto o criatura objetivo.\\nCifrar. (Luego puedes exiliar esta carta de hechizo, cifrándola en una criatura que controles. Siempre que esa criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, su controlador puede lanzar una copia de la carta cifrada sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba702722-b220-4b43-bda8-a9023e156b69\', \'multiverseId\': 496243}, \'multiverseid\': 496243}, {\'name\': "Vol d\'identité", \'text\': "Créez un jeton qui est une copie de d\'un artefact ciblé ou d\'une créature ciblée.\\nCryptage (Vous pouvez ensuite exiler cette carte de sort cryptée sur une créature que vous contrôlez. À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, son contrôleur peut lancer une copie de la carte cryptée sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'565e9b33-0f36-406b-9bc8-74fd39a01724\', \'multiverseId\': 496377}, \'multiverseid\': 496377}, {\'name\': \'Identità Rubata\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto o di una creatura bersaglio.\\nCifrare (Poi puoi esiliare questa carta magia codificata su una creatura che controlli. Ogniqualvolta quella creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, il suo controllore può lanciare una copia della carta codificata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52a238d2-57b0-40bb-9c4e-9277ba0f6a88\', \'multiverseId\': 496511}, \'multiverseid\': 496511}, {\'name\': \'身分詐称\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。\\n暗号（その後、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体に暗号化した状態で、この呪文カードを追放してもよい。そのクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーは、暗号化されているこのカードのコピーを、それのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45099c17-7fc7-4f28-87ce-3674185c6989\', \'multiverseId\': 496645}, \'multiverseid\': 496645}, {\'name\': \'Identidade Roubada\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato ou da criatura alvo.\\nCifrar (Depois, você pode exilar este card de mágica cifrado numa criatura que você controla. Toda vez que aquela criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, seu controlador poderá conjurar uma cópia do card cifrado sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df30699-5cd4-4221-87d0-b18308b68e61\', \'multiverseId\': 496779}, \'multiverseid\': 496779}, {\'name\': \'Украденная Личность\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией целевого артефакта или существа.\\nШифр (Затем вы можете изгнать эту карту заклинания, закодировав ее на существе под вашим контролем. Каждый раз, когда то существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, контролирующий его игрок может разыграть копию закодированной карты без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a3bc14-d6ee-49fd-95d7-a1c6534d4705\', \'multiverseId\': 496913}, \'multiverseid\': 496913}, {\'name\': \'身分遭窃\', \'text\': \'派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标神器或生物之复制品。\\n暗码（然后你可以放逐此咒语牌，并赋码于一个由你操控的生物上。每当该生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以施放所赋码之牌的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba976313-0a69-406d-8c9a-71ff69225270\', \'multiverseId\': 497047}, \'multiverseid\': 497047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz, ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Solange die Karte im Exil ist, kannst du sie anschauen und sie wirken, und um den Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana eines beliebigen Typs.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28739bf-949f-4e06-9b99-47f9a6f31fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 496116}, \'multiverseid\': 496116}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, señor de la opulencia\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando Gonti, señor de la opulencia entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de la biblioteca del oponente objetivo y exilia una de ellas boca abajo. Luego, pon el resto en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Mientras esa carta permanezca exiliada, puedes mirarla, lanzarla y usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232557f8-231a-4d68-8295-d8e1d9a15425\', \'multiverseId\': 496250}, \'multiverseid\': 496250}, {\'name\': "Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé, exilez l\'une d\'elles face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de cette bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez regarder cette carte et la lancer tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quel type pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32a8655-28ea-4cf2-81a6-b84a8cd1a72f\', \'multiverseId\': 496384}, \'multiverseid\': 496384}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, Signore del Lusso\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando Gonti, Signore del Lusso entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime quattro carte del grimorio di un avversario bersaglio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo a quel grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi guardare e lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane in esilio e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8f6180-2a08-4794-b56b-8a420f5242e6\', \'multiverseId\': 496518}, \'multiverseid\': 496518}, {\'name\': \'豪華の王、ゴンティ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n豪華の王、ゴンティが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放する。その後、残りをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。そのカードが追放された状態であり続けているかぎり、あなたはそれを見てもよく、あなたはその呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払って唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d61ffe-4fcf-4ab0-9972-14a564fc5403\', \'multiverseId\': 496652}, \'multiverseid\': 496652}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, Senhor da Opulência\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Gonti, Senhor da Opulência, entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os quatro cards do topo do grimório do oponente alvo, exile um deles com a face voltada para baixo e, em seguida, coloque o restante no fundo daquele grimório em ordem aleatória. Você poderá olhá-lo e conjurá-lo enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e poderá gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer tipo para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Etergênito Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02859028-5721-4798-a7bf-0bcef6278a05\', \'multiverseId\': 496786}, \'multiverseid\': 496786}, {\'name\': \'Гонти, Владыка Роскоши\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Гонти, Владыка Роскоши выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите четыре верхние карты библиотеки целевого оппонента, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные карты в низ той библиотеки в случайном порядке. Пока та карта остается в изгнании, вы можете смотреть ее, можете разыграть ее, если это карта заклинания, и можете тратить на разыгрывание того заклинания ману, как если бы это была мана любого типа.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эфирид Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67a6f56-2d09-47d9-9870-92d6ebc46b32\', \'multiverseId\': 496920}, \'multiverseid\': 496920}, {\'name\': \'奢华领主贡提\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当奢华领主贡提进战场时，检视目标对手牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于该牌库底。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以检视并施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意种类的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1232cdb-ddaa-4af0-b2f2-6ca3aa0f0808\', \'multiverseId\': 497054}, \'multiverseid\': 497054}]', "[{'name': 'Gruul-Gildeneingang', 'text': 'Der Gruul-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land — Tor', 'flavor': 'Tritt ein und lasse die Hemmnisse deiner Erziehung zurück!', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496202&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caa22263-db82-4214-9f4c-57e4dc18e5e0', 'multiverseId': 496202}, 'multiverseid': 496202}, {'name': 'Portal del Gremio Gruul', 'text': 'El Portal del Gremio Gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Portal', 'flavor': 'Únete y deja atrás una mente socialmente aprisionada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496336&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '662ccef5-e385-4aee-874e-b76a140ec625', 'multiverseId': 496336}, 'multiverseid': 496336}, {'name': 'Porte de la guilde de Gruul', 'text': 'La Porte de la guilde de Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain : porte', 'flavor': 'Entrez et laissez les chaînes de la société derrière vous.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496470&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5508e19c-4c87-4321-b338-1de4a2847a5b', 'multiverseId': 496470}, 'multiverseid': 496470}, {'name': 'Cancello della Gilda Gruul', 'text': 'Il Cancello della Gilda Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra — Cancello', 'flavor': 'Entrate e lasciate indietro le vacue costrizioni della società.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496604&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '065ea91a-0c1b-46b5-84a2-5ed39555b98e', 'multiverseId': 496604}, 'multiverseid': 496604}, {'name': 'グルールのギルド門', 'text': 'グルールのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 門', 'flavor': 'この門の中で、属する社会の纏いし枷を捨て去れ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496738&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a004898f-a974-4207-89f4-acd19733477f', 'multiverseId': 496738}, 'multiverseid': 496738}, {'name': 'Portão da Guilda Gruul', 'text': 'Portão da Guilda Gruul entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno — Portão', 'flavor': 'Entre e abandone de uma vez as amarras urbanas da sociedade.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496872&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee1ae7d7-a7eb-4e2c-9bbe-d9d41e60a1fb', 'multiverseId': 496872}, 'multiverseid': 496872}, {'name': 'Врата Гильдии Груулов', 'text': 'Врата Гильдии Груулов выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля — Врата', 'flavor': 'Входящий сюда сбрасывает вериги общества.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497006&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e22702e-4282-4f08-a49d-cfde2f902104', 'multiverseId': 497006}, 'multiverseid': 497006}, {'name': '古鲁公会门', 'text': '古鲁公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地 ～门', 'flavor': '此门将所有社会枷锁一同置诸脑后。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497140&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82244a37-72db-40a9-9d98-a1407c89beb2', 'multiverseId': 497140}, 'multiverseid': 497140}]", "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496203&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7425dd7f-edba-4881-9702-2c1ac35a8bbc', 'multiverseId': 496203}, 'multiverseid': 496203}, {'name': 'Territorio gruul', 'text': 'El Territorio gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Territorio gruul entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496337&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7071f3a2-89ce-4c8c-94df-efa7ff85b678', 'multiverseId': 496337}, 'multiverseid': 496337}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496471&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e612f28c-8328-4a38-ba30-1081a7d08f63', 'multiverseId': 496471}, 'multiverseid': 496471}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496605&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '959d47b2-3a62-47cd-8173-454f8e757e0a', 'multiverseId': 496605}, 'multiverseid': 496605}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496739&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dde9e446-b0ac-427e-812b-090c5f7000ab', 'multiverseId': 496739}, 'multiverseid': 496739}, {'name': 'Gleba Gruul', 'text': 'Gleba Gruul entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Gleba Gruul entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496873&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4067bef1-63b6-463c-87f7-ce0319d27b6a', 'multiverseId': 496873}, 'multiverseid': 496873}, {'name': 'Территория Груулов', 'text': 'Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497007&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc8ceb6d-eff0-4727-8346-6de2c505ae3e', 'multiverseId': 497007}, 'multiverseid': 497007}, {'name': '古鲁地盘', 'text': '古鲁地盘须横置进战场。\\n当古鲁地盘进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497141&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '138e77c1-4023-407d-9e69-1952f7c771a9', 'multiverseId': 497141}, 'multiverseid': 497141}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hauptmann der Stoßzahnwache\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {G} ({G}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Ein einziges leises Wort löst die Stampede aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f66a82f-de6b-4817-a7d6-add52f400a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 496157}, \'multiverseid\': 496157}, {\'name\': \'Capitana del cargadermo\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {G}. ({G}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Una sola palabra da comienzo a la estampida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b00726c1-1918-4be3-9336-cddd4154f3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 496291}, \'multiverseid\': 496291}, {\'name\': "Capitaine de la garde d\'ivoire", \'text\': "Résilience {G} ({G}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Un simple mot suffit à déclencher la ruée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72e612a-4fc0-4f30-aa21-d5a9651e92f4\', \'multiverseId\': 496425}, \'multiverseid\': 496425}, {\'name\': \'Capitano della Guardia di Zanne\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {G} ({G}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Una parola mormorata lancia la carica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e930131-42c7-4290-883e-671292bbefb7\', \'multiverseId\': 496559}, \'multiverseid\': 496559}, {\'name\': \'牙守りの隊長\', \'text\': \'長久{G}（{G}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'一つの静かな言葉が暴走を引き起こした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6160b3-5f3f-4d54-9c13-fd4898ad43b7\', \'multiverseId\': 496693}, \'multiverseid\': 496693}, {\'name\': \'Capitão do Marfim de Guarda\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {G} ({G}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1 tem atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Basta uma palavrinha para desencadear o estouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a92ed376-9b69-4125-835b-c3a75460b2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 496827}, \'multiverseid\': 496827}, {\'name\': \'Капитан Стражи Бивня\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {G} ({G}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, имеет Пробивной удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Одно тихое слово — и табун сметает все на своем пути.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a707fdcf-faae-47a4-a9d8-f30998707d93\', \'multiverseId\': 496961}, \'multiverseid\': 496961}, {\'name\': \'牙卫队长\', \'text\': \'延生{G}（{G}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'低声轻语便能引领狂奔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657788ad-bd69-42a3-aed6-b7325a2bca28\', \'multiverseId\': 497095}, \'multiverseid\': 497095}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter der Fabeln\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Löwe kennt mehr Geschichten als ich."\\n—Chulane der Geschichtenerzähler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496143&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b0c2d7-8f95-451f-acdf-c859c251d3b5\', \'multiverseId\': 496143}, \'multiverseid\': 496143}, {\'name\': \'Custodio de las fábulas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo el león sabe más historias que yo".\\n—Chulane, cuentacuentos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af2865a0-8efb-4c1e-bcb5-2250b4add48c\', \'multiverseId\': 496277}, \'multiverseid\': 496277}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des fables\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature non-Humain que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "« Seul le lion connaît plus d\'histoires que moi. »\\n—Chulane, conteur de fables", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2897aa69-67a7-41dd-8d61-af5b9d55f39d\', \'multiverseId\': 496411}, \'multiverseid\': 496411}, {\'name\': \'Custode delle Fiabe\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature non Umano che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo il leone conosce più storie di me."\\n—Chulene, Narratore di Racconti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b4a4b6-5511-4220-b1b8-352d5e925297\', \'multiverseId\': 496545}, \'multiverseid\': 496545}, {\'name\': \'寓話の守り手\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャー１体以上がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「獅子だけが、私よりも多くの物語を知っている。」\\n――伝承の語り部、チュレイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8950a3d6-1e11-4fe0-8c64-c96fa9123d8a\', \'multiverseId\': 496679}, \'multiverseid\': 496679}, {\'name\': \'Guardião das Fábulas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla que não sejam do tipo Humano causarem dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Só o leão conhece mais histórias do que eu."\\n— Chulane, Narrador de Contos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc70c73d-8133-4432-a73d-cc19a54b1d26\', \'multiverseId\': 496813}, \'multiverseid\': 496813}, {\'name\': \'Хранитель Сказок\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда одно или несколько не являющихся Человеком существ под вашим контролем наносят боевые повреждения игроку, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'«Один лишь лев знает больше историй, чем я».\\n— сказочник Чулейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'956ad0c7-7fce-458f-b5f8-460464026166\', \'multiverseId\': 496947}, \'multiverseid\': 496947}, {\'name\': \'寓言守护兽\', \'text\': \'每当一个或数个由你操控的非人类生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'「只有那头狮子知道的故事比我多。」\\n～说书人楚兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18b463c-63b0-4af0-9bef-ebe544d56d72\', \'multiverseId\': 497081}, \'multiverseid\': 497081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter des Hortes\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nWenn der Hüter des Hortes stirbt, bringe alle mit ihm ins Exil geschickten bleibenden Karten unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4478224a-41cc-46fe-bb2c-51aae2fc9eb2\', \'multiverseId\': 495901}, \'multiverseid\': 495901}, {\'name\': \'Guardatesoros\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, exilia la carta de permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio.\\nCuando el Guardatesoros muera, pon cada carta de permanente exiliada con esta carta en el campo de batalla bajo el control del propietario de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04610c2-4df6-4bfb-8473-5a8d8a0952bf\', \'multiverseId\': 495907}, \'multiverseid\': 495907}, {\'name\': \'Garde des trésors\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez une carte de permanent avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\nQuand le Garde des trésors meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille chaque carte de permanent qu\'il a exilée, sous le contrôle du propriétaire de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5710bfeb-2694-433d-979b-b68ed031b25e\', \'multiverseId\': 495913}, \'multiverseid\': 495913}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella dei Tesori\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esilia una carta permanente bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\\nQuando la Sentinella dei Tesori muore, metti ogni carta permanente esiliata con essa sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del proprietario di quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178f0a28-5909-45c1-9195-e72273bfa291\', \'multiverseId\': 495919}, \'multiverseid\': 495919}, {\'name\': \'宝物の守部\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n宝物の守部が死亡したとき、これによって追放されている各パーマネント・カードを、それぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827158ac-054b-4f18-87f0-ec0bde0eda5f\', \'multiverseId\': 495925}, \'multiverseid\': 495925}, {\'name\': \'Guardião do Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, exile o card de permanente alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 do seu cemitério.\\nQuando Guardião do Tesouro morrer, coloque cada card de permanente exilado com ele no campo de batalha sob o controle do dono daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ca4caa-b157-4b86-9cee-8f363692779f\', \'multiverseId\': 495931}, \'multiverseid\': 495931}, {\'name\': \'Страж Сокровищницы\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, изгоните целевую карту перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища.\\nКогда Страж Сокровищницы умирает, положите каждую изгнанную им карту перманента на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4172e8d-4124-4cfd-8da2-43b4ca9f485f\', \'multiverseId\': 495937}, \'multiverseid\': 495937}, {\'name\': \'宝库护卫\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，将目标总法术力费用等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场放逐。\\n当宝库护卫死去时，将所有以其放逐的永久物牌在各自拥有者的操控下放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38501426-9d45-4c2d-ad09-c802095a7c78\', \'multiverseId\': 495943}, \'multiverseid\': 495943}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei Schritte nach Norden führen dich in die ungewisse Zukunft, nach Süden in die unruhige Vergangenheit, nach Osten in den heutigen Tag und nach Westen in das große Durcheinander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9984adf-7e31-4a6f-8dec-113ee04f74f8\', \'multiverseId\': 496214}, \'multiverseid\': 496214}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Haz dos pasos al norte hacia el futuro inestable, al sur hacia el pasado inquieto, al este hacia el presente o al oeste hacia lo desconocido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6714b362-a601-4443-bc34-5e7b4fabaf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 496348}, \'multiverseid\': 496348}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Faites deux pas au nord dans l\'avenir instable, au sud dans le passé agité, à l\'est dans le présent ou à l\'ouest dans le vaste inconnu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f5df4a9-de1c-4e43-9afe-7078f6f21910\', \'multiverseId\': 496482}, \'multiverseid\': 496482}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Fai due passi a nord nel futuro incerto, a sud nel passato inquieto, a est nel giorno attuale o a ovest nel grande ignoto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e634cef-9d78-4793-8a50-db7632f28437\', \'multiverseId\': 496616}, \'multiverseid\': 496616}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'二歩北へ進めば不安定な未来、南へ進めば不穏な過去、東に進めば今日この日、西へ進めば偉大なる未知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b29f4bd-e9da-4080-a1e5-1cf49459f835\', \'multiverseId\': 496750}, \'multiverseid\': 496750}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Morfoterrena\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Vastidão Morfoterrena: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Dê dois passos ao norte para o futuro incerto, ao sul para o passado inquieto, ao leste para o presente, ou ao oeste para o grande desconhecido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f604597-16ee-46fa-8fd6-fc6dd1c2141a\', \'multiverseId\': 496884}, \'multiverseid\': 496884}, {\'name\': \'Просторы Преображенных Земель\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте Просторы Преображенных Земель: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Сделай два шага на север — в необитаемое будущее, на юг — в неупокоенное прошлое, на восток — в настоящее или на запад — в великое неизвестное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a80b3a-c45a-4761-b6a9-f5dfdbd12967\', \'multiverseId\': 497018}, \'multiverseid\': 497018}, {\'name\': \'地塑旷野\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲地塑旷野：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'迈开两步，向北迈进动荡将来，向南则为无宁过往，向东步回眼下此刻，或向西踏入未知境地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70d850a-afd9-49fe-9fac-1fdaad0d8ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 497152}, \'multiverseid\': 497152}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Einklang bringen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Tiere kommunizieren mit ihrer Umgebung, ohne dafür eine Sprache zu benötigen. Sie sind eine fundamentale Verbindung eingegangen, die spärliche Wörter übersteigt."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496140&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecf93bf4-3ea5-4b85-b10e-b18b7baf5e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 496140}, \'multiverseid\': 496140}, {\'name\': \'Armonizar\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los animales conversan con su entorno sin necesidad del lenguaje. Su conexión fundamental supera las endebles palabras".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83c9315-5458-4c1a-9804-30c722859799\', \'multiverseId\': 496274}, \'multiverseid\': 496274}, {\'name\': \'Harmonisation\', \'text\': \'Piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les animaux se passent du langage pour communier avec leur environnement. Leur lien fondamental surpasse la vanité des mots. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd9b98e-8487-4f88-aa5d-6d21589e949e\', \'multiverseId\': 496408}, \'multiverseid\': 496408}, {\'name\': \'Armonizzare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli animali comunicano con l\\\'ambiente circostante senza bisogno di parole. La loro è una connessione primordiale che trascende la fragilità di una lingua."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253761bc-d08c-4b86-a4d8-f81ccfb9dfa6\', \'multiverseId\': 496542}, \'multiverseid\': 496542}, {\'name\': \'調和\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「動物は環境との対話に言語を必要としない。浅薄な言葉に勝る根本的な繋がりがあるのよ。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380bc0cd-98e9-429a-a498-5317cb4fa08d\', \'multiverseId\': 496676}, \'multiverseid\': 496676}, {\'name\': \'Harmonizar\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os animais comungam com o ambiente sem precisar de um idioma. É uma conexão fundamental que transcende meras palavras."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bc1b348-0199-4492-b9c0-6ea0abab9076\', \'multiverseId\': 496810}, \'multiverseid\': 496810}, {\'name\': \'Гармония\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Животные общаются со своим окружением, не нуждаясь в языке. Их фундаментальная связь намного превосходит жалкие слова».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc6749b-2da2-4d39-98ee-29ef15c62f27\', \'multiverseId\': 496944}, \'multiverseid\': 496944}, {\'name\': \'和谐\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「动物不需语言，就能与周遭环境沟通。它们之间这种基础联系远胜粗劣言语。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69041551-7600-48fa-a30a-773ce55dc7f2\', \'multiverseId\': 497078}, \'multiverseid\': 497078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jwar-Insel-Refugium\', \'text\': \'Das Jwar-Insel-Refugium kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Jwar-Insel-Refugium ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496205&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdea40af-5f65-4cb4-b670-b8e3f401361c\', \'multiverseId\': 496205}, \'multiverseid\': 496205}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de la Isla Jwar\', \'text\': \'El Refugio de la Isla Jwar entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Refugio de la Isla Jwar entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d7bf889-bac0-45e0-b3ec-5f4c0a1cfaea\', \'multiverseId\': 496339}, \'multiverseid\': 496339}, {\'name\': "Refuge de l\'île de Jwar", \'text\': "Le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Refuge de l\'île de Jwar arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcff1644-0c00-4176-82f0-adb448285ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 496473}, \'multiverseid\': 496473}, {\'name\': "Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar", \'text\': "Il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Rifugio dell\'Isola Jwar entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278b8e25-2824-42e9-b056-22ff6ef48a14\', \'multiverseId\': 496607}, \'multiverseid\': 496607}, {\'name\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家\', \'text\': \'ジュワー島の隠れ家はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジュワー島の隠れ家が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d985fe-d069-4aad-a88e-644baebc0be6\', \'multiverseId\': 496741}, \'multiverseid\': 496741}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar\', \'text\': \'Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Refúgio da Ilha de Jwar entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245938b9-841e-4e20-84e2-0d4feb3df432\', \'multiverseId\': 496875}, \'multiverseid\': 496875}, {\'name\': \'Укрытие на Острове Джвар\', \'text\': \'Укрытие на Острове Джвар выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Укрытие на Острове Джвар выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec7627d-cfc3-45d2-8df2-0ee54e29db6c\', \'multiverseId\': 497009}, \'multiverseid\': 497009}, {\'name\': \'爪尔岛避难所\', \'text\': \'爪尔岛避难所须横置进战场。\\n当爪尔岛避难所进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a616f51b-efce-4927-af1b-7acdbebee167\', \'multiverseId\': 497143}, \'multiverseid\': 497143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klammergriff\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur während des Kampfes.\\nEnttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, und übernimm die Kontrolle über sie. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd322755-4ea8-4d0f-a5a8-1dd07eaac23d\', \'multiverseId\': 496173}, \'multiverseid\': 496173}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo espinal\', \'text\': \'Lanza este hechizo solo durante el combate.\\nEndereza la criatura objetivo que no controlas y gana su control. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Al comienzo del próximo paso final, sacrifícala. Si lo haces, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a su resistencia.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea97c76-3345-4df4-a154-aeb3e56808bc\', \'multiverseId\': 496307}, \'multiverseid\': 496307}, {\'name\': \'Étreinte spinale\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort que pendant le combat.\\nDégagez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas et acquérez-en le contrôle. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Au début de la prochaine étape de fin, sacrifiez-la. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à son endurance.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc53a9d-47a1-49a6-afb4-d6c6e38f376a\', \'multiverseId\': 496441}, \'multiverseid\': 496441}, {\'name\': \'Abbraccio Vertebrale\', \'text\': "Lancia questa magia solo durante il combattimento.\\nSTAPpa una creatura bersaglio che non controlli e prendine il controllo. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. All\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale, sacrificala. Se lo fai, guadagni punti vita pari alla sua costituzione.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8082e50f-d0b6-4cea-a06a-b361e8c2a6a6\', \'multiverseId\': 496575}, \'multiverseid\': 496575}, {\'name\': \'脊髄支配\', \'text\': \'この呪文は、戦闘中にのみ唱えられる。\\nあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをアンタップし、それのコントロールを得る。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、あなたはそれのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4bf72d-86b1-4257-91d4-0c4d39f085ae\', \'multiverseId\': 496709}, \'multiverseid\': 496709}, {\'name\': \'Abraço Espinal\', \'text\': \'Conjure esta mágica somente durante o combate.\\nDesvire a criatura alvo que você não controla e ganhe o controle dela. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. No início da próxima etapa final, sacrifique-a. Se fizer isso, você ganhará uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à resistência dela.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcb2be2-e908-41a5-9804-d1389718cd92\', \'multiverseId\': 496843}, \'multiverseid\': 496843}, {\'name\': \'Захват Позвоночника\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывайте это заклинание только во время боя.\\nРазверните целевое существо не под вашим контролем и получите над ним контроль. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода. В начале следующего заключительного шага пожертвуйте его. Если вы это делаете, вы получаете количество жизней, равное его выносливости.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ecd191-b277-4828-8c2c-471709019377\', \'multiverseId\': 496977}, \'multiverseid\': 496977}, {\'name\': \'脊椎强殖\', \'text\': \'只能于战斗中施放此咒语。\\n重置目标不由你操控的生物并获得其操控权。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。若你如此作，则你获得等同于其防御力的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b101f572-8846-4417-ada4-87e742f0ac84\', \'multiverseId\': 497111}, \'multiverseid\': 497111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenhort\', \'text\': \'Lebende Waffe (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 schwarzen Keim-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in allen Friedhöfen ist.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496180&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3237a2ae-f909-4d40-9c02-87ba2f6ceda2\', \'multiverseId\': 496180}, \'multiverseid\': 496180}, {\'name\': \'Huesotesoro\', \'text\': \'Arma viviente. (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Germen negra 0/0 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +X/+X, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en todos los cementerios.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a723e0b4-cf3e-4f89-858d-d50f7e013eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 496314}, \'multiverseid\': 496314}, {\'name\': \'Récoltos\', \'text\': \'Arme vivante (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Germe, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +X/+X, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans tous les cimetières.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d424861-8354-4597-a73e-30bf48e719ee\', \'multiverseId\': 496448}, \'multiverseid\': 496448}, {\'name\': "Mucchio d\'Ossa", \'text\': \'Arma vivente (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Microbo 0/0 nera, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +X/+X, dove X è il numero di carte creatura in tutti i cimiteri.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a6d6e39-f114-45cd-909f-e4c2d2a3e21c\', \'multiverseId\': 496582}, \'multiverseid\': 496582}, {\'name\': \'骨溜め\', \'text\': \'生体武器（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、黒の０/０の細菌・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはすべての墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの総数に等しい。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2737ec6e-69d8-482e-8132-c863eb1a2a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 496716}, \'multiverseid\': 496716}, {\'name\': \'Aglomerado de Ossos\', \'text\': \'Arma viva (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Germe e anexe-o a ela.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +X/+X, sendo X o número de cards de criatura em todos os cemitérios.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd68c71-8679-443c-993a-fbe8eb39c7ea\', \'multiverseId\': 496850}, \'multiverseid\': 496850}, {\'name\': \'Костоклад\', \'text\': \'Живое оружие (Когда это Снаряжение выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черный Микроб, затем прикрепите к ней это Снаряжение.)\\nСнаряженное существо получает +X/+X, где Х — количество карт существ на всех кладбищах.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6832a38c-85fc-4264-be85-873504599135\', \'multiverseId\': 496984}, \'multiverseid\': 496984}, {\'name\': \'聚骨装\', \'text\': \'活化武器（当此武具进战场时，派出一个0/0黑色病菌衍生生物，然后将它装备于其上。）\\n佩带此武具的生物得+X/+X，X为所有坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1427aa7-fefe-4667-9d06-feee62f0016a\', \'multiverseId\': 497118}, \'multiverseid\': 497118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kor-Kartenzeichnerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Kor-Kartenzeichnerin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Kor wissen nicht, was „erforschen" bedeutet. Sie „kehren in vergessene Heimatländer zurück".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea28c2b8-aee0-44a4-978c-ac843d7866cd\', \'multiverseId\': 496090}, \'multiverseid\': 496090}, {\'name\': \'Cartógrafa kor\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Cartógrafa kor entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador kor\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor no tienen una idea de exploración. Ellos vuelven a hogares olvidados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f51ac936-ba69-480c-b8f3-88317f6b0499\', \'multiverseId\': 496224}, \'multiverseid\': 496224}, {\'name\': \'Cartographe kor\', \'text\': \'Quand la Cartographe kor arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Les Kor n\'ont aucun concept de l\'exploration. Ils reviennent dans des terres natales oubliées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2208483b-43c6-4c7b-931a-c6a7afdf16fd\', \'multiverseId\': 496358}, \'multiverseid\': 496358}, {\'name\': \'Cartografa Kor\', \'text\': \'Quando la Cartografa Kor entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Kor\', \'flavor\': \'I Kor non hanno la nozione di esplorazione. Ritornano in terre natie dimenticate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89c87220-2ea7-40ad-8c60-dea815961afd\', \'multiverseId\': 496492}, \'multiverseid\': 496492}, {\'name\': \'コーの地図作り\', \'text\': \'コーの地図作りが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'コーには探検という概念が存在しない。忘れられた故郷に帰っているだけなのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798fc309-695e-472e-9d45-3f840a44f865\', \'multiverseId\': 496626}, \'multiverseid\': 496626}, {\'name\': \'Cartógrafo Kor\', \'text\': \'Quando Cartógrafo Kor entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de Planície em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Para os kor, o conceito de exploração não existe. Eles voltam a terras natais esquecidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60509e1a-d0dd-4ce9-a734-a9a23bd004f8\', \'multiverseId\': 496760}, \'multiverseid\': 496760}, {\'name\': \'Кор-Картограф\', \'text\': \'Когда Кор-Картограф выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Коры не знают, что такое «исследовать». Они возвращаются на забытую родину.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4064383c-ce49-45d6-b278-ff209205c17f\', \'multiverseId\': 496894}, \'multiverseid\': 496894}, {\'name\': \'寇族制图师\', \'text\': \'当寇族制图师进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～寇族／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'寇族没有探险的概念。他们是返回遗忘的家园。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c5ea3a-cdc8-4e2a-ba7a-da8bd64cafdc\', \'multiverseId\': 497028}, \'multiverseid\': 497028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496206&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4b9d78-4654-4a1e-8a38-507c3b32b754\', \'multiverseId\': 496206}, \'multiverseid\': 496206}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y una carta de Llanura, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d77129-0813-4aa5-8661-6eef0603e942\', \'multiverseId\': 496340}, \'multiverseid\': 496340}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5643c608-be8c-4467-9d77-a5b53199ebac\', \'multiverseId\': 496474}, \'multiverseid\': 496474}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12277554-5e43-4930-b8ca-a93db10b1cec\', \'multiverseId\': 496608}, \'multiverseid\': 496608}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f0eee0a-b0c8-4615-bee1-980dad299ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 496742}, \'multiverseid\': 496742}, {\'name\': \'Orla Krosana\', \'text\': \'Orla Krosana entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Orla Krosana: Procure um card de Floresta e um de Planície em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adaaaa30-2a05-4603-83da-866f155b8b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 496876}, \'multiverseid\': 496876}, {\'name\': \'Край Кросанского Леса\', \'text\': \'Край Кросанского Леса выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Край Кросанского Леса: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Леса и карту Равнины, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea0a333-b2d1-41f9-82bd-c1a0341b70aa\', \'multiverseId\': 497010}, \'multiverseid\': 497010}, {\'name\': \'克洛萨边陲\', \'text\': \'克洛萨边陲须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲克洛萨边陲：从你的牌库中搜寻一张树林牌和一张平原牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2501bdd2-158d-44b7-a79c-d8ee34c871e9\', \'multiverseId\': 497144}, \'multiverseid\': 497144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kryptische Höhlen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Kryptischen Höhlen: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Erst, wenn du die Suche aufgegeben hast, werden die Höhlen dir ihre Geheimnisse offenbaren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ec263b4-4607-498d-9364-249239cbd3c3\', \'multiverseId\': 496197}, \'multiverseid\': 496197}, {\'name\': \'Cuevas crípticas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar las Cuevas crípticas: Roba una carta. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las cuevas solo compartirán sus secretos cuando hayas abandonado la búsqueda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a73dc5-d2d9-4064-9939-9b44aa473b52\', \'multiverseId\': 496331}, \'multiverseid\': 496331}, {\'name\': \'Cavernes cryptiques\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez les Cavernes cryptiques : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ce n\'est qu\'au moment où vous aurez abandonné vos recherches que les cavernes livreront leurs secrets.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdfcade1-a0f7-4894-ad8f-c886d12501da\', \'multiverseId\': 496465}, \'multiverseid\': 496465}, {\'name\': \'Caverne Criptiche\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica le Caverne Criptiche: Pesca una carta. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Solo quando avrai smesso di cercare, le caverne riveleranno i propri segreti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27904876-f7a6-4727-94e7-b95c1bba269f\', \'multiverseId\': 496599}, \'multiverseid\': 496599}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 謎めいた洞窟を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。この能力は、あなたが土地を５つ以上コントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'探索を諦めたときにしか、この洞窟は秘密を明かさない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f66b5c-a583-48d8-8ae5-9cb2088a8218\', \'multiverseId\': 496733}, \'multiverseid\': 496733}, {\'name\': \'Cavernas Crípticas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Cavernas Crípticas: Compre um card. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As cavernas só lhe revelarão seus segredos quando você tiver desistido da busca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175b3f3a-6624-4ca2-96b3-78f11f92a833\', \'multiverseId\': 496867}, \'multiverseid\': 496867}, {\'name\': \'Пещеры Загадок\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пещеры Загадок: возьмите карту. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете не менее пяти земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Лишь когда ты отказываешься от поисков, пещеры раскрывают свои секреты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef32eeb9-cf70-4b51-90a1-d32b74553db1\', \'multiverseId\': 497001}, \'multiverseid\': 497001}, {\'name\': \'隐密洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲隐密洞窟：抓一张牌。只能于你操控五个或更多地时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'只有在你放弃搜寻时，洞窟才会露出其间的秘密。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09d45de-dc35-4cff-8b69-11208cbedd80\', \'multiverseId\': 497135}, \'multiverseid\': 497135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lazav, Dimir-Drahtzieher\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher\\nImmer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird, kannst du Lazav, Dimir-Drahtzieher, zu einer Kopie jener Karte werden lassen, außer dass ihr Name Lazav, Dimir-Drahtzieher, ist, sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen legendär ist und Fluchsicherheit sowie diese Fähigkeit hat.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496164&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bce2e6-9ee3-4c8c-a9dd-4634db2cc704\', \'multiverseId\': 496164}, \'multiverseid\': 496164}, {\'name\': \'Lazav, mente maestra dimir\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio.\\nSiempre que una carta de criatura vaya al cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, puedes hacer que Lazav, mente maestra dimir se convierta en una copia de esa carta excepto que su nombre es Lazav, mente maestra dimir, es legendaria además de sus otros tipos y tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y esta habilidad.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e4657a1-d1dc-4fee-8cbb-253a2a829a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 496298}, \'multiverseid\': 496298}, {\'name\': \'Lazav, érudit de Dimir\', \'text\': "Défense talismanique\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, vous pouvez faire que Lazav, érudit de Dimir devienne une copie de cette carte excepté que son nom est Lazav, érudit de Dimir, qu\'il est légendaire en plus de ses autres types et qu\'il a la défense talismanique et cette capacité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609fa3f1-e460-4944-bb0c-139448bc31f2\', \'multiverseId\': 496432}, \'multiverseid\': 496432}, {\'name\': \'Lazav, Genio Dimir\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio\\nOgniqualvolta una carta creatura viene messa nel cimitero di un avversario da qualsiasi zona, puoi far diventare Lazav, Genio Dimir una copia di quella carta, tranne che il suo nome è Lazav, Genio Dimir, è leggendario in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha anti-malocchio e questa abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d2018e-2345-4543-a641-b338e14a873b\', \'multiverseId\': 496566}, \'multiverseid\': 496566}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの黒幕ラザーヴ\', \'text\': \'呪禁\\nクリーチャー・カードが１枚いずれかの領域から対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは「ディミーアの黒幕ラザーヴは、これの名前が『ディミーアの黒幕ラザーヴ』であり、他のタイプに加えて伝説であり、呪禁とこの能力を持つことを除き、そのカードのコピーになる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f402481-6077-461e-af18-72dcbcc93bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 496700}, \'multiverseid\': 496700}, {\'name\': \'Lazav, Mentor dos Dimir\', \'text\': \'Resistência a magia\\nToda vez que um card de criatura é colocado no cemitério de um oponente vindo de qualquer lugar, você pode fazer com que Lazav, Mentor dos Dimir, torne-se uma cópia daquele card, com a exceção de que seu nome ainda é Lazav, Mentor dos Dimir, é lendário além de seus outros tipos e tem resistência a magia e esta habilidade.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4383079-3f42-467a-88e2-9209c096532c\', \'multiverseId\': 496834}, \'multiverseid\': 496834}, {\'name\': \'Лазав, Вдохновитель Димиров\', \'text\': \'Порчеустойчивость\\nКаждый раз, когда карта существа попадает откуда-либо на кладбище оппонента, вы можете заставить Лазава, Вдохновителя Димиров стать копией той карты, но при этом его имя Лазав, Вдохновитель Димиров, он является легендарным в дополнение к своим другим типам и имеет Порчеустойчивость и эту способность.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edfba86d-9813-4d82-9627-62a97004880b\', \'multiverseId\': 496968}, \'multiverseid\': 496968}, {\'name\': \'底密尔首脑拉札夫\', \'text\': \'辟邪\\n每当一张生物牌从任何区域置入对手的坟墓场时，你可以使底密尔首脑拉札夫成为该牌的复制品，但其名称仍是底密尔首脑拉札夫，额外具有传奇此超类别，且具有辟邪与此异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96139e3a-8f99-4370-bd0e-f1a2050e8081\', \'multiverseId\': 497102}, \'multiverseid\': 497102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebendiger Wirbelwind\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, wirf eine Länderkarte ab: Der Lebendige Wirbelwind fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{G}: Bringe ein getapptes Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Hufschläge von Ilharg erwecken die ältesten Orte Ravnicas!"\\n—Nikya, Bewahrerin der Tradition\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496165&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc361cb-486e-481a-9e12-3847c33f6f55\', \'multiverseId\': 496165}, \'multiverseid\': 496165}, {\'name\': \'Tornado viviente\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, descartar una carta de tierra: El Tornado viviente hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{G}: Regresa una tierra girada que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Los antiguos lugares de Rávnica se despiertan, azuzados por el hozar de Ilharg en la tierra!".\\n—Nikya de las viejas costumbres\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d010abf-9209-46c4-a3d8-351ecc63957d\', \'multiverseId\': 496299}, \'multiverseid\': 496299}, {\'name\': \'Tornade vivante\', \'text\': "{1}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain : La Tornade vivante inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{G} : Renvoyez un terrain engagé que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux antiques de Ravnica s\'éveillent, dérangés par le martèlement des sabots d\'Ilharg ! »\\n—Nikya des Traditions", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f661b6ff-21b3-481f-8a66-0b5a12bbb434\', \'multiverseId\': 496433}, \'multiverseid\': 496433}, {\'name\': \'Tornado Vivente\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, Scarta una carta terra: Il Tornado Vivente infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{G}: Fai tornare una terra TAPpata che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli antichi luoghi di Ravnica si risvegliano, scossi dagli zoccoli di Ilharg!"\\n—Nikya delle Antiche Usanze\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58a6dc6-1f92-40e9-82bb-91d589949cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 496567}, \'multiverseid\': 496567}, {\'name\': \'生ける竜巻\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, 土地・カード１枚を捨てる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。生ける竜巻はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n{G}：あなたがコントロールしていてタップ状態の土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「ラヴニカの古き土地が目覚めた。イルハグの足音によって！」\\n――旧き道のニーキャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c12caad-1e3b-488d-9831-e7e8fe0fb1f1\', \'multiverseId\': 496701}, \'multiverseid\': 496701}, {\'name\': \'Tornado Vivo\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, descarte um card de terreno: Tornado Vivo causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n{G}: Devolva um terreno virado que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lugares ancestrais de Ravnica despertam, agitados pela batida dos cascos de Ilharg!"\\n— Nikya dos Costumes Antigos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fed9cb3-3924-49bb-b082-edbabd99d237\', \'multiverseId\': 496835}, \'multiverseid\': 496835}, {\'name\': \'Живой Смерч\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, сбросьте карту земли: Живой Смерч наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\\n{G}: верните повернутую землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Древние закоулки Равники пробуждаются, заслышав топот копыт Ильхарга!»\\n— Никия, приверженка старины\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5a8e98-804c-413c-8889-cfcbda13d382\', \'multiverseId\': 496969}, \'multiverseid\': 496969}, {\'name\': \'生体龙卷\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}，弃一张地牌：生体龙卷对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n{G}：将一个由你操控且已横置的地移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「衣哈格的铁蹄惊世间，拉尼卡古地皆醒转。」\\n～古式信徒妮恰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b74d14-ee80-4f27-9bc0-5bbd4abf025f\', \'multiverseId\': 497103}, \'multiverseid\': 497103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mahnender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land und nicht der Mahnende Engel ist, ins Exil schicken.\\nWenn der Mahnende Engel das Spiel verlässt, bringe alle Karten, die mit ihm ins Exil geschickt wurden, unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da9f010-febf-4069-a914-b628412bd891\', \'multiverseId\': 496082}, \'multiverseid\': 496082}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de admonición\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes exiliar el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra distinto del Ángel de admonición.\\nCuando el Ángel de admonición deje el campo de batalla, regresa al campo de batalla bajo el control de sus propietarios todas las cartas exiliadas con él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a91b0fe-91f0-4962-812c-5b2e668f77eb\', \'multiverseId\': 496216}, \'multiverseid\': 496216}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'admonition", \'text\': "Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez exiler un permanent non-terrain ciblé autre que l\'Ange de l\'admonition.\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'admonition quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires, toutes les cartes qu\'il a exilées.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23a867e-15d6-4ddd-88a7-4208afff7278\', \'multiverseId\': 496350}, \'multiverseid\': 496350}, {\'name\': \'Angelo del Monito\', \'text\': "Volare\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi esiliare un permanente non terra bersaglio diverso dall\'Angelo del Monito.\\nQuando l\'Angelo del Monito lascia il campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte esiliate da esso sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526a4bff-f9c4-43e0-a7c3-0568e75402c8\', \'multiverseId\': 496484}, \'multiverseid\': 496484}, {\'name\': \'忠告の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、忠告の天使でも土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\n忠告の天使が戦場を離れたとき、これによって追放されたカードをすべてオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3336f59-019e-4087-b39a-7d947dca95c4\', \'multiverseId\': 496618}, \'multiverseid\': 496618}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Admonição\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode exilar a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno e que não seja Anjo da Admonição.\\nQuando Anjo da Admonição deixar o campo de batalha, devolva todos os cards exilados com ele ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1e4230-9363-4054-91c9-ba32fea3526a\', \'multiverseId\': 496752}, \'multiverseid\': 496752}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Предостережения\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете изгнать целевой не являющийся землей перманент, отличный от Ангела Предостережения.\\nКогда Ангел Предостережения покидает поле битвы, верните все изгнанные им карты на поле битвы под контролем их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209c0b90-b3fa-43dc-b2a3-491a2062e827\', \'multiverseId\': 496886}, \'multiverseid\': 496886}, {\'name\': \'告诫天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以放逐目标告诫天使以外的非地永久物。\\n当告诫天使离开战场时，将所有以它放逐的牌在各自拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4905e1-2e08-42dd-91b9-3a13166063f3\', \'multiverseId\': 497020}, \'multiverseid\': 497020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4dc673-88cf-477c-a63c-6f459851ec0f\', \'multiverseId\': 496207}, \'multiverseid\': 496207}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d276733-5ed3-4403-b1a1-42713c0e1d31\', \'multiverseId\': 496341}, \'multiverseid\': 496341}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d31eb72-a9c7-4d08-8f71-a7f58959ab86\', \'multiverseId\': 496475}, \'multiverseid\': 496475}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934c19e0-f2d4-4510-b971-dcd5f4a259eb\', \'multiverseId\': 496609}, \'multiverseid\': 496609}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから共通の土地タイプを持つ基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a173f2d-855c-4f54-bea3-def6ff8cabc5\', \'multiverseId\': 496743}, \'multiverseid\': 496743}, {\'name\': \'Paisagem Infinita\', \'text\': \'Paisagem Infinita entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Infinita: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico que compartilhem um tipo de terreno, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3caae40f-b8e8-4335-8d25-6d7477222e72\', \'multiverseId\': 496877}, \'multiverseid\': 496877}, {\'name\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт\', \'text\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Многоликий Ландшафт: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, у которых есть одинаковый тип земли, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf5f195f-4af6-478e-804e-b333db024aad\', \'multiverseId\': 497011}, \'multiverseid\': 497011}, {\'name\': \'繁茂地境\', \'text\': \'繁茂地境须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲繁茂地境：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张具共通地类别的基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13683d15-ac9f-4459-9c3c-ed0f55df4357\', \'multiverseId\': 497145}, \'multiverseid\': 497145}]', "[{'name': 'Marangfluss-Herumtreiber', 'text': 'Der Marangfluss-Herumtreiber kann nicht blocken und nicht geblockt werden.\\nDu kannst den Marangfluss-Herumtreiber aus deinem Friedhof wirken, solange du eine schwarze oder grüne bleibende Karte kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Die Wasser des Marang spülen Spuren und Blut gleichermaßen fort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496101&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7d29306-47db-4135-a995-ba05925c3da5', 'multiverseId': 496101}, 'multiverseid': 496101}, {'name': 'Rondador del río Marang', 'text': 'El Rondador del río Marang no puede bloquear y no puede ser bloqueado.\\nPuedes lanzar el Rondador del río Marang desde tu cementerio mientras controles un permanente negro o verde.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón humano', 'flavor': 'Las corrientes del Marang borran las huellas y la sangre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496235&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '993074b6-6be2-457e-8d8e-f109712e30f4', 'multiverseId': 496235}, 'multiverseid': 496235}, {'name': 'Rôdeur du fleuve Marang', 'text': 'Le Rôdeur du fleuve Marang ne peut pas bloquer et ne peut pas être bloqué.\\nVous pouvez lancer le Rôdeur du fleuve Marang depuis votre cimetière tant que vous contrôlez un permanent noir ou vert.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et gredin', 'flavor': 'Les courants du Marang effacent les pistes et le sang.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496369&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cfe8eb3-e241-46e6-9869-ca3f5fa2fa59', 'multiverseId': 496369}, 'multiverseid': 496369}, {'name': 'Predatore del Fiume Marang', 'text': 'Il Predatore del Fiume Marang non può bloccare e non può essere bloccato.\\nPuoi lanciare il Predatore del Fiume Marang dal tuo cimitero fintanto che controlli un permanente nero o verde.', 'type': 'Creatura — Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': 'Le correnti del Marang portano via sia le tracce che il sangue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496503&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c0f3165-156b-4291-88f5-6d28c3145954', 'multiverseId': 496503}, 'multiverseid': 496503}, {'name': 'マラング川をうろつくもの', 'text': 'マラング川をうろつくものではブロックできず、マラング川をうろつくものはブロックされない。\\nあなたが黒か緑のパーマネントをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたの墓地からマラング川をうろつくものを唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': 'マラング川の水流が足跡も血痕もすべて洗い流す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496637&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e7d2efa-6f36-4a93-b06f-0531f83833f2', 'multiverseId': 496637}, 'multiverseid': 496637}, {'name': 'Espreitador do Rio Marang', 'text': 'Espreitador do Rio Marang não pode bloquear nem ser bloqueado.\\nVocê poderá conjurar Espreitador do Rio Marang do seu cemitério enquanto controlar uma permanente preta ou verde.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ladino', 'flavor': 'A correnteza do Marang lava trilhas e sangue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496771&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e1e373c-5020-49ed-a0c2-5134d8bf35a6', 'multiverseId': 496771}, 'multiverseid': 496771}, {'name': 'Охотник с Реки Маранг', 'text': 'Охотник с Реки Маранг не может блокировать и не может быть заблокирован.\\nВы можете разыграть Охотника с Реки Маранг из вашего кладбища, пока вы контролируете черный или зеленый перманент.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Бродяга', 'flavor': 'Воды Маранга смывают и следы, и кровь.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496905&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2c801e7-ef15-48ac-b1ed-84ccce806555', 'multiverseId': 496905}, 'multiverseid': 496905}, {'name': '马兰河游掠者', 'text': '马兰河游掠者不能进行阻挡，也不能被阻挡。\\n只要你操控黑色或绿色永久物，你便可以从你的坟墓场中施放马兰河游掠者。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '踪迹和血迹都一并被马兰河水冲刷殆尽。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497039&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58642e44-da96-4f7c-a6ad-545901711ac2', 'multiverseId': 497039}, 'multiverseid': 497039}]", '[{\'name\': \'Meisterdieb\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meisterdieb ins Spiel kommt, übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, solange du den Meisterdieb kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Besitz bedeutet zehn Zehntel des Gesetzes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4796327d-3da1-4db5-be0e-429dfc48c0dc\', \'multiverseId\': 496102}, \'multiverseid\': 496102}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón experto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ladrón experto entre al campo de batalla, gana el control del artefacto objetivo mientras controles al Ladrón experto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'La posesión es diez décimas de la ley.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020f55ce-afd6-4366-92c3-d4db63d2521d\', \'multiverseId\': 496236}, \'multiverseid\': 496236}, {\'name\': \'Maître voleur\', \'text\': "Quand le Maître voleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, acquérez le contrôle de l\'artefact ciblé tant que vous contrôlez le Maître voleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "La richesse consiste bien plus dans l\'usage qu\'on en fait que dans la possession.\\n—Aristote", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacc569a-49c5-460b-983f-4352751c8508\', \'multiverseId\': 496370}, \'multiverseid\': 496370}, {\'name\': \'Maestro del Ladrocinio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Maestro del Ladrocinio entra nel campo di battaglia, prendi il controllo di un artefatto bersaglio fintanto che controlli il Maestro del Ladrocinio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Secondo la legge, non esistono gradi diversi di possesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107be37e-fa1d-4865-a8d1-585bf7116187\', \'multiverseId\': 496504}, \'multiverseid\': 496504}, {\'name\': \'練達の盗賊\', \'text\': \'練達の盗賊が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたが練達の盗賊をコントロールし続けているかぎり、あなたはそれのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'所有こそ法そのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b8637c-047c-4206-9e3b-748feb005226\', \'multiverseId\': 496638}, \'multiverseid\': 496638}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão Mestre\', \'text\': \'Quando Ladrão Mestre entrar no campo de batalha, ganhe o controle do artefato alvo enquanto você controlar Ladrão Mestre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Quem foi à roça, perdeu a carroça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140b6a9c-db13-41e4-be6b-0cc032052bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 496772}, \'multiverseid\': 496772}, {\'name\': \'Искусный Похититель\', \'text\': \'Когда Искусный Похититель выходит на поле битвы, получите контроль над целевым артефактом на все время, пока вы контролируете Искусного Похитителя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Собственность — это десять десятых закона.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa9b073-353a-4ac4-8902-cb9024eaa79d\', \'multiverseId\': 496906}, \'multiverseid\': 496906}, {\'name\': \'神偷\', \'text\': \'当神偷进战场时，于你操控神偷的时段内，获得目标神器的操控权。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'先抢先赢。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'768534a7-35bf-4e77-b2bb-9fb273452955\', \'multiverseId\': 497040}, \'multiverseid\': 497040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Militärspionage\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du mit zwei oder mehr Kreaturen angreifst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Schlachtfeld zu kennen bedeutet, die Schritte des Feindes vorauszusehen. Den Feind zu kennen bedeutet, den Sieg vorauszusehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496103&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ef4c90-c916-41b0-9c62-2150263ccea2\', \'multiverseId\': 496103}, \'multiverseid\': 496103}, {\'name\': \'Inteligencia militar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques con dos o más criaturas, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Conocer el campo de batalla es anticiparse al enemigo. Conocer al enemigo es anticipar la victoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682891e1-9ba5-465f-a979-2753b8fe9220\', \'multiverseId\': 496237}, \'multiverseid\': 496237}, {\'name\': \'Renseignements militaires\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec deux créatures ou plus, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Connaître le champ de bataille, c\'est anticiper l\'ennemi. Connaître l\'ennemi, c\'est anticiper la victoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3b25209-a408-487f-bbd2-90aad83f2155\', \'multiverseId\': 496371}, \'multiverseid\': 496371}, {\'name\': \'Strategia Militare\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con due o più creature, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Se conosci il campo di battaglia, avrai in pugno il nemico. Se conosci il nemico, avrai in pugno la vittoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6d9919d-12fb-4b3a-bf37-b835cfd1f1e2\', \'multiverseId\': 496505}, \'multiverseid\': 496505}, {\'name\': \'軍事情報\', \'text\': \'あなたが２体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'戦場を知ることは、敵を予測することである。敵を知ることは、勝利を予測することである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b37d61-108e-4d8d-a8e4-3193c7a95021\', \'multiverseId\': 496639}, \'multiverseid\': 496639}, {\'name\': \'Inteligência Militar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar com duas ou mais criaturas, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Conhecer o campo de batalha é antecipar o movimento do inimigo. Conhecer o inimigo é antecipar a vitória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6566c79-3853-41ee-8ab3-d6a45d82ac72\', \'multiverseId\': 496773}, \'multiverseid\': 496773}, {\'name\': \'Военная Разведка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы атакуете двумя или более существами, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Если ты знаешь поле боя, то можешь предугадать действия врага. Если ты знаешь врага, то можешь ожидать победы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cdf4996-a192-4b59-956b-12063b80669e\', \'multiverseId\': 496907}, \'multiverseid\': 496907}, {\'name\': \'军事情报\', \'text\': \'每当你以两个或更多生物攻击时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'了解战场就可料敌先机。了解敌人便能志在必得。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c01714-88b8-4848-96cb-c95c0a4ecdd9\', \'multiverseId\': 497041}, \'multiverseid\': 497041}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mina und Denn, Wildgeborene\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\n{R}{G}, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Grünweberin Mina und ihr Zwillingsbruder Denn führen die letzten Mul Daya in eine ungewisse Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496166&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682b1817-fbc9-4520-9fc6-d116f3f60f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 496166}, \'multiverseid\': 496166}, {\'name\': \'Mina y Denn, nacidos salvajes\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional en cada uno de tus turnos.\\n{R}{G}, regresar una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elfo aliado\', \'flavor\': \'La tejedora verde Mina y su hermano gemelo, Denn, guían a los últimos de Mul Daya hacia un futuro incierto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5f073b-516f-4c22-bff9-d5ae4a74aee6\', \'multiverseId\': 496300}, \'multiverseid\': 496300}, {\'name\': \'Mina et Denn, nés de la nature\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de vos tours.\\n{R}{G}, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire : Une créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et allié\', \'flavor\': \'La tisseverdure Mina et son frère jumeau Denn mènent les derniers elfes de Mul Daya vers un futur incertain.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9da0cff-bdcf-49d1-90e4-9f39abe870e7\', \'multiverseId\': 496434}, \'multiverseid\': 496434}, {\'name\': \'Mina e Denn, Nati Selvaggi\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare una terra addizionale in ognuno dei tuoi turni.\\n{R}{G}, Fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario: Una creatura bersaglio ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'La tessitrice Mina e il suo gemello Denn guidano gli ultimi dei Mul Daya verso un futuro incerto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb314fec-ab9c-483f-ba94-3668d379ed96\', \'multiverseId\': 496568}, \'multiverseid\': 496568}, {\'name\': \'野生生まれのミーナとデーン\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加で土地を１つプレイしてもよい。\\n{R}{G}, あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'緑織りのミーナと双子の弟デーンは、生き残ったムル・ダヤの人々の中心となり、先の見えない時代を切り拓いている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbea4ab7-b1a8-4ddc-a53e-ee884546613a\', \'multiverseId\': 496702}, \'multiverseid\': 496702}, {\'name\': \'Mina e Denn, Nascidos Selvagens\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar um terreno adicional em cada um de seus turnos.\\n{R}{G}, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono: A criatura alvo ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'A trança-verde Mina e seu irmão gêmeo Denn lideram os últimos Mul Daya rumo a um futuro incerto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c786b8f-b156-407e-b920-9e84091898bd\', \'multiverseId\': 496836}, \'multiverseid\': 496836}, {\'name\': \'Мина и Денн, Дикорожденные\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать одну дополнительную землю в каждом из ваших ходов.\\n{R}{G}, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца: целевое существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'Мина из Зеленой Спирали и ее брат-близнец Денн вели последних из племени Мул Дайя к их неясному будущему.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b432d8-1070-403e-a943-b2903f2ab08f\', \'multiverseId\': 496970}, \'multiverseid\': 496970}, {\'name\': \'不驯双生弥娜与丹恩\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。\\n{R}{G}，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上：目标生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'织碧弥娜和她的双胞胎兄弟丹恩领导着慕达雅最后的幸存者，迈向未知的未来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf62199-5597-432f-9ada-b4d628cfe2bf\', \'multiverseId\': 497104}, \'multiverseid\': 497104}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mord\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schicksal oder ein Akt des Willens — jede Herrschaft findet einmal ihr Ende."\\n—Kethis, die Versteckte Hand\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02cf7845-78cf-48e4-a01a-f08f76d70895\', \'multiverseId\': 496119}, \'multiverseid\': 496119}, {\'name\': \'Asesinato\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya sea por el destino o por la voluntad, todo reinado debe llegar a su fin".\\n—Kethis, la Mano Oculta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c16f7b4-9789-41b8-9344-22850ff88ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 496253}, \'multiverseid\': 496253}, {\'name\': \'Homicide\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Volontairement ou par intervention du destin, un règne touche toujours à sa fin. »\\n—Kethis, la main cachée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'455972e4-38f6-46a5-982e-1402228fc962\', \'multiverseId\': 496387}, \'multiverseid\': 496387}, {\'name\': \'Omicidio\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per destino o per volontà, tutti i regni devono giungere al termine."\\n—Kethis, la Mano Nascosta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886efcbc-a5db-4adb-94fb-070ef4ee8bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 496521}, \'multiverseid\': 496521}, {\'name\': \'殺害\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「運命であれ意思であれ、治世には終わりが来る。」\\n――隠された手、ケシス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0ffb15-4e96-410f-9e61-628d481c87ba\', \'multiverseId\': 496655}, \'multiverseid\': 496655}, {\'name\': \'Homicídio\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Por obra do destino ou da vontade, todo reino precisa chegar ao fim."\\n— Kethis, a Mão Oculta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c081ce-490f-4329-8b15-7a971aca5185\', \'multiverseId\': 496789}, \'multiverseid\': 496789}, {\'name\': \'Убийство\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждому властителю приходит конец — волею ли рока или чьей-то злой волей».\\n— Кетис, Тайная Десница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa2b328f-e73d-434e-a5d7-f420cc231401\', \'multiverseId\': 496923}, \'multiverseid\': 496923}, {\'name\': \'谋杀\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「王朝终有倾覆时，或因天灾，或因人祸。」\\n～幕宾柯希斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d136cbe4-a464-4605-826e-e91edcdeefd5\', \'multiverseId\': 497057}, \'multiverseid\': 497057}]', "[{'name': 'Multani, Yavimayas Avatar', 'text': 'Reichweite, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nMultani, Yavimayas Avatar, erhält +1/+1 für jedes Land, das du kontrollierst, und jede Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof.\\n{1}{G}, bringe zwei Länder, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück: Bringe Multani aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496147&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a75e1df-e52f-427f-b9b7-3f4cf622bb45', 'multiverseId': 496147}, 'multiverseid': 496147}, {'name': 'Multani, avatar de Yavimaya', 'text': 'Alcance, arrolla.\\nMultani, avatar de Yavimaya obtiene +1/+1 por cada tierra que controlas y por cada carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\\n{1}{G}, regresar dos tierras que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Regresa a Multani de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Avatar elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496281&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5858ec6-fb87-4d7d-a3c4-e98def8e0e3e', 'multiverseId': 496281}, 'multiverseid': 496281}, {'name': 'Multani, avatar de la Yavimaya', 'text': 'Portée, piétinement\\nMultani, avatar de la Yavimaya gagne +1/+1 pour chaque terrain que vous contrôlez et chaque carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\n{1}{G}, renvoyez deux terrains que vous contrôlez dans la main de leur propriétaire : Renvoyez Multani depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : élémental et avatar', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496415&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e90738e5-e6ff-4f8d-8399-35e6755a88b1', 'multiverseId': 496415}, 'multiverseid': 496415}, {'name': 'Multani, Avatar di Yavimaya', 'text': 'Raggiungere, travolgere\\nMultani, Avatar di Yavimaya prende +1/+1 per ogni terra che controlli e ogni carta terra nel tuo cimitero.\\n{1}{G}, Fai tornare due terre che controlli in mano ai rispettivi proprietari: Riprendi in mano Multani dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Avatar Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496549&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6eb71940-3f57-4ff9-8a3b-40779a80523b', 'multiverseId': 496549}, 'multiverseid': 496549}, {'name': 'ヤヴィマヤの化身、ムルタニ', 'text': '到達、トランプル\\nヤヴィマヤの化身、ムルタニは、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つとあなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{1}{G}, あなたがコントロールしている土地２つをオーナーの手札に戻す：あなたの墓地からヤヴィマヤの化身、ムルタニをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・アバター', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496683&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8d4d780-28c8-46a2-8902-84abc9654659', 'multiverseId': 496683}, 'multiverseid': 496683}, {'name': 'Multani, Avatar de Yavimaya', 'text': 'Alcance, atropelar\\nMultani, Avatar de Yavimaya, recebe +1/+1 para cada terreno que você controla e cada card de terreno em seu cemitério.\\n{1}{G}, devolva dois terrenos que você controla para a mão de seu dono: Devolva Multani de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Elemental Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496817&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d520583-3eda-4400-ab4d-601b4bb9d2eb', 'multiverseId': 496817}, 'multiverseid': 496817}, {'name': 'Мултани, Аватара Явимайи', 'text': 'Захват, Пробивной удар\\nМултани, Аватара Явимайи получает +1/+1 за каждую землю под вашим контролем и каждую карту земли на вашем кладбище.\\n{1}{G}, верните две земли под вашим контролем в руки их владельцев: верните Мултани из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль Аватара', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496951&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04955daa-90dc-4fa8-bd1f-561082a67a4d', 'multiverseId': 496951}, 'multiverseid': 496951}, {'name': '亚维马雅化身穆塔尼', 'text': '延势，践踏\\n你每操控一个地或你的坟墓场中每有一张地牌，亚维马雅化身穆塔尼便得+1/+1。\\n{1}{G}，将两个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上：将穆塔尼从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～元素／圣者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497085&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b8fe780-1430-49a4-a6f9-46922e7ba8c2', 'multiverseId': 497085}, 'multiverseid': 497085}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachtheuler\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {2}{B}{B} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDer Nachtheuler und die verzauberte Kreatur erhalten je +X/+X, wobei X die Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in allen Friedhöfen ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a675ec10-222d-463f-8970-4135e8275348\', \'multiverseId\': 496121}, \'multiverseid\': 496121}, {\'name\': \'Aullador nocturno\', \'text\': \'Concesión {2}{B}{B}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de Aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nEl Aullador nocturno y la criatura encantada obtienen +X/+X cada uno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en todos los cementerios.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc80972e-9d00-4f18-a900-bf5ab8e73aff\', \'multiverseId\': 496255}, \'multiverseid\': 496255}, {\'name\': \'Hurlenuit\', \'text\': "Grâce {2}{B}{B} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLe Hurlenuit et la créature enchantée gagnent chacun +X/+X, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans tous les cimetières.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb596df8-e283-4b39-9fb4-e09d912aceff\', \'multiverseId\': 496389}, \'multiverseid\': 496389}, {\'name\': \'Ululatore Notturno\', \'text\': "Conferire {2}{B}{B} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nL\'Ululatore Notturno e la creatura incantata prendono +X/+X, dove X è il numero di carte creatura in tutti i cimiteri.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d1ffc0-bfbf-4189-8f48-198e8ddbcd1a\', \'multiverseId\': 496523}, \'multiverseid\': 496523}, {\'name\': \'夜の咆哮獣\', \'text\': \'授与{2}{B}{B}（このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ・呪文である。クリーチャーについていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n夜の咆哮獣とエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それぞれ＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはすべての墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b817356-7e60-482a-84d3-ebfe63fad452\', \'multiverseId\': 496657}, \'multiverseid\': 496657}, {\'name\': \'Uivador Noturno\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {2}{B}{B} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nUivador Noturno e a criatura encantada recebem +X/+X cada um, sendo X o número de cards de criatura em todos os cemitérios.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fef82eb-282b-4427-9846-79f8f239a6fc\', \'multiverseId\': 496791}, \'multiverseid\': 496791}, {\'name\': \'Воющий в Ночи\', \'text\': \'Дар {2}{B}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nВоющий в Ночи и зачарованное существо получают по +X/+X, где Х — количество карт существ на всех кладбищах.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8f12f2-a809-4d5a-8548-fc72f7b10dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 496925}, \'multiverseid\': 496925}, {\'name\': \'夜嚎怪\', \'text\': \'神授{2}{B}{B}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n夜嚎怪与所结附的生物各得+X/+X，X为所有坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891258b0-318e-4cf1-a29b-58dbbf804605\', \'multiverseId\': 497059}, \'multiverseid\': 497059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtschleiersylphide\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Nachtschleiersylphide angreift, wende Überwachen 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind hier im vierzigsten Stock mit einem Fenster und ohne Balkon. Niemand kann hier reinkommen."\\n—Minosz, Orzhov-Sicherheitshauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0d34d2-a907-4c50-ba39-f335babd2ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 496104}, \'multiverseid\': 496104}, {\'name\': \'Hada de Velo Nocturno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Hada de Velo Nocturno ataque, escruta 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos en la planta 40, con una sola ventana y sin balcón. Es imposible que entre nadie".\\n—Minosz, jefe de seguridad orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a5c1fe-fed9-4c05-baf5-4d660f740c07\', \'multiverseId\': 496238}, \'multiverseid\': 496238}, {\'name\': \'Farfadette voilenuit\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Farfadette voilenuit attaque, surveillez 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Nous sommes au quarantième étage, il n\'y a qu\'une seule fenêtre et pas de balcon. Personne ne peut entrer ici. »\\n—Minosz, chef de la sécurité d\'Orzhov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0ee55f5-d7cf-4456-a8fc-a8060e7e7ba7\', \'multiverseId\': 496372}, \'multiverseid\': 496372}, {\'name\': \'Spiritella di Velo Notturno\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Spiritella di Velo Notturno attacca, sorveglia 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi metterla nel tuo cimitero.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo al quarantesimo piano, con una sola finestra senza balcone. È impossibile che qualcuno riesca a entrare."\\n—Minosz, responsabile della sicurezza Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b88c3a2-1e98-4034-8c3f-a28f8f83aa39\', \'multiverseId\': 496506}, \'multiverseid\': 496506}, {\'name\': \'夜帷のスプライト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n夜帷のスプライトが攻撃するたび、諜報１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは四十階で、窓は一つ、ベランダはない。誰かが侵入するなど、有り得ない。」\\n――オルゾフの警備責任者、ミーノシュ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8410beb7-ac45-4eb0-8448-0602b680185c\', \'multiverseId\': 496640}, \'multiverseid\': 496640}, {\'name\': \'Sílfide do Véu da Noite\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Sílfide do Véu da Noite atacar, use vigiar 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card em seu cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos no quadragésimo andar, com uma janela e sem varanda. É impossível alguém entrar."\\n— Minosz, chefe da segurança Orzhov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5a343a6-13d5-464a-b74d-e4b5092ada17\', \'multiverseId\': 496774}, \'multiverseid\': 496774}, {\'name\': \'Фея Ночного Покрова\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Фея Ночного Покрова атакует, используйте Слежку 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту на ваше кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы на сороковом этаже, тут одно окно и нет балкона. Никто сюда не попадет».\\n— Минош, начальник охраны Орзовов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d55566-8906-42fd-85b9-14e2a5820878\', \'multiverseId\': 496908}, \'multiverseid\': 496908}, {\'name\': \'夜篷仙子\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当夜篷仙子攻击时，刺探1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我们这是在四十楼，只有一扇窗户，连阳台都没有。谁都不可能进得来。」\\n～欧佐夫警卫长米诺斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'712acf24-d1d3-4dd6-8c36-f148d3449c90\', \'multiverseId\': 497042}, \'multiverseid\': 497042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nadelfels-Plateau\', \'text\': \'Das Nadelfels-Plateau kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Das Nadelfels-Plateau wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/1 roten und weißen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Doppelschlag. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496209&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7d12f8-a681-42d1-87f5-d9cdf79cbe45\', \'multiverseId\': 496209}, \'multiverseid\': 496209}, {\'name\': \'Cimas aguja\', \'text\': \'Las Cimas aguja entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Las Cimas aguja se convierten en una criatura Elemental roja y blanca 2/1 con la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c1c8a1-070a-414d-8a5b-546da5c590f9\', \'multiverseId\': 496343}, \'multiverseid\': 496343}, {\'name\': \'Cimes aiguilles\', \'text\': "Les Cimes aiguilles arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W} : Les Cimes aiguilles deviennent une créature 2/1 rouge et blanche Élémental avec la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c38e85f-7fe8-4168-989d-0bc58ecf5362\', \'multiverseId\': 496477}, \'multiverseid\': 496477}, {\'name\': \'Guglie a Spillo\', \'text\': \'Le Guglie a Spillo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Le Guglie a Spillo diventano una creatura Elementale 2/1 rossa e bianca con doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'339a98d5-c6b2-45da-928e-b7fde74e1436\', \'multiverseId\': 496611}, \'multiverseid\': 496611}, {\'name\': \'鋭い突端\', \'text\': \'鋭い突端はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{W}：ターン終了時まで、鋭い突端は二段攻撃を持ち赤であり白である２/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326dbd2c-cb5c-4f0f-906d-be60b0501d16\', \'multiverseId\': 496745}, \'multiverseid\': 496745}, {\'name\': \'Picos das Agulhas\', \'text\': \'Picos das Agulhas entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Picos das Agulhas torna-se uma criatura vermelha e branca 2/1 do tipo Elemental com golpe duplo até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a615193b-daa4-4a0e-9700-0c682215a4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 496879}, \'multiverseid\': 496879}, {\'name\': \'Острые Шпили\', \'text\': \'Острые Шпили выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Острые Шпили становятся существом 2/1 красный и белый Элементаль с Двойным ударом до конца хода. При этом они остаются землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5874d2-3d83-45c9-b48b-31bde4411731\', \'multiverseId\': 497013}, \'multiverseid\': 497013}, {\'name\': \'针岩尖峰\', \'text\': \'针岩尖峰须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。\\n{2}{R}{W}：针岩尖峰成为2/1红白双色，具连击异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'856e0b03-b1a0-4c12-8d0c-daee8b10f962\', \'multiverseId\': 497147}, \'multiverseid\': 497147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekromagische Auslese\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen und bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurde, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie. Schicke die Nekromagische Auslese ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Er schlurfte aus der Aschewolke und ließ den Knochenhaufen hinter sich, völlig unbeirrt von seinem eigenen Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b571385-aba4-4ddd-b3ab-6b57c658a876\', \'multiverseId\': 496120}, \'multiverseid\': 496120}, {\'name\': \'Selección nigromántica\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Luego, regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura puesta en un cementerio de esta manera. Es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos. Exilia la Selección nigromántica.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Se arrastró entre la nube de cenizas y polvo de hueso, sin ceder al desaliento de su propia extinción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989e183b-2a45-4ac6-b8db-81b4f8d378a6\', \'multiverseId\': 496254}, \'multiverseid\': 496254}, {\'name\': \'Sélection nécromantique\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature mise dans un cimetière de cette manière. C\'est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types. Exilez la Sélection nécromantique.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Peu découragé par sa propre extinction, il jaillit en titubant du nuage de cendres et de poussières d\'os.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d5a93f-7bde-44e3-b32c-3326355133a5\', \'multiverseId\': 496388}, \'multiverseid\': 496388}, {\'name\': \'Selezione Necromantica\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura messa in un cimitero in questo modo. È uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori. Esilia la Selezione Necromantica.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Uscì arrancando dalla nuvola di cenere e polvere d\'osso, incurante della propria morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d6b742-3cea-4d69-9f7b-4e997595f18e\', \'multiverseId\': 496522}, \'multiverseid\': 496522}, {\'name\': \'屍術淘汰\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべて破壊する。その後、これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それは、他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。屍術淘汰を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'それは自らの死滅など意に介さぬがごとく、灰と骨粉の煙の中からよろめき出た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f225e46-9157-489f-b3e8-39ced3409f00\', \'multiverseId\': 496656}, \'multiverseid\': 496656}, {\'name\': \'Seleção Necromântica\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Em seguida, devolva um card de criatura colocado em um cemitério desta forma ao campo de batalha sob seu controle. Ele é um Zumbi preto além de suas outras cores e tipos. Exile Seleção Necromântica.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ele saiu cambaleante da nuvem de cinzas e poeira de ossos, sem se abalar com a própria morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78aa9580-4f71-43b3-b6a4-fdf359b80183\', \'multiverseId\': 496790}, \'multiverseid\': 496790}, {\'name\': \'Некромантический Отбор\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа, затем верните карту существа, положенную на кладбище таким образом, на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Она является черным Зомби в дополнение к своим другим цветам и типам. Изгоните Некромантический Отбор.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Он вышел из облака праха и костяной пыли, и собственная смерть не могла остановить его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3621ea-71bd-47da-9a13-2902cd2f3518\', \'multiverseId\': 496924}, \'multiverseid\': 496924}, {\'name\': \'物尽天择\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物，然后将一张以此法置入坟墓场的生物牌在你的操控下移回战场。它额外具有黑色此颜色与灵俑此类别。放逐物尽天择。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'残灰散尽，骨骸落定，它自混沌中蹒跚而出，饶是自身灭绝也未能惊动分毫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d4d5dc-778a-4816-8ba8-4035396c9a34\', \'multiverseId\': 497058}, \'multiverseid\': 497058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nissas Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Du erhältst 7 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem sie wieder mit der Welt verbunden war, spürte Nissa, wie Zendikars Macht sie durchströmte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1379c092-0559-4f9d-99ea-f0ede023d40f\', \'multiverseId\': 496148}, \'multiverseid\': 496148}, {\'name\': \'Renovación de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Ganas 7 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez restablecida su conexión con el plano, Nissa sintió que el poder de Zendikar vibraba a través de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b94523-124d-4377-9ed2-9d24ef25887e\', \'multiverseId\': 496282}, \'multiverseid\': 496282}, {\'name\': \'Renouveau de Nissa\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez votre bibliothèque. Vous gagnez 7 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'De nouveau connectée au plan, Nissa sentit la puissance de Zendikar déferler en elle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7056f7ec-0b86-4df8-adf9-20faa6a59622\', \'multiverseId\': 496416}, \'multiverseid\': 496416}, {\'name\': \'Rinnovamento di Nissa\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Guadagni 7 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo aver recuperato il suo legame con il piano, Nissa sentì il potere di Zendikar crescere dentro di lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04adfb81-9ee4-4a51-a0e6-0e08f811bda1\', \'multiverseId\': 496550}, \'multiverseid\': 496550}, {\'name\': \'ニッサの復興\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。あなたは７点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女と次元の繋がりが回復し、ゼンディカーの活力が自身を通じて湧き出すのをニッサは感じた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d1f092-0a89-46f3-a07a-7d3365e47153\', \'multiverseId\': 496684}, \'multiverseid\': 496684}, {\'name\': \'Renovação de Nissa\', \'text\': \'Procure até três cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório. Você ganha 7 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Com sua ligação com o plano restaurada, Nissa sentiu o poder de Zendikar invadi-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87e110f-5280-4e3e-a992-6079d9981292\', \'multiverseId\': 496818}, \'multiverseid\': 496818}, {\'name\': \'Обновление Ниссы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. Вы получаете 7 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Нисса чувствовала, как течет через нее сила Зендикара. Ее связь с землей восстановилась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72260160-0dd8-4139-90be-6724cdc7759d\', \'multiverseId\': 496952}, \'multiverseid\': 496952}, {\'name\': \'妮莎重光\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。你获得7点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'妮莎恢复与赞迪卡的联系之后，她感受到时空力量在她全身翻腾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad8ddfa-bdac-43d2-8c25-60b5e2030652\', \'multiverseId\': 497086}, \'multiverseid\': 497086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Obelisk von Urd\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nSowie der Obelisk von Urd ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496187&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8006fb35-e753-4df5-b610-c4f175fbbfd4\', \'multiverseId\': 496187}, \'multiverseid\': 496187}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco de Urd\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nEn cuanto el Obelisco de Urd entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f30f576-1e7f-4444-a9c0-779f15d9064c\', \'multiverseId\': 496321}, \'multiverseid\': 496321}, {\'name\': "Obélisque d\'Urd", \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nAu moment où l\'Obélisque d\'Urd arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5bb730-1e8e-4fa9-a471-1d3bc9284356\', \'multiverseId\': 496455}, \'multiverseid\': 496455}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco di Urd\', \'text\': "Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nMentre l\'Obelisco di Urd entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +2/+2.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2d31ef-364a-4e04-b33c-3c01ace4de89\', \'multiverseId\': 496589}, \'multiverseid\': 496589}, {\'name\': \'ウルドのオベリスク\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nウルドのオベリスクが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプを１つ選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプを持つクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7100de-d173-4f9f-b7ae-557aef8f4677\', \'multiverseId\': 496723}, \'multiverseid\': 496723}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco de Urd\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nConforme Obelisco de Urd entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs criaturas que você controla do tipo escolhido recebem +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0f41c4-9130-46e4-aeb9-c48b8a62732e\', \'multiverseId\': 496857}, \'multiverseid\': 496857}, {\'name\': \'Обелиск Урда\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nПри выходе Обелиска Урда на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nНаходящиеся под вашим контролем существа выбранного типа получают +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b59b45-29be-4651-a89f-757c55c15f30\', \'multiverseId\': 496991}, \'multiverseid\': 496991}, {\'name\': \'邬德碑\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n于邬德碑进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n由你操控的该类别生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f783544a-e363-4b1f-83fc-a562554c3cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 497125}, \'multiverseid\': 497125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Obuun, Vorfahr der Mul Daya\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug wird bis zu ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer X/X Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile, die Trampelschaden verursacht, wobei X gleich der Stärke von Obuun ist. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c67287ba-61eb-4750-95e0-fb7d5b68aa59\', \'multiverseId\': 495900}, \'multiverseid\': 495900}, {\'name\': \'Obuun, antepasado Mul Daya\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, hasta una tierra objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura Elemental X/X con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa hasta el final del turno, donde X es la fuerza de Obuun. Sigue siendo una tierra.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31512b98-5b08-4cf5-aa22-5e7ab8d4e209\', \'multiverseId\': 495906}, \'multiverseid\': 495906}, {\'name\': \'Obuun, ancêtre de Mul Daya\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, ciblez jusqu\'à un terrain que vous contrôlez. Il devient une créature X/X Élémental avec le piétinement et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la force d\'Obuun. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88fae5b6-7065-4510-a6eb-e15369c1a635\', \'multiverseId\': 495912}, \'multiverseid\': 495912}, {\'name\': \'Obuun, Antenato di Mul Daya\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, fino a una terra bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura Elementale X/X con travolgere e rapidità fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la forza di Obuun. È ancora una terra.\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Spirito Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33888dac-2c56-46ce-b113-77365a61aefb\', \'multiverseId\': 495918}, \'multiverseid\': 495918}, {\'name\': \'ムル・ダヤの祖、オブーン\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしている土地最大１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルと速攻を持つＸ/Ｘのエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。Ｘはムル・ダヤの祖、オブーンのパワーに等しい。それは土地でもある。\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be08d68-6f20-410b-ad3e-245fb728c77f\', \'multiverseId\': 495924}, \'multiverseid\': 495924}, {\'name\': \'Obuun, Antepassado dos Mul Daya\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, até um terreno alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura X/X do tipo Elemental com atropelar e ímpeto até o final do turno, sendo X o poder de Obuun. Ela ainda é um terreno.\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6b56d6-66cc-46cb-8feb-9173f0df569f\', \'multiverseId\': 495930}, \'multiverseid\': 495930}, {\'name\': \'Обуун, Предок Мул Дайя\', \'text\': \'В начале боя во время вашего хода не более одной целевой земли под вашим контролем до конца хода становится существом X/X Элементаль с Пробивным ударом и Ускорением, где X — значение силы Обууна. При этом она остается землей.\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7a6f64c-ecf2-49b9-8a23-c23cc89d5152\', \'multiverseId\': 495936}, \'multiverseid\': 495936}, {\'name\': \'慕达雅先灵奥布恩\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，至多一个目标由你操控的地成为X/X，具践踏与敏捷异能的元素生物直到回合结束，X为奥布恩的力量。它仍然是地。\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=495942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f47dad0-d301-486c-8323-c9f67d05a762\', \'multiverseId\': 495942}, \'multiverseid\': 495942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ogerfürst der Slums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\\nRatten, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„In seiner Mietskaserne wimmelt es von dem widerwärtigsten, abscheulichsten Ungeziefer. Und rattenverseucht ist sie auch."\\n—Branko Einohr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'769a990e-1350-4b3a-b90c-14abba3fc17d\', \'multiverseId\': 496122}, \'multiverseid\': 496122}, {\'name\': \'Ogro amo del distrito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1.\\nLas Ratas que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Su propiedad está llena de las alimañas más viles y asquerosas. Y además está infestada de ratas".\\n—Branko Una Oreja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f375f95c-eaf3-413a-8922-2c334bc6ffba\', \'multiverseId\': 496256}, \'multiverseid\': 496256}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur ogre de quartier insalubre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat.\\nLes rats que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Son logis est rempli de la vermine la plus dégoûtante, la plus vile qui soit. Et en plus, il est infesté de rats. »\\n—Branko Une-Oreille\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496390&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f18d334-1e88-4861-8553-a69df14bd8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 496390}, \'multiverseid\': 496390}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Padrone dei Tuguri\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina muore, puoi creare una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera.\\nI Ratti che controlli hanno tocco letale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'"Il suo caseggiato è infestato dai parassiti più disgustosi. E anche dai ratti."\\n—Branko Senz\\\'Orecchio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21e0664-209e-41cc-ab67-14869799d74c\', \'multiverseId\': 496524}, \'multiverseid\': 496524}, {\'name\': \'オーガの貧王\', \'text\': \'他の、トークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたは黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成してもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているネズミは接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつのボロ部屋ときたら、気色悪い最低の害虫がうようよしてやがる。しかもネズミまで住み着いてるんだぜ。」\\n――隻耳のブランコ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbac475-20db-4317-b15d-f20395a1b6f1\', \'multiverseId\': 496658}, \'multiverseid\': 496658}, {\'name\': \'Senhorio Ogro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma outra criatura que não seja uma ficha morre, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura preta 1/1 do tipo Rato.\\nOs Ratos que você controla têm toque mortífero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"O cortiço dele está cheio das pragas mais vis e nojentas. E está infestado de ratos, também."\\n— Branko Uma Orelha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f27c337-a2ad-4c5d-9dd4-7f2344af7424\', \'multiverseId\': 496792}, \'multiverseid\': 496792}, {\'name\': \'Огр, Хозяин Трущоб\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое не являющееся фишкой существо умирает, вы можете создать одну фишку существа 1/1 черная Крыса.\\nКрысы под вашим контролем имеют Смертельное касание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Его жилище буквально кишит самыми омерзительными и гнусными паразитами. Не говоря уже о крысах».\\n— Одноухий Бранко\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d179ce-9b6e-4d5d-819d-360387373705\', \'multiverseId\': 496926}, \'multiverseid\': 496926}, {\'name\': \'贫窟霸食人魔\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物死去时，你可以派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的老鼠具有死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「他的居所充满最邪恶恶心的病媒，还有鼠辈横行。」\\n～单耳布兰可\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df362411-fb22-453a-bfd5-7c69d422fc22\', \'multiverseId\': 497060}, \'multiverseid\': 497060}]', '[{\'name\': \'Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten und grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns, oder ein anderes Elementarwesen, das du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt Omnath einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37679d07-4640-4a1e-8a94-50cf68d4b279\', \'multiverseId\': 496169}, \'multiverseid\': 496169}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, centro de la ira\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja y verde 5/5.\\nSiempre que Omnath, centro de la ira u otro Elemental que controlas muera, Omnath hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8044dde9-166f-417e-a550-e84fd2071f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 496303}, \'multiverseid\': 496303}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, Locus de rage\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge et verte Élémental.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Omnath, Locus de rage ou qu\'un autre élémental que vous contrôlez meurt, Omnath inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6960908e-e802-47ef-b959-e0041563581c\', \'multiverseId\': 496437}, \'multiverseid\': 496437}, {\'name\': "Omnath, l\'Iralocus", \'text\': "Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 5/5 rossa e verde.\\nOgniqualvolta Omnath, l\'Iralocus o un altro Elementale che controlli muoiono, Omnath infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'601d7475-e374-445d-9f3a-2c1a19184c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 496571}, \'multiverseid\': 496571}, {\'name\': \'怒りの座、オムナス\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、赤であり緑である５/５のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n怒りの座、オムナスや、他の、あなたがコントロールしているエレメンタルが１体死亡するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。怒りの座、オムナスはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c65e22e-d235-438e-8807-ebac5c6956bb\', \'multiverseId\': 496705}, \'multiverseid\': 496705}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, Locus de Fúria\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha e verde 5/5 do tipo Elemental.\\nToda vez que Omnath, Locus de Fúria, ou outro Elemental que você controla morre, Omnath causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b65b88-b59e-4649-a576-4a42092e55a8\', \'multiverseId\': 496839}, \'multiverseid\': 496839}, {\'name\': \'Омнат, Очаг Ярости\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, создайте одну фишку существа 5/5 красный и зеленый Элементаль.\\nКаждый раз, когда Омнат, Очаг Ярости или другой Элементаль под вашим контролем умирает, Омнат наносит 3 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd29fa7-dfa0-4aec-bac0-fe22862cc945\', \'multiverseId\': 496973}, \'multiverseid\': 496973}, {\'name\': \'怒火核欧那斯\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个5/5，红绿双色的元素衍生生物。\\n每当怒火核欧那斯或另一个由你操控的元素死去时，欧那斯对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962b3e93-de1f-44e0-8092-0495ded51163\', \'multiverseId\': 497107}, \'multiverseid\': 497107}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oona, Königin der Feen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{X}{U/B}: Bestimme eine Farbe. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Erzeuge für jede Karte der bestimmten Farbe, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurde, einen 1/1 blauen und schwarzen Feenwesen-Räuber-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496170&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d65d142f-6e00-47c8-b69c-4ae6064ed773\', \'multiverseId\': 496170}, \'multiverseid\': 496170}, {\'name\': \'Oona, reina de las hadas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{X}{U/B}: Elige un color. El oponente objetivo exilia las X primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Por cada carta del color elegido exiliada de esta manera, crea una ficha de criatura Bribón Hada azul y negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1639a4-9e13-4fa9-a63e-4e9208b0dec7\', \'multiverseId\': 496304}, \'multiverseid\': 496304}, {\'name\': \'Oona, reine des faeries\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{X}{U/B} : Choisissez une couleur. L\'adversaire ciblé exile les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Pour chaque carte de la couleur choisie exilée de cette manière, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue et noire Peuple fée et Gredin avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d718952-d74b-4849-80f7-12800b8d9ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 496438}, \'multiverseid\': 496438}, {\'name\': \'Oona, Regina degli Spiritelli\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{X}{U/B}: Scegli un colore. Un avversario bersaglio esilia le prime X carte del suo grimorio. Per ogni carta del colore scelto esiliata in questo modo, crea una pedina creatura Farabutto Spiritello 1/1 blu e nera con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55390c4-6e21-473b-9e91-754e3b857a02\', \'multiverseId\': 496572}, \'multiverseid\': 496572}, {\'name\': \'妖精の女王、ウーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{X}{U/B}：色１色を選ぶ。対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚追放する。これにより追放された選ばれた色のカード１枚につき、あなたは飛行を持つ青であり黒である１/１のフェアリー・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49c9ebb-d039-45cf-8656-b373ba7f1fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 496706}, \'multiverseid\': 496706}, {\'name\': \'Oona, Rainha das Fadinas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{X}{U/B}: Escolha uma cor. O oponente alvo exila X cards do topo do próprio grimório. Para cada card da cor escolhida exilado dessa maneira, crie uma ficha de criatura azul e preta 1/1 do tipo Fada Ladino com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fada Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffb8c59-01df-4d35-97d9-333dc0baf9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 496840}, \'multiverseid\': 496840}, {\'name\': \'Уна, Королева Фей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{X}{U/B}: выберите цвет. Целевой оппонент изгоняет Х верхних карт своей библиотеки. За каждую изгнанную таким образом карту выбранного цвета создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синяя и черная Фея Бродяга с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Фея Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5197b0f0-17a5-45af-8923-23234306c5e3\', \'multiverseId\': 496974}, \'multiverseid\': 496974}, {\'name\': \'仙儿女王欧娜\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{X}{U/B}：选择一种颜色。目标对手放逐其牌库顶的X张牌。每以此法放逐一张该颜色的牌，你便派出一个1/1，蓝黑双色，具飞行异能的仙灵／浪客衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a59dff-9831-47f6-9338-4b6746fb6419\', \'multiverseId\': 497108}, \'multiverseid\': 497108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oonas Lumpenpack\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nJede andere Räuber-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft der Spieler eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d4707d5-1f2f-441f-9a28-29dfb2cc4cdd\', \'multiverseId\': 496123}, \'multiverseid\': 496123}, {\'name\': \'Guardia negro de Oona\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCada otra criatura Bribón que controlas entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4cfa4d-1fef-4f2a-8520-ea5b80ff0010\', \'multiverseId\': 496257}, \'multiverseid\': 496257}, {\'name\': "Garde noire d\'Oona", \'text\': "Vol\\nChaque autre créature Gredin que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496391&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8db99d4-e93a-4a7d-8798-52a45ff714f7\', \'multiverseId\': 496391}, \'multiverseid\': 496391}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Nera di Oona\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgni altra creatura Farabutto che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e87bfe1-6d17-416b-abdc-000129500053\', \'multiverseId\': 496525}, \'multiverseid\': 496525}, {\'name\': \'ウーナの黒近衛\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしている各ならず者・クリーチャーは、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ce43ac-67c3-4778-a55b-088f62c2b41c\', \'multiverseId\': 496659}, \'multiverseid\': 496659}, {\'name\': \'Guardião Sombrio de Oona\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nCada outra criatura do tipo Ladino que você controla entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1 causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ffb0d1-eed6-47d9-8fb1-361674a69226\', \'multiverseId\': 496793}, \'multiverseid\': 496793}, {\'name\': \'Злодейка Уны\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждое другое существо-Бродяга под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном +1/+1 на нем.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1, наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e76dd87-40bd-46fb-acbf-f32fe4e55af8\', \'multiverseId\': 496927}, \'multiverseid\': 496927}, {\'name\': \'欧娜的黑卫士\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n由你操控的其他浪客生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当一个由你操控且上面有+1/+1指示物的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd0e112b-7f60-4ddf-b29d-8488339942bf\', \'multiverseId\': 497061}, \'multiverseid\': 497061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panorama von Naya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Panorama von Naya: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge-, Wald- oder Ebene-Standardlandkarte und bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Zwischen den donnernden Schritten der Behemoths von Naya herrscht immer einen Augenblick lang perfekte Stille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f6580e-c0c4-4559-b803-a1fe46a67910\', \'multiverseId\': 496208}, \'multiverseid\': 496208}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Naya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Panorama de Naya: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Montaña, Bosque o Llanura básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los estruendosos pisotones de los behemots de Naya hay momentos de perfecta calma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232adc86-6ea5-43a8-8f2c-258204aac4fe\', \'multiverseId\': 496342}, \'multiverseid\': 496342}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Naya\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Panorama de Naya : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne, de forêt ou de plaine de base et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Le tonnerre des pas des béhémoths de Naya est entrecoupé d\'instants de silence parfait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'710eb26d-e539-4de0-9dc4-d419e6955b60\', \'multiverseId\': 496476}, \'multiverseid\': 496476}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Naya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Panorama di Naya: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Montagna, Foresta o Pianura base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tra i fragorosi passi dei behemoth di Naya si trovano momenti di quiete perfetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09dba00-90f6-4f64-b174-478747f9708e\', \'multiverseId\': 496610}, \'multiverseid\': 496610}, {\'name\': \'ナヤの全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, ナヤの全景を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本であり山か森か平地であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤのビヒモスの轟くような足音の合間には、完璧な静寂の瞬間がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b1be5e4-b7e6-49e2-83f0-a986c126af10\', \'multiverseId\': 496744}, \'multiverseid\': 496744}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Naya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Panorama de Naya: Procure um card de Montanha, Floresta ou Planície básico em seu grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Entre os passos ribombantes dos behemoths de Naya jazem momentos de perfeita quietude.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07763579-d345-4ca8-82ce-a46dbbfd2ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 496878}, \'multiverseid\': 496878}, {\'name\': \'Панорама Найи\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Панораму Найи: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой Горы, Леса или Равнины и положите ее на поле битвы повернутой. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'В промежутках между громовыми шагами исполинов Найи наступают моменты абсолютной тишины.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75878d57-b045-4a15-91b7-a410d5f883f4\', \'multiverseId\': 497012}, \'multiverseid\': 497012}, {\'name\': \'纳雅全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲纳雅全景：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本的山脉，树林或平原牌，并将之横置放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在纳雅的贝西摩斯雷鸣足声间，藏着片刻的纯粹宁静。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93bdee3e-4b37-41fc-b557-a2639e807981\', \'multiverseId\': 497146}, \'multiverseid\': 497146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pflugscheuche\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Pflugscheuche getappt wird, bestimme eines —\\n• Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\n• Bringe eine Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': \'Schlachtfelder werden zu Kornfeldern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496189&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbcc9a61-df27-4897-849b-38b215aed058\', \'multiverseId\': 496189}, \'multiverseid\': 496189}, {\'name\': \'Espantarado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Espantarado se gire, elige uno:\\n• Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de tu mano.\\n• Regresa la carta de tierra objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': \'Los campos de batalla se convierten en campos de trigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f28b1f-7e0b-43bb-a4d9-a3a07e6604c4\', \'multiverseId\': 496323}, \'multiverseid\': 496323}, {\'name\': \'Épouvanculteur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Épouvanculteur devient engagé, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main.\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain ciblée de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : épouvantail\', \'flavor\': \'Les champs de bataille deviennent des champs de céréales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1048316f-1eb1-4e7e-a2c8-3a2dbac82bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 496457}, \'multiverseid\': 496457}, {\'name\': \'Spaventaratro\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lo Spaventaratro viene TAPpato, scegli uno —\\n• Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta terra dalla tua mano.\\n• Rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri\', \'flavor\': \'I campi di battaglia si trasformano in campi di grano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a38dcf5c-f02e-43c8-bc13-b5a89d30d70d\', \'multiverseId\': 496591}, \'multiverseid\': 496591}, {\'name\': \'耕しカカシ\', \'text\': \'耕しカカシがタップ状態になるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたは、あなたの手札から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n• あなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚を対象とする。それをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': \'広大な戦場が広大な農場に変わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909054ef-0986-4c86-923b-a2824841e117\', \'multiverseId\': 496725}, \'multiverseid\': 496725}, {\'name\': \'Espantalharador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Espantalharador for virado, escolha um —\\n• Você pode colocar um card de terreno da sua mão no campo de batalha virado.\\n• Devolva o card de terreno alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho\', \'flavor\': \'Campos de batalha tornam-se campos de cultivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ba0257-1fe2-42f9-8523-fc24392eef4c\', \'multiverseId\': 496859}, \'multiverseid\': 496859}, {\'name\': \'Плугало\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Плугало становится повернутым, выберите одно —\\n• Вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы повернутой.\\n• Верните целевую карту земли из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутой.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Пугало\', \'flavor\': \'Поля сражений превращаются в поля пшеницы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e779c7f2-7315-451a-9adc-4afdb296d8da\', \'multiverseId\': 496993}, \'multiverseid\': 496993}, {\'name\': \'锄犁草人\', \'text\': \'每当锄犁草人成为横置时，选择一项～\\n•你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\\n•将目标地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'战场变农场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a1b533-50e3-4885-a0d0-36c70e0573cd\', \'multiverseId\': 497127}, \'multiverseid\': 497127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plattnerkunst-Preisrichterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Plattnerkunst-Preisrichterin ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Wäre sie keine Preisrichterin, würde sie in ihrer Kategorie gewinnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496132&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa36aa9-5859-447e-8b03-d98fa0f35fea\', \'multiverseId\': 496132}, \'multiverseid\': 496132}, {\'name\': \'Jueza de forja de armaduras\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Jueza de forja de armaduras entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Si no fuera jueza, ganaría en su propia categoría.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07927c39-98f3-4e3c-9df4-f0cc5e14cf55\', \'multiverseId\': 496266}, \'multiverseid\': 496266}, {\'name\': "Juge des façonneurs d\'armures", \'text\': "Quand la Juge des façonneurs d\'armures arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Si elle n\'était pas juge, c\'est elle qui remporterait la compétition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8765a87-f7a9-40a3-ab5a-525dfbf81d46\', \'multiverseId\': 496400}, \'multiverseid\': 496400}, {\'name\': \'Giudice Forgiacorazze\', \'text\': \'Quando la Giudice Forgiacorazze entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Se non fosse lei stessa a giudicarla, sarebbe la vincitrice nella sua categoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4054e13-aff1-4814-8bc5-1ef71958f129\', \'multiverseId\': 496534}, \'multiverseid\': 496534}, {\'name\': \'鎧作りの審判者\', \'text\': \'鎧作りの審判者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'審判者でなかったら、この部門では彼女が優勝するだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de6b30e-4fe6-4888-8229-cd06520bf9c4\', \'multiverseId\': 496668}, \'multiverseid\': 496668}, {\'name\': \'Jurada de Armoraria\', \'text\': \'Quando Jurada de Armoraria entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card para cada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Se não fosse a jurada, ela mesma venceria na categoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b13bb7-146b-4c1b-9c48-877ca732f9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 496802}, \'multiverseid\': 496802}, {\'name\': \'Судья Бронного Искусства\', \'text\': \'Когда Судья Бронного Искусства выходит на поле битвы, возьмите одну карту за каждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Не будь она судьей, она сама сокрушила бы соперников в этой дисциплине.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b200c23-c3d4-4ffe-bf7c-3c4c5eb6dfad\', \'multiverseId\': 496936}, \'multiverseid\': 496936}, {\'name\': \'制甲艺评审\', \'text\': \'当制甲艺评审进战场时，你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'她若不是评审，本项目桂冠非她莫属。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cd5f67-8546-4e08-b4b5-0388debf9101\', \'multiverseId\': 497070}, \'multiverseid\': 497070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preis der Berühmtheit\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls er eine legendäre Kreatur als Ziel hat.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nÜberwachen 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon auf deinen Friedhof und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f9862aa-e3dc-49cf-a944-340db9e6dea7\', \'multiverseId\': 496124}, \'multiverseid\': 496124}, {\'name\': \'El precio de la fama\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si hace objetivo a una criatura legendaria.\\nDestruye la criatura objetivo.\\nEscruta 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en tu cementerio y el resto en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe4505f-4fad-40ee-8bcb-858cb5821e93\', \'multiverseId\': 496258}, \'multiverseid\': 496258}, {\'name\': \'Prix de la célébrité\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il cible une créature légendaire.\\nDétruisez une créature ciblée.\\nSurveillez 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles dans votre cimetière et le reste au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496392&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcc716ff-4fef-4315-96e4-c6208d0a8e98\', \'multiverseId\': 496392}, \'multiverseid\': 496392}, {\'name\': \'Prezzo della Celebrità\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una creatura leggendaria.\\nDistruggi una creatura bersaglio.\\nSorveglia 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero nel tuo cimitero e le altre in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc77b12-2807-4f4b-9826-e7f7115e67f5\', \'multiverseId\': 496526}, \'multiverseid\': 496526}, {\'name\': \'名声の代価\', \'text\': \'この呪文が伝説のクリーチャーを対象とするなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n諜報２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたの墓地に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03574fa0-8357-44c4-a5f0-a8d8b1541b51\', \'multiverseId\': 496660}, \'multiverseid\': 496660}, {\'name\': \'Preço da Fama\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada se tiver como alvo uma criatura lendária.\\nDestrua a criatura alvo.\\nVigiar 2. (Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles em seu cemitério e o restante no topo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'717d4303-32e8-4d0c-afa7-e3c523ff1c34\', \'multiverseId\': 496794}, \'multiverseid\': 496794}, {\'name\': \'Цена Известности\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2} меньше, если его целью является легендарное существо.\\nУничтожьте целевое существо.\\nСлежка 2. (Посмотрите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них на ваше кладбище, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0425d8f2-a5af-4c4a-918e-2a8d980026e3\', \'multiverseId\': 496928}, \'multiverseid\': 496928}, {\'name\': \'名誉的代价\', \'text\': \'如果此咒语以传奇生物为目标，则它便减少{2}来施放。\\n消灭目标生物。\\n刺探2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌置入你的坟墓场，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b25059-a8d0-4aea-a3f9-901eee31023b\', \'multiverseId\': 497062}, \'multiverseid\': 497062}]', "[{'name': 'Ringen // Überleben', 'text': 'Ringen fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Länder kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Ringen', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496174&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '953df7b1-5e75-44b8-870b-6ad37bd5e334', 'multiverseId': 496174}, 'multiverseid': 496174}, {'name': 'Esforzarse // Sobrevivir', 'text': 'Esforzarse hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual a la cantidad de tierras que controlas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Esforzarse', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496308&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82ddda4b-6e86-40f3-b7a8-aa293cd0b69c', 'multiverseId': 496308}, 'multiverseid': 496308}, {'name': 'Lotta // Sopravvivenza', 'text': 'La Lotta infligge a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di terre che controlli.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Lotta', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496576&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '259531be-4657-4f10-8de9-b44e59f2469e', 'multiverseId': 496576}, 'multiverseid': 496576}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rituale des Gedeihens\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Ziehsegments jedes Spielers zieht jener Spieler eine zusätzliche Karte.\\nJeder Spieler darf in jedem seiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Tanzt und springt in großen Kreisen! Das Ritual verbindet uns mit Gaea und nährt uns mit den reichen Gaben der Erde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496152&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe230a5-0f50-479a-8f4e-5fab11d0d7b4\', \'multiverseId\': 496152}, \'multiverseid\': 496152}, {\'name\': \'Ritos de florecimiento\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del paso de robar de cada jugador, ese jugador roba una carta adicional.\\nCada jugador puede jugar una tierra adicional en cada uno de sus turnos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Baila, y acerca el espiral! Es un cordón umbilical a Gaia, alimentándonos con el regalo de la tierra fértil".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b096db-bfee-4570-9dee-6aebaac5c226\', \'multiverseId\': 496286}, \'multiverseid\': 496286}, {\'name\': "Sacres de l\'abondance", \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de pioche de chaque joueur, ce joueur pioche une carte supplémentaire.\\nChaque joueur peut jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de ses tours.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Dansez, et apportez l\'annelure ! C\'est le cordon ombilical qui nous relie à Gaia et nous engraisse avec les trésors de la terre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e87d4b41-6b37-44bd-bc6e-5a4098371a0f\', \'multiverseId\': 496420}, \'multiverseid\': 496420}, {\'name\': "Rituali d\'Abbondanza", \'text\': "All\'inizio dell\'acquisizione di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore pesca una carta addizionale.\\nOgni giocatore può giocare una terra addizionale in ognuno dei propri turni.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Danza e porta qui la corda! È un cordone ombelicale con la stessa Gea, che ci ingrassa con la ricca abbondanza della terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ba04ff-e0f9-4952-a592-63863ebd4cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 496554}, \'multiverseid\': 496554}, {\'name\': \'栄華の儀式\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのドロー・ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカードを追加で１枚引く。\\n各プレイヤーの各ターンに、そのプレイヤーは追加で土地を１つプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「踊ろう！そして螺旋を描こう！これはガイア自身の臍帯だ。我々を肥やすために大地がくれた豊かなる恵みなんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765fc372-a3ba-4716-be4a-03479578b585\', \'multiverseId\': 496688}, \'multiverseid\': 496688}, {\'name\': \'Ritos de Desabrochar\', \'text\': \'No início da etapa de compra de cada jogador, aquele jogador compra um card adicional.\\nCada jogador pode jogar um terreno adicional em cada um de seus próprios turnos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Dancem e tragam o cordão! Esse é o cordão umbilical da própria Gaia, que nos alimenta com as ricas delícias da terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc7efaa-a547-44e4-957d-fcde0e7c2524\', \'multiverseId\': 496822}, \'multiverseid\': 496822}, {\'name\': \'Обряды Процветания\', \'text\': \'В начале шага взятия карты каждого игрока тот игрок берет дополнительную карту.\\nКаждый игрок может разыграть одну дополнительную землю в каждом из своих ходов.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Танцуйте, взывайте к силе вихря! Он ведет к чреву самой Геи и наполняет нас щедрым изобилием природы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c40839d-6e52-4a4a-9576-865ce41bef2d\', \'multiverseId\': 496956}, \'multiverseid\': 496956}, {\'name\': \'茁壮仪式\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的抓牌步骤开始时，该牌手额外抓一张牌。\\n每位牌手在自己的每个回合中均可以额外使用一个地。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「以舞蹈引领这盘卷！它宛如盖亚赐予的脐带，以大地的丰饶滋养我们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ea7b9a-4f50-489c-9b70-b568f97e79ae\', \'multiverseId\': 497090}, \'multiverseid\': 497090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückeroberung des Waldes\', \'text\': \'Schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496176&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a57889f8-a691-4b9a-ac23-483a60c817a6\', \'multiverseId\': 496176}, \'multiverseid\': 496176}, {\'name\': \'Reclamación silvana\', \'text\': \'Exilia hasta dos artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c834b847-cedd-4a38-bf88-75a967493084\', \'multiverseId\': 496310}, \'multiverseid\': 496310}, {\'name\': \'Défrichement sylvestre\', \'text\': "Exilez jusqu\'à deux artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107ac0c8-296d-48af-85e7-f2acfcf05966\', \'multiverseId\': 496444}, \'multiverseid\': 496444}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione Silvana\', \'text\': \'Esilia fino a due artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCicloterra base {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e15c03d5-d550-4fac-8321-42a89fe2a097\', \'multiverseId\': 496578}, \'multiverseid\': 496578}, {\'name\': \'森の再生\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやエンチャント合わせて最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n基本土地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8be096-5030-4f06-a50c-dfd011341647\', \'multiverseId\': 496712}, \'multiverseid\': 496712}, {\'name\': \'Reivindicação Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Exile até dois artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo.\\nReciclar terreno básico {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12fbbd9-4223-47f0-ae61-c44eafd58c47\', \'multiverseId\': 496846}, \'multiverseid\': 496846}, {\'name\': \'Лесное Возвращение\', \'text\': \'Изгоните не более двух целевых артефактов и/или чар.\\nЦикл базовых земель {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e442ba2-266a-4a03-b630-3688d2383b68\', \'multiverseId\': 496980}, \'multiverseid\': 496980}, {\'name\': \'森林垦殖\', \'text\': \'放逐至多两个目标神器和／或结界。\\n循环基本地{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898a3fe8-cb76-4059-9e3b-d9d342004eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 497114}, \'multiverseid\': 497114}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr des Wildsprechers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n• Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Fluch ist gebrochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496151&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93b97db-44d6-42af-b4aa-1570eea47e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 496151}, \'multiverseid\': 496151}, {\'name\': \'Regreso del Portavoz Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas.\\n• Las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha roto la maldición".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2681b526-4b60-4768-b636-e92521cb49a7\', \'multiverseId\': 496285}, \'multiverseid\': 496285}, {\'name\': \'Retour du Languebestion\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez.\\n• Les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La malédiction est brisée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6ba56e-2527-490a-abab-f9252a9884b5\', \'multiverseId\': 496419}, \'multiverseid\': 496419}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno di Lingua Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature non Umano che controlli.\\n• Le creature non Umano che controlli prendono +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La maledizione è stata spezzata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13fec640-cdcd-4824-aad3-bc53947605d5\', \'multiverseId\': 496553}, \'multiverseid\': 496553}, {\'name\': \'野生語りの帰還\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「呪いは解けた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e50526-7632-4795-b790-bce2865bb792\', \'multiverseId\': 496687}, \'multiverseid\': 496687}, {\'name\': \'Retorno do Falabravo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Compre uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla que não sejam do tipo Humano.\\n• As criaturas que você controla que não sejam do tipo Humano recebem +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A maldição foi quebrada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9d75a9-ed29-4c2f-b393-63759d301ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 496821}, \'multiverseid\': 496821}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение Дикоречивого\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди не являющихся Человеком существ под вашим контролем.\\n• Не являющиеся Человеком существа под вашим контролем получают +3/+3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Проклятье снято».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93811b3b-21cf-4ab4-a73a-a02d8b4e9dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 496955}, \'multiverseid\': 496955}, {\'name\': \'召兽使复归\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的非人类生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n•由你操控的非人类生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「诅咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df8c1a7-b3d6-4924-bdc6-07b3216d9044\', \'multiverseId\': 497089}, \'multiverseid\': 497089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Emeria\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Kor-Verbündeter-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291e5ed5-3b11-4be7-9be2-e7da7681362b\', \'multiverseId\': 496092}, \'multiverseid\': 496092}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Emeria\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Aliado Kor blanca 1/1.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f693c67-02f8-4770-866d-6cc517d7cf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 496226}, \'multiverseid\': 496226}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers Éméria\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Kor et Allié.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8a6887-e48f-4543-af3f-e82c56901dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 496360}, \'multiverseid\': 496360}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Emeria\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Alleato Kor 1/1 bianca.\\n• Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744e3290-123a-42d3-b15a-9b6d2ba422c9\', \'multiverseId\': 496494}, \'multiverseid\': 496494}, {\'name\': \'エメリアへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 白の１/１のコー・同盟者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773054a8-a5af-42b0-94d6-3cf667a1f688\', \'multiverseId\': 496628}, \'multiverseid\': 496628}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Emeria\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Kor Aliado.\\n• As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e81141-74e5-41c4-a229-36f8c6e9de49\', \'multiverseId\': 496762}, \'multiverseid\': 496762}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Эмерию\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —\\n• Создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Кор Союзник.\\n• Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce71897-5923-4481-ad96-944588c3e2e9\', \'multiverseId\': 496896}, \'multiverseid\': 496896}, {\'name\': \'撤往伊美黎\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～\\n•派出一个1/1白色寇族／伙伴衍生生物。\\n•由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77095fe5-c147-4108-8e11-4408ed461e22\', \'multiverseId\': 497030}, \'multiverseid\': 497030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückzug nach Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n• Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496150&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887df5fb-2b11-4791-98b1-d8bb2622e09a\', \'multiverseId\': 496150}, \'multiverseid\': 496150}, {\'name\': \'Retirada a Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n• Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88918f03-a9fd-4b41-be9d-2576809b3f58\', \'multiverseId\': 496284}, \'multiverseid\': 496284}, {\'name\': \'Repli vers le Kazandou\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n• Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c86fca8e-b460-4a91-95e7-d6b94a2db352\', \'multiverseId\': 496418}, \'multiverseid\': 496418}, {\'name\': \'Ritirata verso Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c936036e-b02e-4a05-9a18-8a00147fc016\', \'multiverseId\': 496552}, \'multiverseid\': 496552}, {\'name\': \'カザンドゥへの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n• あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0849d9b9-86ad-4292-a177-1e9cdb0edc94\', \'multiverseId\': 496686}, \'multiverseid\': 496686}, {\'name\': \'Retirada para Kazandu\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, escolha um:\\n• Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\n• Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'538f2636-00df-450e-8e49-305d8348ba2f\', \'multiverseId\': 496820}, \'multiverseid\': 496820}, {\'name\': \'Отступление в Казанду\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —\\n• Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\\n• Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaf8175-c77b-4892-b793-34c10a95548a\', \'multiverseId\': 496954}, \'multiverseid\': 496954}, {\'name\': \'撤往卡赞度\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～\\n•在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n•你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae7f56dd-b5d3-48f0-96f4-c3edbf4ab69b\', \'multiverseId\': 497088}, \'multiverseid\': 497088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sandsteinorakel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Sandsteinorakel ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Gegner. Falls jener Spieler mehr Karten auf der Hand hat als du, ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Differenz beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496188&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6044e74-2e3c-423f-be3b-64481dc41baa\', \'multiverseId\': 496188}, \'multiverseid\': 496188}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo de arenisca\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Oráculo de arenisca entre al campo de batalla, elige un oponente. Si ese jugador tiene más cartas en la mano que tú, roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la diferencia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6f6b5a-224b-43be-badb-72148e85f9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 496322}, \'multiverseid\': 496322}, {\'name\': \'Oracle de grès\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Oracle de grès arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un adversaire. Si ce joueur a plus de cartes en main que vous, piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la différence.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d4b76f-9e9f-49d0-9b1f-05ce23d6207b\', \'multiverseId\': 496456}, \'multiverseid\': 496456}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo di Arenaria\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Oracolo di Arenaria entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un avversario. Se quel giocatore ha più carte in mano di te, pesca un numero di carte pari alla differenza.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05bddf7f-5559-4f1b-8cfa-f3f3e9108692\', \'multiverseId\': 496590}, \'multiverseid\': 496590}, {\'name\': \'砂岩の予言者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n砂岩の予言者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードがあなたのそれより多いなら、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de297f6-554c-40f5-932c-e68373f6a276\', \'multiverseId\': 496724}, \'multiverseid\': 496724}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo de Arenito\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Oráculo de Arenito entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um oponente. Se aquele jogador tiver mais cards na mão do que você, compre um número de cards igual à diferença.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4698b35d-11e8-48c8-a0c7-ea1b72ddf6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 496858}, \'multiverseid\': 496858}, {\'name\': \'Оракул Песчаника\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Оракул Песчаника выходит на поле битвы, выберите оппонента. Если у того игрока в руке больше карт, чем у вас, возьмите количество карт, равное разнице значений.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0be4f97-0381-430b-bed8-efed6cbe34cd\', \'multiverseId\': 496992}, \'multiverseid\': 496992}, {\'name\': \'砂岩先知\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当砂岩先知进战场时，选择一位对手。若该牌手的手牌数量比你多，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb18cdb8-5d36-4a72-9032-415274456d44\', \'multiverseId\': 497126}, \'multiverseid\': 497126}]', '[{\'name\': \'Satyr-Pfadfinder\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Satyr-Pfadfinder ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Der erste Satyr, der nach einem rauschenden Fest wieder das Bewusstsein erlangt, muss einen Ort für die nächste Feier ausfindig machen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496153&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff012cc-c712-4852-8c97-d00ef3128ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 496153}, \'multiverseid\': 496153}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro buscacaminos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sátiro buscacaminos entre al campo de batalla, muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'El sátiro que se despierte primero después de un festín tiene que buscar el lugar del siguiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3c1d6c-ccef-40b2-8327-d24f32161a77\', \'multiverseId\': 496287}, \'multiverseid\': 496287}, {\'name\': \'Guidevoie satyre\', \'text\': \'Quand le Guidevoie satyre arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : satyre\', \'flavor\': "Le premier satyre qui s\'éveille après une orgie doit trouver le lieu de la suivante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496421&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e9f455-cd50-4be0-b8c7-4aa4b733687c\', \'multiverseId\': 496421}, \'multiverseid\': 496421}, {\'name\': \'Satiro Apripista\', \'text\': \'Quando il Satiro Apripista entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta terra scelta tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Il satiro che si sveglia per primo dopo un baccanale deve cercare il luogo che ospiterà il prossimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'069538c8-f420-4b26-be4f-81b6104a6926\', \'multiverseId\': 496555}, \'multiverseid\': 496555}, {\'name\': \'サテュロスの道探し\', \'text\': \'サテュロスの道探しが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚公開する。あなたは、その中から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'お祭りの後に目覚めた最初のサテュロスは、次のお祭りの現場を探さなければならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b3c379-af66-4c99-8021-e3c1ce615475\', \'multiverseId\': 496689}, \'multiverseid\': 496689}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro Trilheiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Sátiro Trilheiro entrar no campo de batalha, revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de terreno dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'O primeiro sátiro que acorda depois de uma festança deve procurar um local para a próxima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d560f9-3344-4c82-8704-31f49e4697c9\', \'multiverseId\': 496823}, \'multiverseid\': 496823}, {\'name\': \'Сатир-Проводник\', \'text\': \'Когда Сатир-Проводник выходит на поле битвы, покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту земли в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир\', \'flavor\': \'Первый сатир, который просыпается после гулянки, должен найти место для следующей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477e0070-6e98-4012-9cde-32c2743e3b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 496957}, \'multiverseid\': 496957}, {\'name\': \'引路羊蹄人\', \'text\': \'当引路羊蹄人进战场时，展示你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'在欢宴后第一个苏醒的羊蹄人，必须负责寻找下一场欢宴的地点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'588c5dea-4be6-411b-a587-299a121d9b64\', \'multiverseId\': 497091}, \'multiverseid\': 497091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schicksalhafte Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie erhält Unzerstörbarkeit. Falls es dein Zug ist, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bd2c1b5-382f-45f5-8886-bc567216b07f\', \'multiverseId\': 496114}, \'multiverseid\': 496114}, {\'name\': \'Regreso nefasto\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Gana la habilidad de indestructible. Si es tu turno, adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb962280-bd1f-4cd8-a8e7-5b92d8b5acde\', \'multiverseId\': 496248}, \'multiverseid\': 496248}, {\'name\': \'Retour annoncé\', \'text\': "Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée d\'un cimetière. Elle acquiert l\'indestructible. Si c\'est votre tour, regard 2.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a931d872-7f9d-4000-880e-d1f894417661\', \'multiverseId\': 496382}, \'multiverseid\': 496382}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio Fatidico\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Ha indistruttibile. Se è il tuo turno, profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2927461f-0fca-4576-90ba-6c552bc84c75\', \'multiverseId\': 496516}, \'multiverseid\': 496516}, {\'name\': \'宿命的復活\', \'text\': \'墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それは破壊不能を得る。あなたのターンであるなら、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f3a620-f9b2-4a72-bf08-daeec94dcaf6\', \'multiverseId\': 496650}, \'multiverseid\': 496650}, {\'name\': \'Retorno Predestinado\', \'text\': \'Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Ele ganha indestrutível. Se for o seu turno, use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee46964-58bb-44d5-886b-f757b3c0d7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 496784}, \'multiverseid\': 496784}, {\'name\': \'Предначертанное Возвращение\', \'text\': \'Положите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Оно получает Неразрушимость. Если идет ваш ход, предскажите 2.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53e5c302-40e1-44a3-afe4-6399ac9c9f34\', \'multiverseId\': 496918}, \'multiverseid\': 496918}, {\'name\': \'命定归返\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。它获得不灭异能。如果是在你的回合中，则占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b43a130-c4c7-49fd-b3e9-d24458c97b11\', \'multiverseId\': 497052}, \'multiverseid\': 497052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Dieben verbreiteten sich rasch Gerüchte von einem Labyrinth ohne Mauern und einem Schatz von unermesslichem Wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496210&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58acd1d5-f008-445a-834a-ffcafbe4f55b\', \'multiverseId\': 496210}, \'multiverseid\': 496210}, {\'name\': \'Pasaje del bribón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los ladrones se extendió enseguida el rumor de un laberinto sin muros y de un premio más allá de todas las expectativas de riqueza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2a352f-7edd-404b-9793-3779e5d2a13b\', \'multiverseId\': 496344}, \'multiverseid\': 496344}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rumeur d\'un labyrinthe sans parois et d\'un trésor inestimable se répandit rapidement chez les malandrins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816792c1-17e3-4891-9226-9c81d6facaf9\', \'multiverseId\': 496478}, \'multiverseid\': 496478}, {\'name\': \'Passaggio dei Farabutti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tra i ladri si diffusero rapidamente voci che parlavano di un labirinto senza muri e di un bottino oltre ogni immaginazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0452295d-f0bf-440e-a302-4f8b2aea522f\', \'multiverseId\': 496612}, \'multiverseid\': 496612}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠る壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1eb034-5ff6-4bae-873e-98e3058c556c\', \'multiverseId\': 496746}, \'multiverseid\': 496746}, {\'name\': \'Passagem do Ladino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os boatos sobre um labirinto sem paredes com um tesouro de inestimável valor se espalharam rapidamente entre os ladrões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ffb327a-ffdd-4e0c-bc7b-bfc46af5e448\', \'multiverseId\': 496880}, \'multiverseid\': 496880}, {\'name\': \'Разбойничий Проход\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Среди воров быстро распространились слухи о лабиринте без стен, скрывающем сокровище невообразимой ценности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be62df16-76cf-473d-aebf-897be3a870c5\', \'multiverseId\': 497014}, \'multiverseid\': 497014}, {\'name\': \'浪客小径\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}，{T}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'这谣言很快在小偷之间传开：有座无墙的迷宫，藏有价值无可计量的宝藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab4a0f3-6abb-40cd-b76d-5a7c56b64418\', \'multiverseId\': 497148}, \'multiverseid\': 497148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlitterklinge\', \'text\': \'Die Schlitterklinge kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Mancher Naga-Geweihte bewegt sich so lautlos wie sein eigener Schatten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496108&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118b4aeb-d849-44fe-912e-0a16b73488ec\', \'multiverseId\': 496108}, \'multiverseid\': 496108}, {\'name\': \'Filo reptante\', \'text\': \'El Filo reptante no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón naga\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos iniciados naga se mueven tan silenciosamente como los reflejos de los soles en el agua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116bc604-c453-4eb4-b2e3-4ee8d9f18dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 496242}, \'multiverseid\': 496242}, {\'name\': \'Lame rampante\', \'text\': \'La Lame rampante ne peut pas être bloquée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : naga et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Certains adeptes nagas se déplacent aussi silencieusement que les rayons du soleil à la surface de l\'eau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5910a729-e068-4b3d-b613-822252f8d2d2\', \'multiverseId\': 496376}, \'multiverseid\': 496376}, {\'name\': \'Lama Strisciante\', \'text\': \'La Lama Strisciante non può essere bloccata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Naga\', \'flavor\': "Alcuni iniziati naga sono silenziosi come i riflessi dei soli sull\'acqua.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'525f9ae0-5f10-448b-8322-74cc06880df0\', \'multiverseId\': 496510}, \'multiverseid\': 496510}, {\'name\': \'這い寄る刃\', \'text\': \'這い寄る刃はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'ナーガの修練者の中には、水に映る双陽のように音もなく動く者がいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b644d3-9aef-4bc0-b74e-46e8c2b8b6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 496644}, \'multiverseid\': 496644}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina Sinuosa\', \'text\': \'Lâmina Sinuosa não pode ser bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Naga Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns iniciados naga se movem tão silenciosamente quanto os reflexos dos sóis na água.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d1633d0-4c71-4854-9f8b-86739b83ddcc\', \'multiverseId\': 496778}, \'multiverseid\': 496778}, {\'name\': \'Скользящий Мечник\', \'text\': \'Скользящий Мечник не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Нага Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые послушники-наги передвигаются бесшумно, словно отражения солнц на воде.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4da4f2-eb56-46e0-a155-e7bd48dc8712\', \'multiverseId\': 496912}, \'multiverseid\': 496912}, {\'name\': \'蛇身刀客\', \'text\': \'蛇身刀客不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'有些那伽祀徒移动时静如双日水中映影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de008f1-d9c2-4a94-b15d-9a60a4d07ef0\', \'multiverseId\': 497046}, \'multiverseid\': 497046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlüsselfee\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBeutezug {2}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Beutezugkosten wirken, falls du in diesem Zug mit einem Feenwesen oder einem Räuber einem Spieler Kampfschaden zugefügt hast.)\\nWenn die Schlüsselfee ins Spiel kommt und falls ihre Beutezugkosten bezahlt wurden, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f572d91b-5b82-4e59-b75f-4278bec37009\', \'multiverseId\': 496100}, \'multiverseid\': 496100}, {\'name\': \'Hada de la llave\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nRondar {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta por su coste de rondar si hiciste daño de combate a un jugador este turno con un Hada o un Bribón.)\\nCuando el Hada de la llave entre al campo de batalla, si se pagó su coste de rondar, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6006d99-9eb7-4967-9bce-1d426dc47493\', \'multiverseId\': 496234}, \'multiverseid\': 496234}, {\'name\': \'Faerie rossignol\', \'text\': "Vol\\nIncursion {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût d\'incursion si vous avez infligé des blessures de combat à un joueur ce tour-ci avec un peuple fée ou un gredin.)\\nQuand la Faerie rossignol arrive sur le champ de bataille, si son coût d\'incursion a été payé, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496368&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418ffaab-e38e-4230-a999-597c00114ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 496368}, \'multiverseid\': 496368}, {\'name\': \'Spiritello Apriporte\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nPredatore {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di predatore se hai inflitto danno da combattimento a un giocatore con uno Spiritello o un Farabutto in questo turno.)\\nQuando lo Spiritello Apriporte entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato pagato il suo costo di predatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c7dfe1-271e-4c71-8fcf-07463f0fdb4d\', \'multiverseId\': 496502}, \'multiverseid\': 496502}, {\'name\': \'掛け鍵のフェアリー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n徘徊{2}{U}（このターン、あなたがフェアリーかならず者によってプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えているなら、あなたはこれをその徘徊コストで唱えてもよい。）\\n掛け鍵のフェアリーが戦場に出たとき、これの徘徊コストが支払われていた場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e995d3-89e4-4941-bd31-af0995c592f9\', \'multiverseId\': 496636}, \'multiverseid\': 496636}, {\'name\': \'Fada das Chaves\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEspreitar {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de espreitar se você causou dano de combate a um jogador neste turno com uma Fada ou um Ladino.)\\nQuando Fada das Chaves entrar no campo de batalha, se seu custo de espreitar tiver sido pago, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e72eb20-9557-4a78-afaa-ce00103db3f0\', \'multiverseId\': 496770}, \'multiverseid\': 496770}, {\'name\': \'Фея с Отмычками\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nМародерство {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту за ее стоимость Мародерства, если в этом ходу вы нанесли игроку боевые повреждения с помощью Феи или Бродяги.)\\nКогда Фея с Отмычками выходит на поле битвы, если ее стоимость Мародерства была оплачена, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9443d71c-b524-42c1-b940-89ff62cabe44\', \'multiverseId\': 496904}, \'multiverseid\': 496904}, {\'name\': \'飞钥仙灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n伺机{2}{U}（如果你本回合中曾以仙灵或浪客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害，则你可以支付此咒语的伺机费用来施放它。）\\n当飞钥仙灵进战场时，若曾支付其伺机费用，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdc868d-7169-4cd7-8d91-416082c54f85\', \'multiverseId\': 497038}, \'multiverseid\': 497038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schuppenwächter-Elite\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schuppenwächter-Elite ins Spiel kommt, wende Kräftigung 2 an. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur mit der geringsten Widerstandskraft unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur angreift, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef9ae6a-e27f-44d5-be78-7ea8749fb24d\', \'multiverseId\': 496086}, \'multiverseid\': 496086}, {\'name\': \'Guardiascama de élite\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Guardiascama de élite entre al campo de batalla, fortalece 2. (Elige la criatura con menor resistencia entre las criaturas que controlas y pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella ataque, gira la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4272b927-610e-477a-ab12-f843bf564a89\', \'multiverseId\': 496220}, \'multiverseid\': 496220}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'écaille d\'élite", \'text\': "Quand le Garde d\'écaille d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, renforcement 2. (Choisissez une créature avec l\'endurance la plus faible parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez et mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle attaque, engagez une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496354&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aee0aabf-33d9-4a13-b3d0-0d63f472742b\', \'multiverseId\': 496354}, \'multiverseid\': 496354}, {\'name\': "Guardia Scaglia d\'Elite", \'text\': "Quando la Guardia Scaglia d\'Elite entra nel campo di battaglia, sostieni 2. (Scegli una creatura con la costituzione minore tra le creature che controlli e metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli attacca, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ca35b3-5b6e-4a96-882f-cfacb3d81d97\', \'multiverseId\': 496488}, \'multiverseid\': 496488}, {\'name\': \'鱗衛兵の精鋭\', \'text\': \'鱗衛兵の精鋭が戦場に出たとき、鼓舞２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最も小さいタフネスを持つクリーチャーを１体選び、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b577c4f-1a14-4990-980a-140bbd994ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 496622}, \'multiverseid\': 496622}, {\'name\': \'Guarda Escamado de Elite\', \'text\': \'Quando Guarda Escamado de Elite entrar no campo de batalha, revigore 2. (Escolha uma criatura com a menor resistência entre as que você controla e coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura sob seu controle com um marcador +1/+1 atacar, vire a criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39bfe8fe-557d-42b2-baeb-285c4354f383\', \'multiverseId\': 496756}, \'multiverseid\': 496756}, {\'name\': \'Элитный Чешуйчатый Страж\', \'text\': \'Когда Элитный Чешуйчатый Страж выходит на поле битвы, используйте Подмогу 2. (Выберите из существ под вашим контролем существо с наименьшим значением выносливости и положите на него два жетона +1/+1.)\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем с жетоном +1/+1 на нем атакует, поверните целевое существо под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e0a973-d6ee-4df1-9761-8f905bbbfa65\', \'multiverseId\': 496890}, \'multiverseid\': 496890}, {\'name\': \'精英鳞卫\', \'text\': \'当精英鳞卫进战场时，振励2。（于由你操控的生物中选择一个防御力最小的生物，在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当一个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物攻击时，横置目标由防御牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c5ea3e6-f5b0-4c77-8099-068794329568\', \'multiverseId\': 497024}, \'multiverseid\': 497024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarzklinge, neu geschmiedet\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Land, das du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten einer legendären Kreatur {3}\\nAusrüsten {7}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Sie vergoss einst das Blut eines Drachenältesten. Vielleicht wird sie dies in Gideons Händen erneut tun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496179&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a867bb67-070f-4f9e-aefc-fa54c854e27a\', \'multiverseId\': 496179}, \'multiverseid\': 496179}, {\'name\': \'Blackblade reforjada\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 por cada tierra que controlas.\\nEquipar criatura legendaria {3}.\\nEquipar {7}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Derramó la sangre de un dragón anciano. En las manos de Gideon, tal vez pruebe la de otro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b435f52-4bed-45d4-a09b-79b2ae4d29ee\', \'multiverseId\': 496313}, \'multiverseid\': 496313}, {\'name\': \'Lamenoire reforgée\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque terrain que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement de créature légendaire {3}\\nÉquipement {7}\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Elle a fait couler le sang d\'un ancêtre dragon. Entre les mains de Gideon, elle pourrait bien goûter celui d\'un autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fa3c6e0-1ab6-471f-ba93-05cb562e1ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 496447}, \'multiverseid\': 496447}, {\'name\': \'Blackblade Riforgiata\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni terra che controlli.\\nEquipaggia creatura leggendaria {3}\\nEquipaggiare {7}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ha versato il sangue di un antico drago. In mano a Gideon, potrebbe assaggiare quello di un altro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbf4c42-05a4-46f9-9764-cbbe070c6707\', \'multiverseId\': 496581}, \'multiverseid\': 496581}, {\'name\': \'再鍛の黒き剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n伝説のクリーチャーに装備{3}\\n装備{7}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'あるエルダー・ドラゴンの血を流したこともある。ギデオンが振るえば、もう１頭になるかもしれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c28bb2-0fd3-4a0d-b0de-f0e08af1712b\', \'multiverseId\': 496715}, \'multiverseid\': 496715}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina Negra Reforjada\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 para cada terreno que você controla.\\nEquipar criatura lendária {3}\\nEquipar {7}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ela derramou o sangue de um dragão ancião. Nas mãos de Gideon, pode vir a provar o de outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbdd5f68-af7f-412b-bb37-94fb700a06b2\', \'multiverseId\': 496849}, \'multiverseid\': 496849}, {\'name\': \'Перекованный Черный Меч\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+1 за каждую землю под вашим контролем.\\nСнарядить легендарное существо {3}\\nСнарядить {7}\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Этот меч пролил кровь одного дракона-старейшины. В руках Гидеона он может попробовать кровь второго.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020477ad-bd44-4602-815d-5584a2bb9802\', \'multiverseId\': 496983}, \'multiverseid\': 496983}, {\'name\': \'重铸乌锋\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个地，佩带此武具的生物便得+1/+1。\\n佩带传奇生物{3}\\n佩带{7}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'此剑曾沾染龙长老的鲜血。如今握在基定手中，它或能再让另一位溅血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcaa339f-b9c8-432b-8a14-1e3143fc596c\', \'multiverseId\': 497117}, \'multiverseid\': 497117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenmanipulation\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\\n• Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sowohl Geburt als auch Tod sind umkehrbar."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496172&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb80f0c6-2e38-47f3-8b0f-4c3f42a99b81\', \'multiverseId\': 496172}, \'multiverseid\': 496172}, {\'name\': \'Manipulación del alma\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura objetivo.\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nacimiento y muerte son ambos reversibles".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827ad545-b05a-4cec-abae-6bdb811963dd\', \'multiverseId\': 496306}, \'multiverseid\': 496306}, {\'name\': "Manipulation de l\'âme", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Contrecarrez le sort de créature ciblé.\\n• Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La vie et la mort sont toutes deux réversibles. »\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9ffcd6b-d81e-4635-8a0b-4682c58b21c2\', \'multiverseId\': 496440}, \'multiverseid\': 496440}, {\'name\': "Manipolazione dell\'Anima", \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio.\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sia la nascita che la morte sono processi reversibili."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96acfed3-451e-497b-aa3d-62db75af3558\', \'multiverseId\': 496574}, \'multiverseid\': 496574}, {\'name\': \'魂の操作\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\n• あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「生と死は取り替えが利く。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1be6b8a-4a85-44f1-bb7e-66a7fe27f354\', \'multiverseId\': 496708}, \'multiverseid\': 496708}, {\'name\': \'Manipulação de Alma\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Anule a mágica de criatura alvo.\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tanto o nascimento quanto a morte são reversíveis."\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687ab755-6e8d-42a5-824c-065351bcb7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 496842}, \'multiverseid\': 496842}, {\'name\': \'Манипулирование Душами\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание существа.\\n• Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«И рождение, и смерть — явления обратимые».\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1ca953-e74c-4cef-b38a-4e9eddd07b16\', \'multiverseId\': 496976}, \'multiverseid\': 496976}, {\'name\': \'操弄灵魂\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•反击目标生物咒语。\\n•将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「生与死均可逆向而行。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e97ef8f-e71d-4c0b-a619-9c3584eaf861\', \'multiverseId\': 497110}, \'multiverseid\': 497110}]', "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Gildeneingang', 'text': 'Der Selesnija-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land — Tor', 'flavor': 'Tritt ein und freue dich! Das Konklave ist für jeden offen und vereint alles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496211&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2207fb4-ba51-433a-b055-0eb9a5a73535', 'multiverseId': 496211}, 'multiverseid': 496211}, {'name': 'Portal del Gremio Selesnya', 'text': 'El Portal del Gremio Selesnya entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Portal', 'flavor': '¡Únete y regocíjate! El Cónclave se mantiene unido, y todos son bienvenidos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496345&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9976cfaf-3c2d-4c13-a614-c889c5015036', 'multiverseId': 496345}, 'multiverseid': 496345}, {'name': 'Porte de la guilde de Selesnya', 'text': 'La Porte de la guilde de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain : porte', 'flavor': 'Entrez et réjouissez-vous ! Le Conclave est uni, ouvert à toutes et à tous.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496479&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0005d8cb-3847-4cf0-81b0-8de069796aa8', 'multiverseId': 496479}, 'multiverseid': 496479}, {'name': 'Cancello della Gilda di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Cancello della Gilda di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra — Cancello', 'flavor': 'Entrate e gioite! Il Conclave è riunito, pronto ad accogliere tutti!', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496613&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2fac7fc-3f6f-4ac8-88e3-5334d5bb659d', 'multiverseId': 496613}, 'multiverseid': 496613}, {'name': 'セレズニアのギルド門', 'text': 'セレズニアのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 門', 'flavor': '楽しみとともにこの門に入ったのなら、どんな人にも議事会の扉は開かれる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496747&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51fa7ca9-8bd8-4180-a290-cfcd6cbb9016', 'multiverseId': 496747}, 'multiverseid': 496747}, {'name': 'Portão da Guilda Selesnya', 'text': 'Portão da Guilda Selesnya entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno — Portão', 'flavor': 'Entre e alegre-se! O Conclave permanece unido e aberto a todos, de modo incondicional.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496881&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2b08f63-a381-45f5-a176-77bc13170482', 'multiverseId': 496881}, 'multiverseid': 496881}, {'name': 'Врата Гильдии Селезнии', 'text': 'Врата Гильдии Селезнии выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.', 'type': 'Земля — Врата', 'flavor': 'Войдите и возрадуйтесь! Конклав сплочен как никогда и открыт для всех и каждого.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497015&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed6971a7-ea37-4e50-a1e3-6d23f329ab53', 'multiverseId': 497015}, 'multiverseid': 497015}, {'name': '瑟雷尼亚公会门', 'text': '瑟雷尼亚公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。', 'type': '地 ～门', 'flavor': '此门随时为分享喜乐开启！同心一致的盟会欢迎所有人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497149&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d446acb-9c7c-4856-93ca-33b93523c79f', 'multiverseId': 497149}, 'multiverseid': 497149}]", "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Heiligtum', 'text': 'Das Selesnija-Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Selesnija-Heiligtum ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496212&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc16bc7f-f28b-4d5d-b1a0-402266c699c8', 'multiverseId': 496212}, 'multiverseid': 496212}, {'name': 'Santuario selesnya', 'text': 'El Santuario selesnya entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Santuario selesnya entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496346&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e8f254e-9ed3-4580-a4d6-b5a0ee28aa59', 'multiverseId': 496346}, 'multiverseid': 496346}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire de Selesnya', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496480&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14660cae-da19-4d7e-813c-892fe023ec63', 'multiverseId': 496480}, 'multiverseid': 496480}, {'name': 'Santuario di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496614&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0f0f619-073d-4ff1-9768-dd467d2d1aca', 'multiverseId': 496614}, 'multiverseid': 496614}, {'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496748&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3546722a-d22c-414d-b502-d6c452738ff3', 'multiverseId': 496748}, 'multiverseid': 496748}, {'name': 'Santuário Selesnya', 'text': 'Santuário Selesnya entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Santuário Selesnya entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496882&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a9d729d-b84c-44ea-8e00-283ca0bba94a', 'multiverseId': 496882}, 'multiverseid': 496882}, {'name': 'Святилище Селезнии', 'text': 'Святилище Селезнии выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Святилище Селезнии выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497016&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c383ef43-fd47-4c36-8ab2-980c8bf511b6', 'multiverseId': 497016}, 'multiverseid': 497016}, {'name': '瑟雷尼亚圣殿', 'text': '瑟雷尼亚圣殿须横置进战场。\\n当瑟雷尼亚圣殿进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497150&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccdab5a8-6457-4c54-9656-534e5733345c', 'multiverseId': 497150}, 'multiverseid': 497150}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sensenkralle\', \'text\': \'Lebende Waffe (Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/0 schwarzen Keim-Kreaturenspielstein und lege sie dann an ihn an.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, verliert der Spieler die Hälfte seiner Lebenspunkte, aufgerundet.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd546c1d-56c7-45d1-9d1a-ae20f76066f8\', \'multiverseId\': 496190}, \'multiverseid\': 496190}, {\'name\': \'Garraguadaña\', \'text\': \'Arma viviente. (Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Germen negra 0/0 y luego anéxalo a ella.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador pierde la mitad de sus vidas, redondeando hacia arriba.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709edb44-53cc-441f-9e4e-d6a8a1f1e808\', \'multiverseId\': 496324}, \'multiverseid\': 496324}, {\'name\': \'Griffe faucheuse\', \'text\': "Arme vivante (Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Germe, puis attachez-lui cet équipement.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur perd la moitié de ses points de vie, arrondie à l\'unité supérieure.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69ec413-13c7-4a8b-93fa-539612cee9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 496458}, \'multiverseid\': 496458}, {\'name\': \'Falciartiglio\', \'text\': \'Arma vivente (Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Microbo 0/0 nera, poi assegnalo ad essa.)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore perde metà dei suoi punti vita, arrotondati per eccesso.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2280acf1-c783-46a9-a8c3-a07910e70795\', \'multiverseId\': 496592}, \'multiverseid\': 496592}, {\'name\': \'鎌爪\', \'text\': \'生体武器（この装備品が戦場に出たとき、黒の０/０の細菌・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。その後、これをそれにつける。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライフの端数を切り上げた半分の点数のライフを失う。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4429d27e-f1b0-4729-98d3-7fbecb4bdd56\', \'multiverseId\': 496726}, \'multiverseid\': 496726}, {\'name\': \'Garra-de-foice\', \'text\': \'Arma viva (Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Germe e anexe-o a ela.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +1/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador perde metade de seus pontos de vida, arredondada para cima.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3c4308-beb6-4721-8808-3fd557a54e18\', \'multiverseId\': 496860}, \'multiverseid\': 496860}, {\'name\': \'Коготь-Коса\', \'text\': \'Живое оружие (Когда это Снаряжение выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черный Микроб, затем прикрепите к ней это Снаряжение.)\\nСнаряженное существо получает +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок теряет половину своих жизней с округлением в большую сторону.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7170cac-48ba-4c32-a02d-ecf20596fc1d\', \'multiverseId\': 496994}, \'multiverseid\': 496994}, {\'name\': \'镰刀爪\', \'text\': \'活化武器（当此武具进战场时，派出一个0/0黑色病菌衍生生物，然后将它装备于其上。）\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手失去一半数量的生命，小数点后进位。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae10f5dc-ab68-4335-a104-c34c34cbb82b\', \'multiverseId\': 497128}, \'multiverseid\': 497128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sich entfaltende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Welt ist ein Organismus und daher in der Lage, neue Länder entstehen zu lassen. Manche machen dies deutlich schneller als andere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496201&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c1540b6-c4a3-469c-877e-1974dda8ee70\', \'multiverseId\': 496201}, \'multiverseid\': 496201}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos expansivos\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cada mundo es un organismo capaz de engendrar nuevas tierras. Unos lo hacen más rápido que otros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95471b0-e3d6-4f03-b5ac-527f30136b74\', \'multiverseId\': 496335}, \'multiverseid\': 496335}, {\'name\': \'Étendues sauvages en évolution\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Chaque monde est un organisme qui peut donner naissance à de nouvelles terres. Certains le font simplement plus rapidement que d\'autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22bc6b9d-64c2-4197-a051-3d467e49af0e\', \'multiverseId\': 496469}, \'multiverseid\': 496469}, {\'name\': \'Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica le Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni mondo è un organismo, in grado di far nascere nuove terre. Alcuni ci riescono più rapidamente di altri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744bab75-e337-4e7f-aea9-191e7696feac\', \'multiverseId\': 496603}, \'multiverseid\': 496603}, {\'name\': \'進化する未開地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'すべての世界は、新たな世界を生み出す生命体だ。中には他よりも速いものもあるが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'986e3762-a4bf-4427-8db5-e48f894b6ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 496737}, \'multiverseid\': 496737}, {\'name\': \'Terras em Desenvolvimento\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Terras em Desenvolvimento: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Cada mundo é um organismo capaz de gerar novos terrenos. Alguns simplesmente fazem isso mais rápido que outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090d927e-fea5-48f0-bde0-2019e268331b\', \'multiverseId\': 496871}, \'multiverseid\': 496871}, {\'name\': \'Перерождающиеся Дебри\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте Перерождающиеся Дебри: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый мир — это живой организм, способный создавать новые земли. Просто некоторые миры делают это быстрее других.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94389515-0d92-40df-8ef3-d3c6dcd934ef\', \'multiverseId\': 497005}, \'multiverseid\': 497005}, {\'name\': \'成形野地\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲成形野地：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'任一世界都是个有机体，能让新的地成长。有些只是作得比其他的都快。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c71f9c-95ff-4c32-a095-7fe71b156bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 497139}, \'multiverseid\': 497139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silumgars Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\\n• Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Zerstöre einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496171&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef31e965-e8b7-42d6-90bd-036f481d2986\', \'multiverseId\': 496171}, \'multiverseid\': 496171}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Sílumgar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\\n• Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Destruye el planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63743ee1-fecc-4f73-a814-c906f5cbbcc6\', \'multiverseId\': 496305}, \'multiverseid\': 496305}, {\'name\': \'Commandement de Silumgar\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Contrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé.\\n• Renvoyez un permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Détruisez un planeswalker ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c37cd4ce-6725-486b-9d40-6b1f2ff55071\', \'multiverseId\': 496439}, \'multiverseid\': 496439}, {\'name\': \'Comando di Silumgar\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Neutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio.\\n• Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Distruggi un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f58403d-935b-4fa7-b432-9da70dc42f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 496573}, \'multiverseid\': 496573}, {\'name\': \'シルムガルの命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\n• パーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\\n• プレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373d5300-8016-4ad6-a770-cfe4a32edabb\', \'multiverseId\': 496707}, \'multiverseid\': 496707}, {\'name\': \'Comando de Silumgar\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• Anule a mágica alvo que não seja de criatura.\\n• Devolva a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -3/-3 até o final do turno.\\n• Destrua o planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be990903-1862-4f7b-a14a-93d01fe996de\', \'multiverseId\': 496841}, \'multiverseid\': 496841}, {\'name\': \'Веление Силумгара\', \'text\': "Выберите два —\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа.\\n• Верните целевой перманент в руку его владельца.\\n• Целевое существо получает -3/-3 до конца хода.\\n• Уничтожьте целевого planeswalker\'а.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa0e227-37ea-4323-86b5-b6fa1ee42ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 496975}, \'multiverseid\': 496975}, {\'name\': \'席穆嘉的指命\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•反击目标非生物咒语。\\n•将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n•目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\\n•消灭目标鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bedf2b7-1e31-4e5a-9aac-2ca2e751f0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 497109}, \'multiverseid\': 497109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8386d6bc-eb9a-4613-927f-b51db846bd63\', \'multiverseId\': 496093}, \'multiverseid\': 496093}, {\'name\': \'Titán solar\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Titán solar entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes regresar la carta de permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sol ardiente que nunca se pone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7288754e-4c5d-4730-a1d1-99def4f128d8\', \'multiverseId\': 496227}, \'multiverseid\': 496227}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de permanent ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496361&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6b789b8-d86b-44d4-a3e1-c18848fcd9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 496361}, \'multiverseid\': 496361}, {\'name\': \'Titano Solare\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Solare entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sole cocente che non tramonta mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96ebd80e-8b65-44a2-8fd3-5355f6d8a99b\', \'multiverseId\': 496495}, \'multiverseid\': 496495}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd99f6e4-d050-411d-b50c-68dde3065fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 496629}, \'multiverseid\': 496629}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Sol\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Titã de Sol entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode devolver o card de permanente alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério ao campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Um sol flamejante que nunca se põe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4ddee4-71f9-43ad-8e5b-220746173f95\', \'multiverseId\': 496763}, \'multiverseid\': 496763}, {\'name\': \'Титан Солнца\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда Титан Солнца выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы можете вернуть целевую карту перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Ослепительное солнце, которое никогда не заходит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc0ec37a-3b52-4117-bb42-f493d77ea52f\', \'multiverseId\': 496897}, \'multiverseid\': 496897}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当旭日泰坦进战场或攻击时，你可以将目标总法术力费用等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ee3e96-6d92-441e-8469-c4e3091e0b23\', \'multiverseId\': 497031}, \'multiverseid\': 497031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae0d1784-e0a5-4b9c-9e04-2fb96a565cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 496192}, \'multiverseid\': 496192}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'470c753a-b2a7-4a49-ac0f-1f873e49fe02\', \'multiverseId\': 496326}, \'multiverseid\': 496326}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f37979f-7056-40c4-bc98-b5c87a678b51\', \'multiverseId\': 496460}, \'multiverseid\': 496460}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0116a9e2-960f-45b7-84d5-ef6df51d3ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 496594}, \'multiverseid\': 496594}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43e91b5-94bc-49d6-aff1-5f338e3f85ea\', \'multiverseId\': 496728}, \'multiverseid\': 496728}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdeu-se no tempo a antiga arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5c388f5-e3e4-49b2-a90a-6a2f8bc7dc51\', \'multiverseId\': 496862}, \'multiverseid\': 496862}, {\'name\': \'Солнечное Кольцо\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Давно забытое искусство механиков позволяло заключить свет далекой звезды в кольцо из чистейшего золота.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ada26b8-cd3c-4135-9d95-4d15709a6d74\', \'multiverseId\': 496996}, \'multiverseid\': 496996}, {\'name\': \'阳光戒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'神器师曾能利用至纯黄金打造的戒指捕获来自遥远星辰的光芒，这门技艺如今早已亡佚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22000848-8a10-416c-8eec-e6f7586c5599\', \'multiverseId\': 497130}, \'multiverseid\': 497130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenuhr des Sehers\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schatten wandert auf den Gipfel zu. Ich schätze, dass wir bald die wahre Dunkelheit kennenlernen werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496191&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d712306e-7c15-4bba-aba0-ccbdb010e843\', \'multiverseId\': 496191}, \'multiverseid\': 496191}, {\'name\': \'Reloj de sol del vidente\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La sombra va hacia el cenit. Predigo que pronto veremos la verdadera dimensión de la oscuridad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74296b8a-4f98-4d9c-81bd-cf4f77375d08\', \'multiverseId\': 496325}, \'multiverseid\': 496325}, {\'name\': \'Cadran solaire du voyant\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ombre monte à son zénith. Je prédis que bientôt, nous connaîtrons la véritable mesure des ténèbres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594a4a55-6d25-450d-9698-90d516a35ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 496459}, \'multiverseid\': 496459}, {\'name\': \'Meridiana del Veggente\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le ombre si stanno muovendo verso la vetta. Immagino che presto ci renderemo conto della vera potenza dell\\\'oscurità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfd4d928-0ab1-4352-b71f-5b5534af585d\', \'multiverseId\': 496593}, \'multiverseid\': 496593}, {\'name\': \'予見者の日時計\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「影は頂上を指しています。おそらくもうすぐ真の闇を見ることになるでしょうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be722afd-e987-4210-a025-106f1d1ae3ca\', \'multiverseId\': 496727}, \'multiverseid\': 496727}, {\'name\': \'Meridiana do Vidente\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A sombra viaja na direção do ápice. Eu prevejo que logo veremos a verdadeira dimensão da escuridão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfb8d2c-c2d8-44ee-b60f-8ed7c03ac38f\', \'multiverseId\': 496861}, \'multiverseid\': 496861}, {\'name\': \'Солнечные Часы Провидца\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Тень ползет к вершине. Предсказываю: скоро мы познаем истинную меру тьмы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355f1f78-bc68-45c2-886f-da7ba172cb61\', \'multiverseId\': 496995}, \'multiverseid\': 496995}, {\'name\': \'预言师日晷\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「阴影逐渐向顶点移动。我预测我们很快将会见到黑暗的真正尺度。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5502555a-f715-4348-bde4-ad0d3c8ef9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 497129}, \'multiverseid\': 497129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496181&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c030dca-6205-4910-a7a8-734e17adb80d\', \'multiverseId\': 496181}, \'multiverseid\': 496181}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046af2c4-ea9b-452c-9bbb-15f81ced52b4\', \'multiverseId\': 496315}, \'multiverseid\': 496315}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c75383f-6aa3-4077-ad80-d507566a418f\', \'multiverseId\': 496449}, \'multiverseid\': 496449}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2add9f18-22a0-4a91-9492-fab6d81788b0\', \'multiverseId\': 496583}, \'multiverseid\': 496583}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e174caea-cc76-44a2-bd0e-62add9c27f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 496717}, \'multiverseid\': 496717}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se harmoniza com a essência de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d952a4-fab1-4757-9e2d-ae068d35c138\', \'multiverseId\': 496851}, \'multiverseid\': 496851}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Командира\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\\nПожертвуйте Сферу Командира: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Она настраивается на сущность хозяина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d45755-38ba-48ce-98ea-abc4e0650399\', \'multiverseId\': 496985}, \'multiverseid\': 496985}, {\'name\': \'指挥官法球\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\\n牺牲指挥官法球：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它能与主人的精华同调。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439a4c79-87a5-4fdb-bd08-35582d85e2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 497119}, \'multiverseid\': 497119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sporenbuckel\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn er sein Territorium bedroht sieht, produziert er Sporen. Eigentlich produziert er immer Sporen, egal, was man tut."\\n—Hadi Kasten, Naturalist aus Calla Dale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496154&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3b0d194-7802-4872-8dec-4742093cc75a\', \'multiverseId\': 496154}, \'multiverseid\': 496154}, {\'name\': \'Montículo de esporas\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si amenazas su territorio, produce esporas. De hecho, no importa lo que hagas, producirá esporas".\\n—Hadi Kasten, naturalista del Valle Kala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c98caf1-003f-4061-b92f-7a9772588674\', \'multiverseId\': 496288}, \'multiverseid\': 496288}, {\'name\': \'Tertre aux spores\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous menacez son territoire, il produira des spores. En fait, quoi que vous fassiez, il produira des spores. »\\n—Hadi Kasten, naturaliste du Vallon de Calla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ccff8a0-640f-452f-97ba-d47052caa1a7\', \'multiverseId\': 496422}, \'multiverseid\': 496422}, {\'name\': \'Collina delle Spore\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'"Se minacci il suo territorio, produce spore. In realtà, non importa cosa fai tu, produce sempre spore."\\n—Hadi Kasten, naturalista della Vallata delle Calle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91392dab-c20e-4880-88e3-232df881631f\', \'multiverseId\': 496556}, \'multiverseid\': 496556}, {\'name\': \'胞子塚\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'「縄張りを脅かせば胞子を飛ばすぞ。まあ実際のところ、おまえさんが何をしようと胞子を飛ばすがな。」\\n――カラ谷の自然術士、ハジ・カステン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629ae31d-10dc-45a7-ae42-1726147f3e63\', \'multiverseId\': 496690}, \'multiverseid\': 496690}, {\'name\': \'Montículo de Esporos\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se seu território é ameaçado, ele produz esporos. Na verdade, ele produz esporos independentemente do que você faça."\\n— Hadi Kasten, naturalista do Vale de Cala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd511d6-52af-48b4-aa50-4a2557a264d4\', \'multiverseId\': 496824}, \'multiverseid\': 496824}, {\'name\': \'Споровая Кочка\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень\', \'flavor\': \'«Если ты заходишь на ее территорию, она испускает споры. Собственно, что с ней ни делай, она испускает споры».\\n— Хади Кастен, калла-дейльский натуралист\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71b3f17-6ec2-40a8-aa3d-fbe1ac8bad28\', \'multiverseId\': 496958}, \'multiverseid\': 496958}, {\'name\': \'孢子堆\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你威胁到其领域，它会产生孢子。事实上，无论你做什么，它都会产生孢子。」\\n～卡拉谷博物学者哈地卡登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f0ad33e-c128-44a3-82b4-c1a6ceb47e58\', \'multiverseId\': 497092}, \'multiverseid\': 497092}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stinksäufer-Bandit\', \'text\': \'Beutezug {1}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Beutezugkosten wirken, falls du in diesem Zug mit einem Goblin oder einem Räuber einem Spieler Kampfschaden zugefügt hast.)\\nImmer wenn ein Räuber, den du kontrollierst, angreift und nicht geblockt wird, erhält er +2/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc44203-af6d-4259-9f9d-bf6afe71995c\', \'multiverseId\': 496127}, \'multiverseid\': 496127}, {\'name\': \'Bandido de Bebehediondo\', \'text\': \'Rondar {1}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta por su coste de rondar si hiciste daño de combate a un jugador este turno con un Trasgo o un Bribón.)\\nSiempre que un Bribón que controlas ataque y no sea bloqueado, obtiene +2/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5403e19c-a061-4d97-97e3-3d21c93adb1f\', \'multiverseId\': 496261}, \'multiverseid\': 496261}, {\'name\': \'Bandit de Puelasoif\', \'text\': "Incursion {1}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte pour son coût d\'incursion si vous avez infligé des blessures de combat à un joueur ce tour-ci avec un gobelin ou un gredin.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un gredin que vous contrôlez attaque et qu\'il n\'est pas bloqué, il gagne +2/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496395&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7249b778-9ffa-434a-8408-66a17702e93b\', \'multiverseId\': 496395}, \'multiverseid\': 496395}, {\'name\': \'Bandito di Beone Puzzolente\', \'text\': \'Predatore {1}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di predatore se hai inflitto danno da combattimento a un giocatore con un Farabutto o un Goblin in questo turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta un Farabutto che controlli attacca e non viene bloccato, prende +2/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492d35d7-356e-47f4-8f20-af545c7e94e3\', \'multiverseId\': 496529}, \'multiverseid\': 496529}, {\'name\': \'臭汁飲みの山賊\', \'text\': \'徘徊{1}{B}（このターン、あなたがゴブリンかならず者によってプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えているなら、あなたはこれをその徘徊コストで唱えてもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているならず者１体が攻撃してブロックされないたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a90b7429-bcae-4e82-a1bf-74fb7273f6da\', \'multiverseId\': 496663}, \'multiverseid\': 496663}, {\'name\': \'Bandido de Bebumtinga\', \'text\': \'Espreitar {1}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card pagando seu custo de espreitar se você causou dano de combate a um jogador neste turno com um Goblin ou Ladino.)\\nToda vez que um Ladino que você controla ataca e não é bloqueado, ele recebe +2/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68526f5-2d15-4ed3-a50f-7ebde5b28867\', \'multiverseId\': 496797}, \'multiverseid\': 496797}, {\'name\': \'Бандит из Клана Пьянчуг\', \'text\': \'Мародерство {1}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту за ее стоимость Мародерства, если в этом ходу вы нанесли игроку боевые повреждения с помощью Гоблина или Бродяги.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Бродяга под вашим контролем атакует и не заблокирован, он получает +2/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ebc139-af40-4582-909b-3e867ac3d406\', \'multiverseId\': 496931}, \'multiverseid\': 496931}, {\'name\': \'臭饮土匪\', \'text\': \'伺机{1}{B}（如果你本回合中曾以鬼怪或浪客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害，则你可以支付此咒语的伺机费用来施放它。）\\n每当一个由你操控的浪客攻击且未受阻挡时，它得+2/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c0f8637-a572-46ff-8eb4-c67be4e45f33\', \'multiverseId\': 497065}, \'multiverseid\': 497065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stunde der Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger, falls sich zehn oder mehr bleibende Karten, die keine Länder sind, im Spiel befinden.\\nZerstöre alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Tor zum Jenseits öffnete sich und das Licht des Gott-Pharaos zwang alle Wesen in die Knie. Die Stunde der Offenbarung hatte begonnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78d2dc7-cebd-44fd-9764-0533ce52d08e\', \'multiverseId\': 496089}, \'multiverseid\': 496089}, {\'name\': \'La Hora de la Revelación\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {3} menos lanzar este hechizo si hay diez o más permanentes que no sean tierra en el campo de batalla.\\nDestruye todos los permanentes que no sean tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Durante los primeros instantes, el Portal al más allá se abrió y el pueblo se postró ante la luz del Dios Faraón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ccce4cb-9f79-4025-bc33-02ddd1db2e21\', \'multiverseId\': 496223}, \'multiverseid\': 496223}, {\'name\': "L\'Âge de la Révélation", \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {3} de moins à lancer s\'il y a au moins dix permanents non-terrain sur le champ de bataille.\\nDétruisez tous les permanents non-terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans les premiers instants, le portail vers l\'au-delà s\'ouvrit, et tous se prosternèrent devant la lumière du Dieu-Pharaon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35028ecb-35e8-4cd1-98c4-b2ee38a1d4e1\', \'multiverseId\': 496357}, \'multiverseid\': 496357}, {\'name\': \'Era della Rivelazione\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata se ci sono almeno dieci permanenti non terra sul campo di battaglia.\\nDistruggi tutti i permanenti non terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Nei primi istanti, i cancelli dell\'Aldilà si aprirono e il popolo si prostrò dinanzi alla luce del Dio Faraone.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d6be5b-67d2-4a15-b180-bf2d1d04c35e\', \'multiverseId\': 496491}, \'multiverseid\': 496491}, {\'name\': \'啓示の刻\', \'text\': \'戦場に土地でないパーマネントが10個以上あるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\n土地でないパーマネントをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'その瞬間、来世への門が開き、人々は王神の光に包まれてひれ伏した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dcf39aa-4d30-4323-ac8d-6ef873e24ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 496625}, \'multiverseid\': 496625}, {\'name\': \'Hora da Revelação\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {3} a menos para ser conjurada se houver no campo de batalha dez ou mais permanentes que não sejam terrenos.\\nDestrua todas as permanentes que não sejam terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nos primeiros momentos, o portão para o além abriu-se e o povo prostrou-se sob a luz do Faraó-deus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1008114-bcaa-44aa-8776-98d0be9abae6\', \'multiverseId\': 496759}, \'multiverseid\': 496759}, {\'name\': \'Час Откровения\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {3} меньше, если на поле битвы есть не менее десяти не являющихся землями перманентов.\\nУничтожьте все перманенты, не являющиеся землями.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В первые мгновения врата в загробную жизнь распахнулись, и люди распростерлись ниц, омытые светом Бога-Фараона.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd70d63-a261-40e0-ab51-ba6249ea26d3\', \'multiverseId\': 496893}, \'multiverseid\': 496893}, {\'name\': \'预示时刻\', \'text\': \'如果战场上有十个或更多的非地永久物，则此咒语减少{3}来施放。\\n消灭所有非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'初时，来世之门缓缓开启，法老神圣光威服众生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b04e40-1321-4e00-a8dc-ef0de91482e1\', \'multiverseId\': 497027}, \'multiverseid\': 497027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sumpfflatterer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Sumpfflatterer ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 schwarze Goblin-Räuber-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nOpfere einen Goblin: Der Sumpfflatterer hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 3/3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b8bf63-3362-415e-b08b-8694b7864135\', \'multiverseId\': 496118}, \'multiverseid\': 496118}, {\'name\': \'Revoloteadora del cenagal\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Revoloteadora del cenagal entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Bribón Trasgo negras 1/1.\\nSacrificar un Trasgo: La Revoloteadora del cenagal tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 3/3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef5782c-71b5-404a-b0f1-c899af9193ba\', \'multiverseId\': 496252}, \'multiverseid\': 496252}, {\'name\': \'Voltigeuse des marécages\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Voltigeuse des marécages arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 noire Gobelin et Gredin.\\nSacrifiez un gobelin : La Voltigeuse des marécages a une force et une endurance de base de 3/3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496386&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05d21eb-c551-4daa-aaa8-8bd51c2144bd\', \'multiverseId\': 496386}, \'multiverseid\': 496386}, {\'name\': \'Svolazzante Palustre\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Svolazzante Palustre entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Farabutto Goblin 1/1 nere.\\nSacrifica un Goblin: La Svolazzante Palustre ha forza e costituzione base 3/3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec4f8b9-9060-4b17-afae-b98f9ca59fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 496520}, \'multiverseid\': 496520}, {\'name\': \'湿地の飛び回り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n湿地の飛び回りが戦場に出たとき、黒の１/１のゴブリン・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、湿地の飛び回りは基本のパワーとタフネスが３/３になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42691f57-a2f8-42fb-b11d-20e00cddbcd9\', \'multiverseId\': 496654}, \'multiverseid\': 496654}, {\'name\': \'Esvoaçadora do Pântano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Esvoaçadora do Pântano entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura preta 1/1 do tipo Goblin Ladino.\\nSacrifique um Goblin: Esvoaçadora do Pântano tem poder e resistência básicos 3/3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7b2440-a41c-4707-b941-3634c67eb31a\', \'multiverseId\': 496788}, \'multiverseid\': 496788}, {\'name\': \'Порхающая по Болотам\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Порхающая по Болотам выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки существа 1/1 черный Гоблин Бродяга.\\nПожертвуйте Гоблина: Порхающая по Болотам имеет базовую силу и выносливость 3/3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05957b78-4d38-45c3-b3aa-e36c34270711\', \'multiverseId\': 496922}, \'multiverseid\': 496922}, {\'name\': \'沼地掠空客\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当沼地掠空客进战场时，派出两个1/1黑色鬼怪／浪客衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个鬼怪：沼地掠空客的基础力量与防御力为3/3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'189ecf0b-948a-4d28-ab7b-55ce14ce49c9\', \'multiverseId\': 497056}, \'multiverseid\': 497056}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sygg, Flussmeuchler\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hat, kannst du eine Karte ziehen. (Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist egal, wer es verdient hat. Nur auf die Stärke kommt es an. Die Kraft, es festzuhalten, gegen die Kraft, es zu rauben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a1dedf-7b58-4fd9-97e3-126513a77e30\', \'multiverseId\': 496175}, \'multiverseid\': 496175}, {\'name\': \'Sygg, degollador del río\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada paso final, si un oponente perdió 3 o más vidas este turno, puedes robar una carta. (El daño causa pérdida de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"El problema no es merecerlo. El problema es la fortaleza. El poder de retener contra el poder de tomar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0faf3ce-6d98-4810-b7a0-eeea00bb3820\', \'multiverseId\': 496309}, \'multiverseid\': 496309}, {\'name\': \'Sygg, surineur de rivière\', \'text\': \'Au début de chaque étape de fin, si un adversaire a perdu au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez piocher une carte. (Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est pas une question de mérite, mais une question de force. Le pouvoir de garder ou le pouvoir de prendre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b28d3a-7c6f-4fe1-a9a1-e09c7591dd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 496443}, \'multiverseid\': 496443}, {\'name\': \'Sygg, Tagliagole Fluviale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se un avversario ha perso 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, puoi pescare una carta. (Il danno provoca la perdita di punti vita.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è una questione di merito. È una questione di forza. La forza di trattenere contro quella di afferrare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed53785d-2f2a-4cc5-9d96-575abdc3241d\', \'multiverseId\': 496577}, \'multiverseid\': 496577}, {\'name\': \'川の殺し屋、シグ\', \'text\': \'各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンに対戦相手１人が３点以上のライフを失っていた場合、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「価値がどうって問題じゃない。強さが問題なんだ。守る力と持ち去る力の関係さ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17e2756-a9de-456d-b3ad-e562d210f52d\', \'multiverseId\': 496711}, \'multiverseid\': 496711}, {\'name\': \'Sygg, Degolador do Rio\', \'text\': \'No início de cada etapa final, se um oponente perdeu 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, você pode comprar um card. (O dano causa perda de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é uma questão de merecer. É uma questão de força. O poder de ter versus o poder de tomar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ad0c40-f7d8-4d3b-b21a-cc6e8a55d99d\', \'multiverseId\': 496845}, \'multiverseid\': 496845}, {\'name\': \'Сигг, Речной Головорез\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого заключительного шага, если оппонент потерял 3 или более жизни в этом ходу, вы можете взять карту. (Повреждения вызывают потерю жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Это не вопрос справедливой заслуги. Это вопрос силы. Кто сильнее — тот, кто пытается удержать, или тот, кто пытается отнять?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8cfec6-0baf-40c9-b19d-af4408c2745e\', \'multiverseId\': 496979}, \'multiverseid\': 496979}, {\'name\': \'河流割喉人席格\', \'text\': \'在每个结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有对手失去过3点或更多生命，则你可以抓一张牌。（伤害会导致失去生命。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「这不是有无资格的问题，而是力量的问题。这是保有之力与夺取之力的对决。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e889acc-9282-4369-8308-f98026d291d3\', \'multiverseId\': 497113}, \'multiverseid\': 497113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Syr Konrad der Grimmige\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt oder eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher außer aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird oder eine Kreaturenkarte deinen Friedhof verlässt, fügt Syr Konrad der Grimmige jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{1}{B}: Jeder Spieler millt eine Karte. (Jeder Spieler legt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3e3e13-b9bb-4b0c-97d6-ba26d47535f4\', \'multiverseId\': 496128}, \'multiverseid\': 496128}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, el Tétrico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura muera, que una carta de criatura vaya a un cementerio desde cualquier parte que no sea el campo de batalla, o que una carta de criatura deje tu cementerio, Syr Konrad, el Tétrico hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\n{1}{B}: Cada jugador muele una carta. (Cada uno pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d71539-5123-4eb8-b9a4-725ca55aa75d\', \'multiverseId\': 496262}, \'multiverseid\': 496262}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, le Sinistre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, ou qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis autre part que le champ de bataille, ou qu\'une carte de créature quitte votre cimetière, Syr Konrad, le Sinistre inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{1}{B} : Chaque joueur meule une carte. (Il met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496396&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03785465-11bd-4060-a09d-a946a1522d51\', \'multiverseId\': 496396}, \'multiverseid\': 496396}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, il Lugubre\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, una carta creatura viene messa in un cimitero da una zona diversa dal campo di battaglia o una carta creatura lascia il tuo cimitero, Syr Konrad, il Lugubre infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{1}{B}: Ogni giocatore macina una carta. (Ognuno mette nel proprio cimitero la prima carta del proprio grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9d02f2-5df9-484e-9dde-0a3d3c2a434f\', \'multiverseId\': 496530}, \'multiverseid\': 496530}, {\'name\': \'厳格な者、コンラッド卿\', \'text\': \'他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するか、クリーチャー・カードが１枚戦場以外の領域から墓地に置かれるか、クリーチャー・カードが１枚あなたの墓地を離れるたび、厳格な者、コンラッド卿は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{B}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚切削する。（各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce612337-80fb-428c-98eb-0a192c38fd32\', \'multiverseId\': 496664}, \'multiverseid\': 496664}, {\'name\': \'Syr Konrad, o Sisudo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura morre, ou um card de criatura é colocado em um cemitério vindo de qualquer lugar que não seja o campo de batalha, ou um card de criatura deixa seu cemitério, Syr Konrad, o Sisudo, causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\n{1}{B}: Cada jogador tritura um card. (Cada um deles coloca o card do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c28fa5d5-92b3-4489-bd2f-4d9fee5270b8\', \'multiverseId\': 496798}, \'multiverseid\': 496798}, {\'name\': \'Сейр Конрад, Угрюмый\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое существо умирает, или карта существа кладется на кладбище откуда угодно, кроме поля битвы, или карта существа покидает ваше кладбище, Сейр Конрад, Угрюмый наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\\n{1}{B}: каждый игрок скручивает карту. (Каждый из них кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5146fd-87a6-498e-a828-771dcade3204\', \'multiverseId\': 496932}, \'multiverseid\': 496932}, {\'name\': \'冷酷孔纳德爵士\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物死去，或一张生物牌从战场以外的任何区域进入坟墓场，或一张生物牌离开你的坟墓场时，冷酷孔纳德爵士向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n{1}{B}：每位牌手各磨一张牌。（他们各将其牌库顶的牌置入其坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab86d5b-794a-4ca8-bee8-e6d6de93539b\', \'multiverseId\': 497066}, \'multiverseid\': 497066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tobende Baloths\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen 4/4 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn das Land zornig ist, sind sie es auch."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0641c72-bc37-45a8-8d51-532d68ec3bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 496149}, \'multiverseid\': 496149}, {\'name\': \'Báloths impetuosos\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando la tierra está furiosa, también lo están ellos".\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0029af3-7de7-4bb4-83ce-e1683f0a226f\', \'multiverseId\': 496283}, \'multiverseid\': 496283}, {\'name\': \'Baloths déchaînés\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand la terre enrage, ils enragent aussi. »\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c5cb1d-28bf-4d94-be81-ff2cbfd3aa15\', \'multiverseId\': 496417}, \'multiverseid\': 496417}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Infuriati\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi creare una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando la terra è infuriata, lo sono anche loro."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c115b7cd-d165-4539-be58-2ac686cb9e46\', \'multiverseId\': 496551}, \'multiverseid\': 496551}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂うベイロス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「大地が怒ってるなら、そいつらもそうよ。」\\n――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761d996b-59ef-4517-bf2f-947c2adf50f6\', \'multiverseId\': 496685}, \'multiverseid\': 496685}, {\'name\': \'Baloths Enfurecidos\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando a terra se enfurece, eles fazem o mesmo."\\n— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a210cd42-60d5-4ba7-b0c6-0ddfce101c85\', \'multiverseId\': 496819}, \'multiverseid\': 496819}, {\'name\': \'Неистовые Балоты\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете создать одну фишку существа 4/4 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда земля впадает в злобу, они делают то же самое».\\n— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f008b1-6724-4126-ad33-5f4810c891d2\', \'multiverseId\': 496953}, \'multiverseid\': 496953}, {\'name\': \'莽闯巴洛西\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以派出一个4/4绿色野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「当大地发怒，它们也闹脾气。」\\n～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec9a6c5-54b0-464c-a174-48f2c8303a98\', \'multiverseId\': 497087}, \'multiverseid\': 497087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tristes Gewässer\', \'text\': \'Das Triste Gewässer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Triste Gewässer ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66674fe-8214-43e8-8e16-9743179b6e32\', \'multiverseId\': 496200}, \'multiverseid\': 496200}, {\'name\': \'Laguna lúgubre\', \'text\': \'La Laguna lúgubre entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Laguna lúgubre entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03bb2906-adb3-430a-8540-cfb81a5004d4\', \'multiverseId\': 496334}, \'multiverseid\': 496334}, {\'name\': \'Marigot lugubre\', \'text\': \'Le Marigot lugubre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marigot lugubre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284088f3-494a-4cb4-8b43-0e3f819955e8\', \'multiverseId\': 496468}, \'multiverseid\': 496468}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino Tetro\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino Tetro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino Tetro entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed4b5409-84bf-46dc-9808-005485b4e8fc\', \'multiverseId\': 496602}, \'multiverseid\': 496602}, {\'name\': \'陰鬱な僻地\', \'text\': \'陰鬱な僻地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n陰鬱な僻地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e35e2a-bcd5-41e2-a5c3-91ab1f8f7591\', \'multiverseId\': 496736}, \'multiverseid\': 496736}, {\'name\': \'Remanso Funesto\', \'text\': \'Remanso Funesto entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Remanso Funesto entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f76791ab-5c25-4f6d-ab19-09bec4373022\', \'multiverseId\': 496870}, \'multiverseid\': 496870}, {\'name\': \'Мрачная Заводь\', \'text\': \'Мрачная Заводь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Мрачная Заводь выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212d76e2-5077-475d-aff8-0f91dbe3c6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 497004}, \'multiverseid\': 497004}, {\'name\': \'阴沉死水\', \'text\': \'阴沉死水须横置进战场。\\n当阴沉死水进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdccf334-72a6-4b05-8701-3f44d198c006\', \'multiverseId\': 497138}, \'multiverseid\': 497138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tritonier-Küstenschleicher\', \'text\': \'Der Tritonier-Küstenschleicher kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer soll dich schon vermissen, Trockenläufer? Deine Frau? Dein Kind? Vielleicht denken sie, die See hätte dich verschlungen, und werden ihren Nachkommen einschärfen, sich von ihr fernzuhalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496110&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96361d5-12b4-4510-99b5-84de9eb456fb\', \'multiverseId\': 496110}, \'multiverseid\': 496110}, {\'name\': \'Vigilacostas tritónido\', \'text\': \'El Vigilacostas tritónido no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Quién te añorará, pisatierra? ¿Una esposa? ¿Un hijo? Quizá culpen al mar de tu destino y enseñen a las nuevas generaciones a no acercarse a él".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcee11b1-3ed4-4b6d-ac48-2cb46724c620\', \'multiverseId\': 496244}, \'multiverseid\': 496244}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur des côtes triton\', \'text\': \'Le Pisteur des côtes triton ne peut pas être bloqué.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Et à qui manqueras-tu, pied-sec ? Une épouse ? Un enfant ? Peut-être blâmeront-ils la mer pour ta mort, et apprendront-ils aux générations futures à rester à l\'écart des vagues. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496378&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e980ecab-d0bb-4589-8aa9-295258450be8\', \'multiverseId\': 496378}, \'multiverseid\': 496378}, {\'name\': \'Marinide Braccacoste\', \'text\': \'Il Marinide Braccacoste non può essere bloccato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi ti piangerà, piediasciutti? Una moglie? Un figlio? Forse accuseranno il mare della tua fine e insegneranno alle generazioni future a tenersene lontani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9950239-fac1-4a7d-b83b-cf0cc8eff2e5\', \'multiverseId\': 496512}, \'multiverseid\': 496512}, {\'name\': \'トリトンの岸忍び\', \'text\': \'トリトンの岸忍びはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前がいなくなることで悲しむものは誰か、陸歩きよ？お前の妻か？お前の子か？彼らがお前の悲運の原因として海を責め、そして後に続く者たちに海には近づかぬよう教えるようになるやもしれぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169eaf2e-e621-4b16-9f71-8beb832bc73b\', \'multiverseId\': 496646}, \'multiverseid\': 496646}, {\'name\': \'Talassido Vigia-costa\', \'text\': \'Talassido Vigia-costa não pode ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Quem vai sentir sua falta, pé-seco? Uma esposa? Um filho? Talvez eles culpem o mar pelo seu destino e ensinem as futuras gerações a ficarem longe dele."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9d872c-850f-436e-a4ae-57d92484a801\', \'multiverseId\': 496780}, \'multiverseid\': 496780}, {\'name\': \'Тритон, Береговой Охотник\', \'text\': \'Тритон, Береговой Охотник не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Кто будет по тебе скучать, сухопутный? Жена? Ребенок? Быть может, они будут винить море в том, что случилось с тобой, и научат своих потомков держаться от него подальше».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e5ef54-aa44-4e49-9a62-ae6aa3df6c92\', \'multiverseId\': 496914}, \'multiverseid\': 496914}, {\'name\': \'岸袭屈东\', \'text\': \'岸袭屈东不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「地上人，谁会思念你？妻子？孩子？或许他们会将你的命运归咎于大海，教导后世子孙远离它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3edcedf6-99b2-495b-9ebb-3d67dbcd1146\', \'multiverseId\': 497048}, \'multiverseid\': 497048}]', "[{'name': 'Tückisches Gelände', 'text': 'Das Tückische Gelände fügt jedem Gegner so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie er Länder kontrolliert.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496177&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dd7a4cf-d5c0-4e43-bef1-9c6c00ea0b15', 'multiverseId': 496177}, 'multiverseid': 496177}, {'name': 'Terreno traicionero', 'text': 'El Terreno traicionero hace una cantidad de daño a cada oponente igual a la cantidad de tierras que controla ese jugador.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496311&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '997bb091-fc7f-4e4c-9d0a-6c07009390da', 'multiverseId': 496311}, 'multiverseid': 496311}, {'name': 'Terrain traître', 'text': 'Le Terrain traître inflige à chaque adversaire un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de terrains que ce joueur contrôle.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496445&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1a411ae-eefb-45ad-8983-a1c0e49f95ff', 'multiverseId': 496445}, 'multiverseid': 496445}, {'name': 'Terreno Infido', 'text': 'Il Terreno Infido infligge a ogni avversario danno pari al numero di terre controllate da quel giocatore.\\nCicloterra base {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496579&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c74f2fdb-9512-4fa5-83b0-69d3ffec8fc0', 'multiverseId': 496579}, 'multiverseid': 496579}, {'name': '危険な地形', 'text': '危険な地形は各対戦相手にそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている土地の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496713&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62852827-821c-4eca-9c1e-c1fec332f539', 'multiverseId': 496713}, 'multiverseid': 496713}, {'name': 'Terreno Traiçoeiro', 'text': 'Terreno Traiçoeiro causa a cada oponente dano igual ao número de terrenos que aquele jogador controla.\\nReciclar terreno básico {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496847&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b117e19b-3d2f-46c8-919e-bd42e51dcd4f', 'multiverseId': 496847}, 'multiverseid': 496847}, {'name': 'Ненадежная Земля', 'text': 'Ненадежная Земля наносит каждому оппоненту повреждения, равные количеству земель под контролем того игрока.\\nЦикл базовых земель {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496981&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b151823f-9b3a-401c-a272-209bd79394e8', 'multiverseId': 496981}, 'multiverseid': 496981}, {'name': '大地变节', 'text': '大地变节向每位对手各造成伤害，其数量等同于由该牌手操控的地数量。\\n循环基本地{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497115&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcbf8398-e6d5-47c6-8343-e013a4ad64a4', 'multiverseId': 497115}, 'multiverseid': 497115}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unsichtbarer Schleicher\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nDer Unsichtbare Schleicher kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Einzige, was mir Sorgen macht, sind der gute Geruchssinn der Vampire und diese eiskalten Nächte in Nefalen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52040d1d-fe6b-404d-ad46-e637a404c7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 496099}, \'multiverseid\': 496099}, {\'name\': \'Acechador invisible\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\nEl Acechador invisible no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo lo que me preocupa es el sentido del olfato de los vampiros y esas heladas noches de Nephalia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020dd752-2520-4685-92cb-1e42cc9c4667\', \'multiverseId\': 496233}, \'multiverseid\': 496233}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur invisible\', \'text\': \'Défense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nLe Pisteur invisible ne peut pas être bloqué.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui m\'inquiète, c\'est le sens de l\'odorat des vampires et ces nuits néphaliennes glaciales. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496367&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7748f2ec-260c-436b-a53c-06a14101786f\', \'multiverseId\': 496367}, \'multiverseid\': 496367}, {\'name\': \'Pedinatore Invisibile\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\nIl Pedinatore Invisibile non può essere bloccato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'unica cosa che mi preoccupa è l\\\'olfatto dei vampiri e le gelide notti di Nephalia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d391b4a-caf1-4cb1-aaa5-81cc80205ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 496501}, \'multiverseid\': 496501}, {\'name\': \'不可視の忍び寄り\', \'text\': \'呪禁（このクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n不可視の忍び寄りはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「心配なのは、吸血鬼の嗅覚と、凍えるようなネファリアの夜だな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4480b941-cbff-4313-862c-84b7c882294b\', \'multiverseId\': 496635}, \'multiverseid\': 496635}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador Invisível\', \'text\': \'Resistência a magia (Esta criatura não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\\nEspreitador Invisível não pode ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Minhas únicas preocupações são o olfato apurado dos vampiros e as noites congelantes de Nefália."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5de32f2-4237-4a68-8ce9-e0d47eac4ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 496769}, \'multiverseid\': 496769}, {\'name\': \'Невидимый Преследователь\', \'text\': \'Порчеустойчивость (Это существо не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\\nНевидимый Преследователь не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Все, что меня волнует, это отличный нюх вампиров и морозные нефальские ночи».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850e6b13-5992-46a0-ab46-eb098723aacf\', \'multiverseId\': 496903}, \'multiverseid\': 496903}, {\'name\': \'无形伏击客\', \'text\': \'辟邪（此生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n无形伏击客不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我只担心吸血鬼的嗅觉与冷死人的涅非利亚夜晚。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a06de53b-19bf-4452-acd6-3031e9fe049b\', \'multiverseId\': 497037}, \'multiverseid\': 497037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verdammen\', \'text\': \'Lege eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es besteht kein Zweifel, dass die Schiedsmänner dich einsperren würden, nachdem alle Dokumente unterzeichnet sind. Aber mir geht es um Gerechtigkeit, und zwar jetzt!"\\n—Alovnek, Boros-Gildenmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79dac09-8fb2-4268-9da9-c46916922f59\', \'multiverseId\': 496084}, \'multiverseid\': 496084}, {\'name\': \'Condenar\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura atacante objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su resistencia.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sin duda los árbitros te encerrarían, después de que se firmasen todos los documentos. Pero yo tendré justicia ahora".\\n—Alóvnek, mago del gremio boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730433fc-bd0a-4ced-bbfd-f4bfddeb5fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 496218}, \'multiverseid\': 496218}, {\'name\': \'Condamnation\', \'text\': \'Mettez une créature attaquante ciblée au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à son endurance.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Arbitres vous mettront sûrement en prison une fois que tous les documents seront signés. Mais je veux que justice soit faite sur le champ. »\\n—Alovnek, ghildmage de Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2f5989-58c1-459b-b292-ded186764d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 496352}, \'multiverseid\': 496352}, {\'name\': \'Condannare\', \'text\': \'Metti una creatura attaccante bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua costituzione.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho dubbi che i giudici ti rinchiuderebbero, una volta firmati tutti i documenti. Ma io otterrò giustizia adesso!"\\n—Alovnek, mago della gilda Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50c808d-4bbb-43e2-8257-72fc658837d1\', \'multiverseId\': 496486}, \'multiverseid\': 496486}, {\'name\': \'糾弾\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。それのコントローラーは、それのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「判事どもなら、全部の書類に署名して、それから判決といくんだろう。だが、俺が裁きを下すのは今だ！」\\n――ボロスのギルド魔道士、アラヴネク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e16278-91ed-4900-b8fb-d07b73464dde\', \'multiverseId\': 496620}, \'multiverseid\': 496620}, {\'name\': \'Condenar\', \'text\': \'Coloque a criatura atacante alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono. Seu controlador ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à resistência dela.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Sem dúvida os árbitros darão um fim a você, depois que todos os documentos forem assinados. Mas eu terei justiça agora."\\n— Alovnek, mago da guilda Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303fe062-df5c-4fed-9bbd-43afde20bba7\', \'multiverseId\': 496754}, \'multiverseid\': 496754}, {\'name\': \'Осуждение\', \'text\': \'Положите целевое атакующее существо в низ библиотеки его владельца. Контролирующий его игрок получает количество жизней, равное его выносливости.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Разумеется, верховные судьи засадили бы тебя после подписания всех документов. Но я добьюсь правосудия сейчас».\\n— Аловнек, маг гильдии Боросов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3578cf04-5847-42ae-9f9d-11041f0872ff\', \'multiverseId\': 496888}, \'multiverseid\': 496888}, {\'name\': \'判罪\', \'text\': \'将目标进行攻击的生物置于其拥有者的牌库底。其操控者获得等同于其防御力的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「既然需签署的文件一无遗漏，仲裁者当然会放过你。但我现在就要主持正义！」\\n～波洛斯公会法师阿劳涅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2125b928-171e-4644-b729-725e0337912f\', \'multiverseId\': 497022}, \'multiverseid\': 497022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheertes Waldland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, opfere das Verheerte Waldland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3cdcfc-5a6e-41c9-8db3-781bc47eea69\', \'multiverseId\': 496193}, \'multiverseid\': 496193}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrificar la Arboleda corrompida: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae95bbe-43e4-4ed3-8cfd-0010b29de9d7\', \'multiverseId\': 496327}, \'multiverseid\': 496327}, {\'name\': \'Sylves gangrenées\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sylves gangrenées : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6864472f-80a5-4c2a-a3d4-55774ea3638e\', \'multiverseId\': 496461}, \'multiverseid\': 496461}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Boscaglia Morente: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9b7e07c-eeec-4e58-84bc-17e450c9befe\', \'multiverseId\': 496595}, \'multiverseid\': 496595}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した森林\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}{G}, {T}, 荒廃した森林を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd4ad13-3306-4f7f-b9cb-93457d488c78\', \'multiverseId\': 496729}, \'multiverseid\': 496729}, {\'name\': \'Floresta Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifique Floresta Flagelada: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd57777-6316-4e2b-8f95-4136e96c7548\', \'multiverseId\': 496863}, \'multiverseid\': 496863}, {\'name\': \'Порченый Лес\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченый Лес: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2523c5-6f21-4efc-8380-4ce8f13ce0db\', \'multiverseId\': 496997}, \'multiverseid\': 496997}, {\'name\': \'枯萎林地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{3}{G}，{T}，牺牲枯萎林地：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f44bce-e3fa-462b-a60f-e6b48d3ae41a\', \'multiverseId\': 497131}, \'multiverseid\': 497131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verkörperung der Einsicht\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLandkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile werden lassen. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496136&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd95e4ba-bb13-4cd0-a847-d0d21932f991\', \'multiverseId\': 496136}, \'multiverseid\': 496136}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia encarnada\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nLas criaturas tierra que controlas tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que la tierra objetivo que controlas se convierta en una criatura Elemental 3/3 con la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bb5eef-9540-4a2f-8626-e7e6c39c22b0\', \'multiverseId\': 496270}, \'multiverseid\': 496270}, {\'name\': \'Incarnation de la perspicacité\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nLes créatures-terrains que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire qu\'un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez devienne une créature 3/3 Élémental avec la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c32bf1d2-286d-4237-99c2-80a5fa9b883c\', \'multiverseId\': 496404}, \'multiverseid\': 496404}, {\'name\': \'Incarnazione della Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nLe creature terra che controlli hanno cautela.\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far diventare una terra bersaglio che controlli una creatura Elementale 3/3 con rapidità fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3e264e-4f8d-499c-a54a-a48d387c928f\', \'multiverseId\': 496538}, \'multiverseid\': 496538}, {\'name\': \'洞察の具象化\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたがコントロールしている土地・クリーチャーは警戒を持つ。\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を持つ３/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce4a07b-d1da-4b77-8e70-030f022bbcce\', \'multiverseId\': 496672}, \'multiverseid\': 496672}, {\'name\': \'Encarnação do Discernimento\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nAs criaturas terreno que você controla têm vigilância.\\nAterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode fazer com que o terreno alvo que você controla se torne uma criatura 3/3 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ccb8c2-a4b7-43da-8ef3-b59569bb8d85\', \'multiverseId\': 496806}, \'multiverseid\': 496806}, {\'name\': \'Воплощение Проницательности\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nЗемли существа под вашим контролем имеют Бдительность.\\nЗемлепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить целевую землю под вашим контролем стать существом 3/3 Элементаль с Ускорением до конца хода. При этом она остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bbcd76-a562-4f02-9b1c-a95797ffe105\', \'multiverseId\': 496940}, \'multiverseid\': 496940}, {\'name\': \'洞察具象\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n由你操控的地生物具有警戒异能。\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以使目标由你操控的地成为3/3，具敏捷异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'842aa976-5046-4514-940d-7d01b4da9ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 497074}, \'multiverseid\': 497074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschlungene Pfade\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland- und/oder Tor-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die kürzeste Strecke zwischen zwei Punkten ist nicht immer die sicherste."\\n—Tamina, Distriktführerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496134&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71061f4a-ea10-49f4-9449-81e06c4c2d04\', \'multiverseId\': 496134}, \'multiverseid\': 496134}, {\'name\': \'Circuito laberíntico\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica y/o de Portal, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El camino más corto entre dos puntos no siempre es el más seguro".\\n—Tamina, guía del distrito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78185c80-ceaf-46ee-ba14-cff960d09f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 496268}, \'multiverseid\': 496268}, {\'name\': \'Chemin sinueux\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base et/ou de porte, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le chemin le plus court entre deux points n\'est pas toujours le plus sûr. »\\n—Tamina, guide de circonscription", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496402&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75da7eba-192e-4ff4-bdc5-1e65bd33412e\', \'multiverseId\': 496402}, \'multiverseid\': 496402}, {\'name\': \'Itinerario Tortuoso\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base e/o carte Cancello, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il percorso più breve non è sempre il più sicuro."\\n—Tamina, guida del distretto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e81ff4a-d814-400d-a110-2dd10cc3ae2f\', \'multiverseId\': 496536}, \'multiverseid\': 496536}, {\'name\': \'迂回路\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地や門であるカード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「二点を繋ぐ最短の道が必ずしも安全であるとは限りません。」\\n――管区の案内人、タミーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c19c83-516a-4f09-a7c0-390a3d120215\', \'multiverseId\': 496670}, \'multiverseid\': 496670}, {\'name\': \'Rota do Circuito\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico e/ou Portão em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O caminho mais curto entre dois pontos nem sempre é o mais seguro."\\n— Tamina, guia do distrito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0686a1fd-8445-439a-bf1f-14c95bd89045\', \'multiverseId\': 496804}, \'multiverseid\': 496804}, {\'name\': \'Кружный Путь\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель и/или Врат, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Самый короткий путь между двумя точками — не всегда самый безопасный».\\n— Тамина, районная проводница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7464d430-f5cb-4900-b4dd-5cba723849d1\', \'multiverseId\': 496938}, \'multiverseid\': 496938}, {\'name\': \'迂回路线\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌和／或门牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「两点之间最近的路线并不总是最安全的。」\\n～城区向导塔米娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9b094c-4402-48f2-987b-8345beaae93d\', \'multiverseId\': 497072}, \'multiverseid\': 497072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzehrende Scheußlichkeit\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft der Verzehrenden Scheußlichkeit sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten in den Friedhöfen deiner Gegner.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, deckt jeder Gegner Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Länderkarte aufdeckt, dann legt er alle auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496161&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72eb0586-4e17-4d99-bd56-253ce087f918\', \'multiverseId\': 496161}, \'multiverseid\': 496161}, {\'name\': \'Aberración consumidora\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de la Aberración consumidora son iguales a la cantidad de cartas que haya en los cementerios de tus oponentes.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo, cada oponente muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de tierra, luego pone esas cartas en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c9628a-1156-4e1e-81b3-bd0297459946\', \'multiverseId\': 496295}, \'multiverseid\': 496295}, {\'name\': \'Aberration dévorante\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance de l\'Aberration dévorante sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans les cimetières de vos adversaires.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, chaque adversaire révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de terrain, puis il met ces cartes dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac877c7c-db42-4b4e-9479-c85213de5d77\', \'multiverseId\': 496429}, \'multiverseid\': 496429}, {\'name\': \'Aberrazione Distruttiva\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione dell\'Aberrazione Distruttiva sono pari al numero di carte nei cimiteri dei tuoi avversari.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia, ogni avversario rivela carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio finché non rivela una carta terra, poi mette quelle carte nel proprio cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0991d0c6-915a-4880-9f07-33808a97e8cc\', \'multiverseId\': 496563}, \'multiverseid\': 496563}, {\'name\': \'破壊的な逸脱者\', \'text\': \'破壊的な逸脱者のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれすべての対戦相手の墓地にあるカードの総数に等しい。\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、土地・カードが公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開し、その後それらのカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c137740c-e84d-4a9d-8367-4548be62dfb5\', \'multiverseId\': 496697}, \'multiverseid\': 496697}, {\'name\': \'Aberração Consumidora\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Aberração Consumidora são ambos iguais ao número de cards nos cemitérios de seus oponentes.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica, cada oponente revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de terreno. Depois, ele coloca aqueles cards no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8619ef-a134-4aa6-8726-2e0432400a37\', \'multiverseId\': 496831}, \'multiverseid\': 496831}, {\'name\': \'Всепоглощающая Тварь\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Всепоглощающей Твари равны количеству карт на кладбищах ваших оппонентов.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, каждый оппонент показывает карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажет карту земли, затем кладет те карты на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4274c849-78ea-490f-85ef-a55ee31123e6\', \'multiverseId\': 496965}, \'multiverseid\': 496965}, {\'name\': \'吞噬畸变体\', \'text\': \'吞噬畸变体的力量和防御力各等同于所有对手坟墓场中牌的总数量。\\n每当你施放咒语时，每位对手各从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止，然后将这些牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c830d942-d082-42d2-81c5-52fa1785ad8e\', \'multiverseId\': 497099}, \'multiverseid\': 497099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Von den Toten auferstehen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Die Kreatur ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Tod ist kein Grund für Ungehorsam."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b442b46-768d-407c-8c2c-ea448da9a377\', \'multiverseId\': 496125}, \'multiverseid\': 496125}, {\'name\': \'Levantarse de la tumba\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Esa criatura es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte no es una excusa para desobedecer".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5864dc7-2e6f-48a9-9b1d-86b1a9e3616b\', \'multiverseId\': 496259}, \'multiverseid\': 496259}, {\'name\': \'Reviviscence\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière. Cette créature est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La mort n\'excuse pas la désobéissance. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496393&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1be671d-8f99-4559-894d-ed6761279f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 496393}, \'multiverseid\': 496393}, {\'name\': \'Risuscitare\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Quella creatura è uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La morte non è una scusa per disobbedire."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50491a69-32ab-40b5-bf70-82995dfba64e\', \'multiverseId\': 496527}, \'multiverseid\': 496527}, {\'name\': \'墓場からの復活\', \'text\': \'墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それは、それの他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「死んでるから従わなくていいってことはないね。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f66e425-c60c-41d5-b577-5dd3304b9852\', \'multiverseId\': 496661}, \'multiverseid\': 496661}, {\'name\': \'Ressurgir da Cova\', \'text\': \'Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Aquela criatura é um Zumbi preto além de suas outras cores e tipos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A morte não é desculpa para a desobediência."\\n— Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a62bda-4366-40d9-8d2e-4a57d0dae188\', \'multiverseId\': 496795}, \'multiverseid\': 496795}, {\'name\': \'Восстать из Могилы\', \'text\': \'Положите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем. То существо является черным Зомби в дополнение к своим другим цветам и типам.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Смерть не оправдывает неповиновение».\\n— Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df255c00-0bd3-4c98-afab-cc33e618bb34\', \'multiverseId\': 496929}, \'multiverseid\': 496929}, {\'name\': \'坟场复生\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。该生物额外具有黑色此颜色与灵俑此类别。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡不是抗命的藉口。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23279c38-2fef-4ad5-97c1-9b55c377ce1e\', \'multiverseId\': 497063}, \'multiverseid\': 497063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiser Evolutionskundler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Kultiviere die Welt, um für dich selbst zu sorgen. Kultiviere dich selbst, um für die Welt zu sorgen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b470df-c8a7-4f3c-a28d-e42bf45068db\', \'multiverseId\': 496137}, \'multiverseid\': 496137}, {\'name\': \'Sabio de la evolución\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuidar de ti, cultiva el mundo. Para cuidar del mundo, cultívate a ti mismo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b08727f2-a285-4985-bdfb-5ca9aa0632a2\', \'multiverseId\': 496271}, \'multiverseid\': 496271}, {\'name\': "Sage de l\'évolution", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour prendre soin de toi, cultive le monde. Pour prendre soin du monde, cultive-toi. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6960880-99f3-4fdc-8a96-baf8d20a4b45\', \'multiverseId\': 496405}, \'multiverseid\': 496405}, {\'name\': "Saggio dell\'Evoluzione", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per prenderti cura di te, coltiva il mondo. Per prenderti cura del mondo, coltiva te stesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022fd0cf-8fb3-40ec-87bb-6321c857f4c9\', \'multiverseId\': 496539}, \'multiverseid\': 496539}, {\'name\': \'進化の賢者\', \'text\': \'土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「自分が大切なら、世界を育むことだ。世界が大切なら、自分を育むことだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7601d3a8-2ab2-4dbb-b9d7-e954a3ac3b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 496673}, \'multiverseid\': 496673}, {\'name\': \'Sábio da Evolução\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuidar de si, cultive o mundo. Para cuidar do mundo, cultive-se."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca01807-0114-4913-941f-316fd8f606fe\', \'multiverseId\': 496807}, \'multiverseid\': 496807}, {\'name\': \'Мудрец Эволюции\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, используйте Распространение. (Выберите любое количество перманентов и/или игроков, затем дайте каждому из них еще по одному жетону тех типов, которые у него уже имеются.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтобы заботиться о себе, возделывай мир. Чтобы заботиться о мире, возделывай себя».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e1870a-bfeb-42d2-b697-2f7e2c48eaef\', \'multiverseId\': 496941}, \'multiverseid\': 496941}, {\'name\': \'演化智者\', \'text\': \'每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「关怀自己，栽培世界。关怀世界，栽培自己。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc64ead-951b-4c42-82a3-f9b7abaf4d12\', \'multiverseId\': 497075}, \'multiverseid\': 497075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weiser aus dem Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Weise aus dem Yavimaya stirbt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\n{2}, opfere den Weisen aus dem Yavimaya: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496159&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a88a7042-8416-4f93-8b65-eb6fdf395d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 496159}, \'multiverseid\': 496159}, {\'name\': \'Anciano de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Anciano de Yavimaya muera, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, mostrarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\n{2}, sacrificar el Anciano de Yavimaya: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf5a5d6-edf0-4450-af87-cd9d3a6d7220\', \'multiverseId\': 496293}, \'multiverseid\': 496293}, {\'name\': \'Vieux sage de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Quand le Vieux sage de la Yavimaya meurt, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main et mélanger votre bibliothèque.\\n{2}, sacrifiez le Vieux sage de la Yavimaya : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ec51b2-9a8c-48e3-a2d5-6b176047f730\', \'multiverseId\': 496427}, \'multiverseid\': 496427}, {\'name\': \'Anziano di Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Anziano di Yavimaya muore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelarle, aggiungerle alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\n{2}, Sacrifica l\'Anziano di Yavimaya: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87ba03d-1749-4ec3-914b-b7b40e7068eb\', \'multiverseId\': 496561}, \'multiverseid\': 496561}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの古老\', \'text\': \'ヤヴィマヤの古老が死亡したとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n{2}, ヤヴィマヤの古老を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9348fb33-f948-4bdf-aeb3-36f62ee25c63\', \'multiverseId\': 496695}, \'multiverseid\': 496695}, {\'name\': \'Ancião de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Quando Ancião de Yavimaya morre, você pode procurar até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-los, colocá-los em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\n{2}, sacrifique Ancião de Yavimaya: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4135e799-19b0-4bc1-be9f-6a875c938328\', \'multiverseId\': 496829}, \'multiverseid\': 496829}, {\'name\': \'Явимайский Старейшина\', \'text\': \'Когда Явимайский Старейшина умирает, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, показать их, положить их в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\n{2}, пожертвуйте Явимайского Старейшину: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbd350f-8d96-498f-967d-fc4d3007f7ec\', \'multiverseId\': 496963}, \'multiverseid\': 496963}, {\'name\': \'亚维马雅长者\', \'text\': \'当亚维马雅长者死去时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n{2}，牺牲亚维马雅长者：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a7e4c87-886b-4606-ba83-9359a976c9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 497097}, \'multiverseid\': 497097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weite Wanderungen\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\nGrenzwert — Falls sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, durchsuche deine Bibliothek stattdessen nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49ae074-4cd8-40d2-8eb8-51e5fce7b419\', \'multiverseId\': 496138}, \'multiverseid\': 496138}, {\'name\': \'Andanzas lejanas\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nUmbral — Si hay siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, en vez de eso, busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16eee1e-9462-4ac9-8ed5-b53cdb50cf8b\', \'multiverseId\': 496272}, \'multiverseid\': 496272}, {\'name\': \'Errances lointaines\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nSeuil — Si vous avez au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, à la place cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38903b89-548c-4e96-991d-5291bd2383b6\', \'multiverseId\': 496406}, \'multiverseid\': 496406}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondaggi Lontani\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nSoglia — Se ci sono sette o più carte nel tuo cimitero, invece passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3e025c-9894-4a40-968f-4f372cfd4e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 496540}, \'multiverseid\': 496540}, {\'name\': \'はるかなる放浪\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nスレッショルド ― あなたの墓地にカードが７枚以上あるなら、代わりに、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大３枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7295a10-aaec-4b36-a29f-fea69c900b72\', \'multiverseId\': 496674}, \'multiverseid\': 496674}, {\'name\': \'Viagem Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\\nLimiar — Se houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério, em vez disso, procure em seu grimório até três cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b86538c-52a8-4d5b-a2a3-b8d7cd79f1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 496808}, \'multiverseid\': 496808}, {\'name\': \'Далекое Путешествие\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\\nПорог — Если у вас на кладбище есть семь или больше карт, вместо этого найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6701259d-6f0d-4779-8bce-a064c79afd5a\', \'multiverseId\': 496942}, \'multiverseid\': 496942}, {\'name\': \'远地遨游\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n门槛～如果你的坟墓场中有七张或更多牌，则改为从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd19f83-6201-49c0-8c2e-dec12ac16295\', \'multiverseId\': 497076}, \'multiverseid\': 497076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weltenaufstand\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Länder sind.\\nErwecken 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für {5}{W}{W}{W} wirkst, lege außerdem vier +1/+1-Marken auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Es wird zu einer 0/0 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a29dd3-78c8-4288-bc14-5c91e473bd68\', \'multiverseId\': 496091}, \'multiverseid\': 496091}, {\'name\': \'Estallido planar\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean tierra.\\nDespertar 4—{5}{W}{W}{W}. (Si lanzas este hechizo por {5}{W}{W}{W}, pon además cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la tierra objetivo que controlas y esta se convierte en una criatura Elemental 0/0 con la habilidad de prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra).\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d3eabd-d65f-4026-b15e-4c87811c45c7\', \'multiverseId\': 496225}, \'multiverseid\': 496225}, {\'name\': \'Surgissement planaire\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures non-terrain.\\nÉveil 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour {5}{W}{W}{W}, mettez aussi quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur un terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez et il devient une créature 0/0 Élémental avec la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf1ffd0-925c-46f2-896d-56d4cd75f4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 496359}, \'multiverseid\': 496359}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Planare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature non terra.\\nRisveglio 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} (Se lanci questa magia per {5}{W}{W}{W}, metti anche quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una terra bersaglio che controlli ed essa diventa una creatura Elementale 0/0 con rapidità. È ancora una terra.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ed3b30-53e7-46fd-ad62-e401eb4e5e29\', \'multiverseId\': 496493}, \'multiverseid\': 496493}, {\'name\': \'次元の激高\', \'text\': \'土地でないクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\\n覚醒４―{5}{W}{W}{W}（この呪文を{5}{W}{W}{W}で唱えたなら、加えて、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つを対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを４個置く。それは速攻を持つ０/０のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5120fcb-d3fe-4d93-89bb-6e41fc92f67d\', \'multiverseId\': 496627}, \'multiverseid\': 496627}, {\'name\': \'Irrupção Planar\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que não sejam terrenos.\\nDespertar 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Se você conjurar esta mágica por {5}{W}{W}{W}, coloque também quatro marcadores +1/+1 no terreno alvo que você controla e ele se tornará uma criatura 0/0 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Ela ainda é um terreno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4668ec9e-0e7d-468d-a04e-f7a1591632c3\', \'multiverseId\': 496761}, \'multiverseid\': 496761}, {\'name\': \'Извержение Мира\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все не являющиеся землями существа.\\nПробуждение 4 — {5}{W}{W}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за {5}{W}{W}{W}, также положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевую землю под вашим контролем, и она становится существом 0/0 Элементаль с Ускорением. При этом она остается землей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe0748c-b6c8-411e-8f62-dd36d39b03e2\', \'multiverseId\': 496895}, \'multiverseid\': 496895}, {\'name\': \'时空爆发\', \'text\': \'消灭所有非地生物。\\n醒转4～{5}{W}{W}{W}（如果你支付{5}{W}{W}{W}来施放此咒语，则再在目标由你操控的地上放置四个+1/+1指示物，且它成为0/0，具敏捷异能的元素生物。它仍然是地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc82a764-0462-4e2e-be76-d646ac70660f\', \'multiverseId\': 497029}, \'multiverseid\': 497029}]', "[{'name': 'Wirbler-Räuberin', 'text': 'Wenn die Wirbler-Räuberin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496111&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37d42f74-554a-4773-94cc-5c5d9da6ad2d', 'multiverseId': 496111}, 'multiverseid': 496111}, {'name': 'Bribona de los zumbones', 'text': 'Cuando la Bribona de los zumbones entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nGirar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice bribón humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496245&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1da01995-47f8-483b-acf8-89d5bf2b36cd', 'multiverseId': 496245}, 'multiverseid': 496245}, {'name': 'Gredine à voltigeurs', 'text': 'Quand la Gredine à voltigeurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et gredin et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496379&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c5479a5-afea-48bb-88a8-ee5e29f4353a', 'multiverseId': 496379}, 'multiverseid': 496379}, {'name': 'Canaglia dei Turbinanti', 'text': 'Quando la Canaglia dei Turbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496513&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e5037fe-593e-487c-b073-a5bf388aec1a', 'multiverseId': 496513}, 'multiverseid': 496513}, {'name': 'つむじ風のならず者', 'text': 'つむじ風のならず者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のアーティファクト２つをタップする：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496647&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1de11345-1240-4235-8b36-d3e0eb23fda1', 'multiverseId': 496647}, 'multiverseid': 496647}, {'name': 'Ladra dos Turbilinos', 'text': 'Quando Ladra dos Turbilinos entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\nVire dois artefatos desvirados que você controla: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ladino Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496781&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7867a41c-2d2f-4b2d-9dc1-0940f4a39660', 'multiverseId': 496781}, 'multiverseid': 496781}, {'name': 'Разбойница с Махолетами', 'text': 'Когда Разбойница с Махолетами выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\\nПоверните два неповернутых артефакта под вашим контролем: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Бродяга Механик', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496915&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4c54631-4034-4806-9e2c-e7f7cbea59e4', 'multiverseId': 496915}, 'multiverseid': 496915}, {'name': '旋翼浪客', 'text': '当旋翼浪客进战场时，派出两个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\\n横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／浪客／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497049&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '687b06e8-1073-4bed-bdc7-37695288add2', 'multiverseId': 497049}, 'multiverseid': 497049}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wundersame Ankunft\', \'text\': \'X Kreaturen deiner Wahl können in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden. Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten jene Kreaturen „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Was die Wächter auf einer Welt, die von Nicol Bolas beherrscht wird, am wenigsten erwartet hatten, war Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c78be6e-fb2e-4b8b-a052-febab5666d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 496106}, \'multiverseid\': 496106}, {\'name\': \'Llegada a la majestuosidad\', \'text\': \'X criaturas objetivo no pueden ser bloqueadas este turno. Hasta el final del turno, esas criaturas ganan "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Si había algo que los Guardianes no esperaban encontrar en un plano gobernado por Nicol Bolas, era perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8119493d-e337-40e5-b403-7ec2ce31d35d\', \'multiverseId\': 496240}, \'multiverseid\': 496240}, {\'name\': \'Accès aux merveilles\', \'text\': "X créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas être bloquées ce tour-ci. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, ces créatures gagnent « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "S\'il y a une chose que les Sentinelles ne pensaient pas trouver sur un plan dirigé par Nicol Bolas, c\'était bien la perfection.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96bf33aa-da99-4da1-83c1-e18323a078da\', \'multiverseId\': 496374}, \'multiverseid\': 496374}, {\'name\': \'Varco nella Meraviglia\', \'text\': \'X creature bersaglio non possono essere bloccate in questo turno. Fino alla fine del turno, quelle creature hanno "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta".\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'ultima cosa che i Guardiani si aspettavano di trovare su un piano governato da Nicol Bolas era la perfezione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a67f4ad-2e1c-492a-94bc-5f2b10242235\', \'multiverseId\': 496508}, \'multiverseid\': 496508}, {\'name\': \'驚異への入り口\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーＸ体を対象とする。このターン、それらはブロックされない。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引く。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゲートウォッチがニコル・ボーラスに支配された次元で唯一予期していなかったのは完璧ということだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f865025c-4846-40ef-a92a-cb340ba6faed\', \'multiverseId\': 496642}, \'multiverseid\': 496642}, {\'name\': \'Passagem para a Maravilha\', \'text\': \'X criaturas alvo não podem ser bloqueadas neste turno. Até o final do turno, aquelas criaturas ganham "Toda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card".\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A única coisa que as Sentinelas não esperavam encontrar em um plano governado por Nicol Bolas era perfeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066615f6-71e8-4f9c-84b1-8033519a9845\', \'multiverseId\': 496776}, \'multiverseid\': 496776}, {\'name\': \'Дорога к Чудесам\', \'text\': \'X целевых существ не могут быть заблокированы в этом ходу. До конца хода те существа получают способность «Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, возьмите карту».\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В мире, которым правил Никол Болас, Стражи не ожидали встретить только одного — совершенства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c12bc30-406e-4b5c-8c81-b51ef2474b78\', \'multiverseId\': 496910}, \'multiverseid\': 496910}, {\'name\': \'通往奇境\', \'text\': \'X个目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。直到回合结束，这些生物获得「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在这个由尼可波拉斯统治的时空中，守护者们未曾料想会出现完美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2493bce-6d2f-4aa0-b5e2-c85b3442dabf\', \'multiverseId\': 497044}, \'multiverseid\': 497044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zendikars Turbulenz\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich lag falsch. Zendikar ist nicht gegen mich. Es ist gegen niemanden von uns. Es ist nicht böse oder rachsüchtig. Es ist großartig … aber es hat große Schmerzen."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66b88e4-8365-4ca5-8954-6a9057a57b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 496160}, \'multiverseid\': 496160}, {\'name\': \'La Turbulencia de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Estaba equivocada. Zendikar no me persigue. No persigue a ninguno de nosotros. No es maligno ni vengativo. Es magnífico... pero sufre".\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737feb93-e73a-4056-9aa7-4881b44c169f\', \'multiverseId\': 496294}, \'multiverseid\': 496294}, {\'name\': \'Roulis de Zendikar\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Élémental.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« J\'avais tort. Zendikar ne m\'en veut pas... ni à personne d\'ailleurs. Le plan n\'est ni maléfique ni vengeur. Il est magnifique... mais il souffre. »\\n—Nissa Revane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c293a2ef-eb51-4f5e-bf1d-08f488c288ce\', \'multiverseId\': 496428}, \'multiverseid\': 496428}, {\'name\': \'Torbido di Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 2/2 verde.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi sbagliavo. Zendikar non ce l\\\'ha con me. Non ce l\\\'ha con nessuno di noi. Non è malvagio o vendicativo. È magnifico... ma sta soffrendo."\\n—Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146afc4c-372e-4a11-b723-cd30bf1af83a\', \'multiverseId\': 496562}, \'multiverseid\': 496562}, {\'name\': \'ゼンディカーの乱動\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の２/２のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私が間違っていた。ゼンディカーは私を追ってなどいない。私たちの誰かを追っているのでもない。それには邪悪も復讐心もなく、ただ、壮大で……苦しんでいるんだわ。」\\n――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50b18cec-1fb2-43bd-9857-24ae06139208\', \'multiverseId\': 496696}, \'multiverseid\': 496696}, {\'name\': \'Turbilhão de Zendikar\', \'text\': \'Aterragem — Toda vez que um terreno entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Elemental.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu estava errada. Zendikar não está me perseguindo. Não está perseguindo nenhum de nós. O plano não é mau nem vingativo. É magnífico... Mas está sofrendo."\\n— Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ea4a64-24cc-48d4-8f91-9ba9d26eae89\', \'multiverseId\': 496830}, \'multiverseid\': 496830}, {\'name\': \'Великий Вал Зендикара\', \'text\': \'Землепад — Каждый раз, когда земля выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Элементаль.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Я ошибалась. Зендикар не держит на меня зла. Он не держит зла ни на кого. Он не жесток и не мстителен. Он великолепен... но он страдает».\\n— Нисса Ревейн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7e10e3-87d1-4a09-a52a-c9578aada1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 496964}, \'multiverseid\': 496964}, {\'name\': \'赞迪卡的狂搅\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个2/2绿色元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我错了。赞迪卡找上的不是我。它根本没找上任何人。它并不邪恶，也不怀怨仇。它壮丽非凡. . .却饱受痛苦。」\\n～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b844885-6e48-451b-99de-fdb6c5c45070\', \'multiverseId\': 497098}, \'multiverseid\': 497098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerstörung der Hehlerware\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Schicke ein Artefakt deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n• Schicke eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Izzet-Magierin wusste, dass sie weder ihren Thermoinverter zurückbekommen noch die Befriedigung verspüren würde, ihn selbst detonieren zu lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c278051-3deb-4537-be24-b7ca828c0cee\', \'multiverseId\': 496085}, \'multiverseid\': 496085}, {\'name\': \'Aplastar contrabando\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Exilia el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Exilia el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La maga ízzet sabía que ni recuperaría el termoinversor, ni tendría la satisfacción de hacerlo explotar ella misma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2778879f-edb3-4129-9879-f9eebde8ecb0\', \'multiverseId\': 496219}, \'multiverseid\': 496219}, {\'name\': \'Écraser la contrebande\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Exilez l\'artefact ciblé.\\n• Exilez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La mage d\'Izzet savait qu\'elle ne récupérerait pas son onduleur thermique et qu\'elle n\'aurait pas non plus la satisfaction de le faire exploser elle-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e2195e-b008-4114-a08b-30a668655122\', \'multiverseId\': 496353}, \'multiverseid\': 496353}, {\'name\': \'Schiacciare il Contrabbando\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Esilia un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Esilia un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La maga Izzet si ritrovò privata sia del suo termoinvertitore, sia della soddisfazione di farlo esplodere personalmente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9884fa9-4205-4504-9d23-5d2b1e6471e0\', \'multiverseId\': 496487}, \'multiverseid\': 496487}, {\'name\': \'禁制品潰し\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの魔道士には、逆熱装置を取り戻すことも、それを爆発させて満足することも、どちらも不可能だと分かった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aadb96d4-3d59-4bb7-88a0-ea39cfe6598b\', \'multiverseId\': 496621}, \'multiverseid\': 496621}, {\'name\': \'Esmagar o Contrabando\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Exile o artefato alvo.\\n• Exile o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A maga Izzet sabia que não recuperaria seu termoinversor nem teria a satisfação de explodi-lo ela mesma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cef046c-1c59-4874-8ae0-2a90f40e3904\', \'multiverseId\': 496755}, \'multiverseid\': 496755}, {\'name\': \'Уничтожение Контрабанды\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Изгоните целевой артефакт.\\n• Изгоните целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Волшебница Иззетов знала, что теперь и термоинвертер назад не получит, и не сможет сама его с удовольствием взорвать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bdc78b-95e0-4f6e-a01c-3bbfbb403bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 496889}, \'multiverseid\': 496889}, {\'name\': \'粉碎禁品\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•放逐目标神器。\\n•放逐目标结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷法师知道这样一来，不仅手中的热能反转器会一去不返，自己也无法享受亲手引爆它的快感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89726468-9298-4d32-9445-dcb76064ed31\', \'multiverseId\': 497023}, \'multiverseid\': 497023}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zugriff des Kodamas\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel und nimm die andere auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Arkan\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land wächst nur dort, wo die Kami es lassen."\\n—Dosan, das fallende Blatt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496145&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb22d6c8-57a5-45a9-aa08-d181b2214713\', \'multiverseId\': 496145}, \'multiverseid\': 496145}, {\'name\': \'Alcance del kodama\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra crece solo donde los kami así lo desean".\\n—Dosan la hoja cayendo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f92f3c3-c4d2-46cd-af11-76fa1cd29dc8\', \'multiverseId\': 496279}, \'multiverseid\': 496279}, {\'name\': \'Portée du kodama\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes et mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée, et l\'autre dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel : arcane\', \'flavor\': \'« La terre se plie uniquement à la volonté des kami. »\\n—Dosan la feuille tombante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ef11355-1f6e-45bf-abec-1ebadea0d367\', \'multiverseId\': 496413}, \'multiverseid\': 496413}, {\'name\': \'Confini del Kodama\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'"La terra cresce solo dove i kami lo vogliono."\\n—Dosan la Foglia Che Cade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc9ceec-56eb-4b88-bc4d-99471cf4fc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 496547}, \'multiverseid\': 496547}, {\'name\': \'木霊の手の内\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、他をあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': \'「地の育つは、神の望む所のみ。」\\n――落葉の道三\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2651af62-bdcb-4b52-a0b4-e7b7430fb54d\', \'multiverseId\': 496681}, \'multiverseid\': 496681}, {\'name\': \'Alcance do Kodama\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Arcana\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra só cresce onde os kamis desejarem."\\n— Dosan, a Folha que Cai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4d95df-bf5e-410e-b91e-0f2f086baf71\', \'multiverseId\': 496815}, \'multiverseid\': 496815}, {\'name\': \'Хватка Кодамы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, покажите те карты и положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а другую — в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Тайные_знания\', \'flavor\': \'«Земля приносит плоды лишь там, где желают этого ками».\\n— Досан, Упавший Лист\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e400220-ed7e-4a3b-a28d-4ce59503e852\', \'multiverseId\': 496949}, \'multiverseid\': 496949}, {\'name\': \'木灵展势\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将一张横置放进战场，另一张则置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术 ～古咒\', \'flavor\': \'「土地只能长出神明允许的东西。」\\n～落叶大师道三\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9011d64-7fea-48c3-b8e0-6f046ddd52d4\', \'multiverseId\': 497083}, \'multiverseid\': 497083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zulaport-Mordgeselle\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Zulaport-Mordgeselle oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Eldrazi? Ha! Versuch mal, nachts mit vollen Taschen durch Zulaport zu laufen. *Das* ist gefährlich!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b7c80a-f263-44e6-b8bc-a8a01566569d\', \'multiverseId\': 496129}, \'multiverseid\': 496129}, {\'name\': \'Degollador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Degollador de Zulaport u otra criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Eldrazi? ¡Ja! Prueba a caminar por Zulaport de noche con los bolsillos llenos. Eso *sí* es peligroso".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'814c2bc6-2aa9-4cad-ac26-0069ebe4be9d\', \'multiverseId\': 496263}, \'multiverseid\': 496263}, {\'name\': \'Surineur de Zulaport\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Surineur de Zulaport ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Les Eldrazi ? Quelle blague ! Essayez donc de traverser Zulaport de nuit avec les poches pleines. *Ça* c\'est dangereux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496397&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c02fc990-62a1-4ae5-a795-12f0793aff54\', \'multiverseId\': 496397}, \'multiverseid\': 496397}, {\'name\': \'Tagliagole di Zulaport\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Tagliagole di Zulaport o un\'altra creatura che controlli muoiono, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Ah! Prova a camminare di notte per Zulaport con le tasche piene. Ecco, *quello* è pericoloso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9beb265-5af8-45a4-99b4-bca47f354bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 496531}, \'multiverseid\': 496531}, {\'name\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋\', \'text\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋や、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージ？どうってことねぇな。ポケット膨らまして夜中のズーラポートを歩いてみな。それが身の危険さ。」**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b1c121-1dad-49b0-b167-fc3e8d63c4df\', \'multiverseId\': 496665}, \'multiverseid\': 496665}, {\'name\': \'Degolador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Degolador de Zulaport ou outra criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Que nada! Tente andar por Zulaport à noite com os bolsos cheios. *Isso sim* é perigoso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6dd24f5-7437-47f1-b66c-686e504ca8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 496799}, \'multiverseid\': 496799}, {\'name\': \'Головорез из Зулапорта\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Головорез из Зулапорта или другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Эльдрази? Ха! Попробуй прогуляться вечером по Зулапорту с полными карманами. Вот это — *настоящая опасность*».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be2d2a62-0436-4aa0-bd2a-6d1e58c78ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 496933}, \'multiverseid\': 496933}, {\'name\': \'筑拉波割喉客\', \'text\': \'每当筑拉波割喉客或另一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「奥札奇？呵呵！不妨腰缠万贯时在夜晚来筑拉波走一遭。*这*才叫危险。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6da7fa6-6bff-419c-81e8-3d2884126b90\', \'multiverseId\': 497067}, \'multiverseid\': 497067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zweischneidiges Erbstück\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, kannst du Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst, die mit ihr einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat. Nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7040510-7181-4672-993c-3402a6438ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 496185}, \'multiverseid\': 496185}, {\'name\': \'Espada familiar\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, puedes mostrar cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'381ef79b-1d70-44f3-a5db-ec966373fb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 496319}, \'multiverseid\': 496319}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'héritage", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, vous pouvez révéler les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature qui partage un type de créature avec elle. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'297e2ed7-a7bf-4d11-955d-c241f441c385\', \'multiverseId\': 496453}, \'multiverseid\': 496453}, {\'name\': \'Cimelio Affilato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, puoi rivelare carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4839684c-67a9-4542-a6dd-4a88c7cf40f2\', \'multiverseId\': 496587}, \'multiverseid\': 496587}, {\'name\': \'先祖伝来の宝刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは「それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996fdbf4-d8cc-4a93-a111-78613b1116dc\', \'multiverseId\': 496721}, \'multiverseid\': 496721}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Herança\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morre, você pode revelar cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb395863-996b-4ed9-94e8-8ab2275301af\', \'multiverseId\': 496855}, \'multiverseid\': 496855}, {\'name\': \'Фамильный Клинок\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо умирает, вы можете показывать карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажете карту существа, у которого есть такой же тип существа, как у него. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e36c7f-9747-44ee-b092-7c9a62934dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 496989}, \'multiverseid\': 496989}, {\'name\': \'家传宝剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，你可以从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张与之具共通生物类别的生物牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170d751a-aa59-4695-9bb2-c843e6393ada\', \'multiverseId\': 497123}, \'multiverseid\': 497123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherisieren\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle angreifenden Kreaturen auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du kannst zurückkommen, sobald du Manieren hast und weißt, wie du deine körperliche Gestalt wiederherstellen kannst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d27babc-e54e-479a-bd22-8cd372518fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 496095}, \'multiverseid\': 496095}, {\'name\': \'Eterizar\', \'text\': \'Regresa todas las criaturas atacantes a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuelve cuando aprendas modales... y hayas averiguado cómo reconstruir tu estructura física".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efdeeac0-662a-40a4-87af-c264258c826c\', \'multiverseId\': 496229}, \'multiverseid\': 496229}, {\'name\': \'Étherisation\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez toutes les créatures attaquantes dans la main de leur propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Revenez quand vous aurez appris les bonnes manières... et trouvé le moyen de reconstituer vos corps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b826e2a-900c-4c83-b3e4-057b798db1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 496363}, \'multiverseid\': 496363}, {\'name\': \'Eterizzare\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare tutte le creature attaccanti in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Torna quando avrai imparato le buone maniere… e a ricostituire la tua forma fisica."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def2115e-87fa-4b86-ab9d-e74f08d4ad27\', \'multiverseId\': 496497}, \'multiverseid\': 496497}, {\'name\': \'霊気化\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャーをすべてオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「少し礼儀というものを学んでから出直すんだな。それに、肉体を再構成する方法も見つけたほうがいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48aa23ec-5b27-417a-97c0-af1a4b87d208\', \'multiverseId\': 496631}, \'multiverseid\': 496631}, {\'name\': \'Eterificar\', \'text\': \'Devolva todas as criaturas atacantes para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Voltem quando tiverem aprendido boas maneiras... e descoberto como reconstituir suas formas físicas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3678a8a0-705a-4e5e-bc8b-67e678fceb6c\', \'multiverseId\': 496765}, \'multiverseid\': 496765}, {\'name\': \'Превращение в Эфир\', \'text\': \'Верните все атакующие существа в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Можете вернуться, когда научитесь себя вести... и когда узнаете, как вернуть себе прежний облик».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c08dba34-743d-4230-ad3d-426e6ca23d25\', \'multiverseId\': 496899}, \'multiverseid\': 496899}, {\'name\': \'乙太化\', \'text\': \'将所有进行攻击的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「等你学会礼貌，想出如何重构你的形体后就可以回来。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a875cbf-80b6-4ced-ac63-7a71140e65ad\', \'multiverseId\': 497033}, \'multiverseid\': 497033}]', "[{'name': 'Ätzender Schleim', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Ätzende Schleim ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schlammwesen', 'flavor': 'Es fürchtet keine Klinge und lässt nicht einmal Knochen zurück.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496131&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58079a0b-7688-4b65-9a10-9263d1dd432d', 'multiverseId': 496131}, 'multiverseid': 496131}, {'name': 'Fango ácido', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Fango ácido entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cieno', 'flavor': 'No teme al acero y no deja ni huesos a su paso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496265&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7912bf8d-7f71-41f6-b50f-539f26c28134', 'multiverseId': 496265}, 'multiverseid': 496265}, {'name': 'Boue acide', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nQuand la Boue acide arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un artefact ciblé, un enchantement ciblé ou un terrain ciblé.', 'type': 'Créature : limon', 'flavor': 'Elle ne craint aucune épée et ne laisse aucun corps derrière elle.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496399&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6da06ff0-134b-4d57-bab7-fbb99e5544c7', 'multiverseId': 496399}, 'multiverseid': 496399}, {'name': 'Melma Acida', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\nQuando la Melma Acida entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Melma', 'flavor': 'Non teme la spada e non lascia traccia alcuna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496533&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a8a3065-9ac9-445c-a5d5-ae4d922f1f70', 'multiverseId': 496533}, 'multiverseid': 496533}, {'name': '酸のスライム', 'text': '接死\\n酸のスライムが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ウーズ', 'flavor': 'それは如何なる刃も恐れず、如何なる骨も残さない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496667&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72639abb-405b-4a54-89eb-75fd782dc6ae', 'multiverseId': 496667}, 'multiverseid': 496667}, {'name': 'Limo Ácido', 'text': 'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Limo Ácido entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lodo', 'flavor': 'Ele não teme nenhuma espada, e não deixa nenhum osso para trás.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496801&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df257738-6721-4af9-9fc2-ee9b7a417072', 'multiverseId': 496801}, 'multiverseid': 496801}, {'name': 'Кислотная Слизь', 'text': 'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Кислотная Слизь выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой артефакт, чары или землю.', 'type': 'Существо — Тина', 'flavor': 'Она не боится мечей и не оставляет после себя даже косточки.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496935&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9c02f90-50f5-48aa-a7c1-94b69e0e5012', 'multiverseId': 496935}, 'multiverseid': 496935}, {'name': '酸液黏菌', 'text': '死触\\n当酸液黏菌进战场时，消灭目标神器，结界或地。', 'type': '生物 ～流浆', 'flavor': '它迎刀剑而上，身后尸骨无存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497069&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1791b520-a20a-4897-a007-0c45b2a94e06', 'multiverseId': 497069}, 'multiverseid': 497069}]", '[{\'name\': \'Überfluss\', \'text\': \'Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, kannst du stattdessen Land oder Nichtland bestimmen und Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis du eine Karte der bestimmten Art aufdeckst. Nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand und lege alle anderen auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f6e33e-1479-4d1c-9b2f-d3ced6859ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 496130}, \'multiverseid\': 496130}, {\'name\': \'Abundancia\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, puedes elegir tierra o no tierra y mostrar cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta del tipo elegido. Pon esa carta en tu mano y pon todas las otras cartas mostradas de esta manera en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe193ae-8707-4f85-969d-6a3878e83f39\', \'multiverseId\': 496264}, \'multiverseid\': 496264}, {\'name\': \'Abondance\', \'text\': "Si vous deviez piocher une carte, vous pouvez, à la place, choisir terrain ou non-terrain et révéler les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de la sorte choisie. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et mettez toutes les autres cartes révélées de cette manière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9074d0-7d1f-4f33-b1f6-fe1271f96003\', \'multiverseId\': 496398}, \'multiverseid\': 496398}, {\'name\': \'Abbondanza\', \'text\': \'Se stai per pescare una carta, puoi invece scegliere terra o non terra e rivelare carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio fino a che non riveli una carta del tipo scelto. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti tutte le altre carte rivelate in questo modo in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f307112-d497-400c-9802-1d6910e0e5ef\', \'multiverseId\': 496532}, \'multiverseid\': 496532}, {\'name\': \'豊穣\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたは「あなたは土地か土地でないかを選び、選んだ種類のカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に加え、これにより公開された他のカードをすべて望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0542e130-426f-4397-969c-4fed3a62f5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 496666}, \'multiverseid\': 496666}, {\'name\': \'Abundância\', \'text\': \'Se você for comprar um card, em vez disso, você pode escolher entre terreno ou não terreno e revelar cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card do tipo escolhido. Coloque aquele card em sua mão e coloque todos os outros cards revelados deste modo no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ddbe00-c58e-42a9-83b4-b283d231e6f3\', \'multiverseId\': 496800}, \'multiverseid\': 496800}, {\'name\': \'Изобилие\', \'text\': \'Если вы должны взять карту, вместо этого вы можете выбрать «земля» или «не земля» и показывать карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту выбранного вида. Положите ту карту в вашу руку и положите все остальные показанные таким образом карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00dd14e4-55a3-4066-956c-eed8ee75825d\', \'multiverseId\': 496934}, \'multiverseid\': 496934}, {\'name\': \'丰衣足食\', \'text\': \'如果你将抓一张牌，则你可以改为选择地或非地，并从你牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张该种类的牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，然后将所有其他以此法展示的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89890eb-7f82-49b6-bca3-28a967d7b193\', \'multiverseId\': 497068}, \'multiverseid\': 497068}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überschwemmter Knochenacker\', \'text\': \'Der Überschwemmte Knochenacker kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Noch lange nachdem man dem Land die letzten Geheimnisse entlockt hat, wird es Mysterien geben, die tief unter dem Meer begraben liegen."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146b33e4-81c1-4032-8ffb-f1929fe8692b\', \'multiverseId\': 496213}, \'multiverseid\': 496213}, {\'name\': \'Osario sumergido\', \'text\': \'El Osario sumergido entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Siglos después de que la tierra haya entregado el último de sus secretos, seguirá habiendo misterios en las profundidades marinas".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'985c44a4-7e4e-4d06-a1e3-71e184268c91\', \'multiverseId\': 496347}, \'multiverseid\': 496347}, {\'name\': \'Ossuaire submergé\', \'text\': "L\'Ossuaire submergé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Longtemps après la découverte des derniers secrets gardés par la terre, les fonds marins recèleront encore de nombreux mystères. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dbe3b45-9edd-4d1e-a3e8-474b1416fae3\', \'multiverseId\': 496481}, \'multiverseid\': 496481}, {\'name\': \'Ossario Sommerso\', \'text\': "L\'Ossario Sommerso entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dopo che la terra avrà rivelato l\\\'ultimo dei suoi segreti, si celeranno ancora misteri nelle profondità del mare."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8445a66-8300-4e9c-bb3f-34a91e203f40\', \'multiverseId\': 496615}, \'multiverseid\': 496615}, {\'name\': \'水没した骨塚\', \'text\': \'水没した骨塚はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「地上が踏破しつくされても、海の深部には未知の領域がずっと眠り続けているのよ。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8e2ed0-91fd-497b-8423-bf7824860337\', \'multiverseId\': 496749}, \'multiverseid\': 496749}, {\'name\': \'Ossário Submerso\', \'text\': \'Ossário Submerso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Muito depois de a terra ter revelado o último de seus segredos, ainda haverá mistérios nas profundezas do mar."\\n— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=496883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb339ce9-ab79-48ca-8c42-6a1f2d3676cd\', \'multiverseId\': 496883}, \'multiverseid\': 496883}, {\'name\': \'Затопленное Кладбище\', \'text\': \'Затопленное Кладбище выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда-нибудь суша раскроет все свои секреты, но еще долго после этого тайны будут оставаться в глубинах морей».\\n— Киора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ae34fd-0f1c-4d22-bad5-9dc45b8e80bf\', \'multiverseId\': 497017}, \'multiverseid\': 497017}, {\'name\': \'水下聚骨场\', \'text\': \'水下聚骨场须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「大地早已显露其所有的秘密，然而深海依然暗藏玄机。」\\n～奇奥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=497151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0064307e-9a04-4b11-90d2-4d71aacb4ac0\', \'multiverseId\': 497151}, \'multiverseid\': 497151}]']
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', 'A25', 'AER', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AJMP', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANB', 'ARB', 'ARC', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BNG', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BRR', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CC1', 'CC2', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'DBL', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDU', 'DGM', 'DIS', 'DKA', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DOM', 'DTK', 'E01', 'E02', 'EA2', 'EA3', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EMN', 'EVG', 'F05', 'F12', 'F14', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'FUT', 'G05', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GPT', 'GRN', 'GTC', 'GVL', 'H09', 'H1R', 'HA1', 'HA5', 'HA7', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'J12', 'J18', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JOU', 'JUD', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'ME4', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MIC', 'MID', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MOR', 'MPS', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NEO', 'OGW', 'ONC', 'ONE', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTP', 'P07', 'P08', 'P09', 'P10', 'P30A', 'P30M', 'PANA', 'PBFZ', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PDCI', 'PDOM', 'PDTK', 'PELD', 'PF19', 'PGTC', 'PHOU', 'PIP', 'PJOU', 'PKLD', 'PLC', 'PLG22', 'PLST', 'PM11', 'PM15', 'PM19', 'POGW', 'PRIX', 'PRM', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSVC', 'PTHS', 'PTKDF', 'PW21', 'PW23', 'PW24', 'PWAR', 'PXLN', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'PZEN', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'SCD', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SIS', 'SLC', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SPG', 'SS2', 'STA', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UDS', 'UMA', 'USG', 'V10', 'V11', 'V13', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC97', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC']
original_text: ['(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\\nI, II — Mill two cards, then you may return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nIII — Return all land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, then shuffle your graveyard into your library.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.', "At the beginning of combat on your turn, up to one target land you control becomes an X/X Elemental creature with trample and haste until end of turn, where X is Obuun's power. It's still a land.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.", 'At the beginning of each end step, if an opponent lost 3 or more life this turn, you may draw a card. (Damage causes loss of life.)', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.\\nEach player may play an additional land on each of their turns.", "Beanstalk Giant's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.", "Bestow {2}{B}{B} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nNighthowler and enchanted creature each get +X/+X, where X is the number of creature cards in all graveyards.", "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Boros Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', "Cast this spell only during combat.\\nUntap target creature you don't control and gain control of it. It gains haste until end of turn. At the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice it. If you do, you gain life equal to its toughness.", "Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nChangeling Outcast can't block and can't be blocked.", 'Choose a creature type. Draw a card for each permanent you control of that type.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Counter target creature spell.\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Exile target artifact.\\n• Exile target enchantment.', 'Choose one —\\n• Draw cards equal to the greatest power among non-Human creatures you control.\\n• Non-Human creatures you control get +3/+3 until end of turn.', "Choose one —\\n• Naya Charm deals 3 damage to target creature.\\n• Return target card from a graveyard to its owner's hand.\\n• Tap all creatures target player controls.", "Choose two —\\n• Counter target noncreature spell.\\n• Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\n• Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.\\n• Destroy target planeswalker.", "Consuming Aberration's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your opponents' graveyards.\\nWhenever you cast a spell, each opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nAs Obelisk of Urd enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nCreatures you control of the chosen type get +2/+2.", "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nPut target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", "Create a token that's a copy of target artifact or creature.\\nCipher (Then you may exile this spell card encoded on a creature you control. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, its controller may cast a copy of the encoded card without paying its mana cost.)", 'Deathtouch\\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Deathtouch\\nWhen Gonti, Lord of Luxury enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of target opponent's library, exile one of them face down, then put the rest on the bottom of that library in a random order. You may look at and cast that card for as long as it remains exiled, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any type to cast that spell.", "Destroy all creatures you don't control and all planeswalkers you don't control.", "Destroy all creatures, then return a creature card put into a graveyard this way to the battlefield under your control. It's a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types. Exile Necromantic Selection.", "Destroy all nonland creatures.\\nAwaken 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} (If you cast this spell for {5}{W}{W}{W}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Destroy target creature.', "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B}.", 'Dimir Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it. Those creatures gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Draw three cards.', 'Each player mills two cards. Then you put a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. (To mill a card, a player puts the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each land you control.\\nEquip legendary creature {3}\\nEquip {7}', "Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may cast a creature spell from that player's graveyard this turn, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast that spell.\\nEquip {3}", 'Equipped creature gets +3/+1.\\nWhenever equipped creature dies, you may reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card that shares a creature type with it. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\nEquip {1}', 'Exile up to two target artifacts and/or enchantments.\\nBasic landcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.)', 'Fertilid enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Fertilid: Target player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles their library.', 'First strike\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, goad each creature target player controls. (Until your next turn, those creatures attack each combat if able and attack a player other than you if able.)', 'Flash\\nFlying\\nWhenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Faerie Vandal.', 'Flash\\nIf an opponent would draw a card except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps, instead that player skips that draw and you draw a card.', 'Flying\\nEach other Rogue creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying.', "Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may exile target nonland permanent other than Admonition Angel.\\nWhen Admonition Angel leaves the battlefield, return all cards exiled with it to the battlefield under their owners' control.", 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may return target nonland permanent card from your graveyard to your hand. If that land is a Plains, you may return that nonland permanent card to the battlefield instead.', 'Flying\\nProwl {2}{U} (You may cast this for its prowl cost if you dealt combat damage to a player this turn with a Faerie or Rogue.)\\nWhen Latchkey Faerie enters the battlefield, if its prowl cost was paid, draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Marsh Flitter enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 black Goblin Rogue creature tokens.\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Marsh Flitter has base power and toughness 3/3 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sandstone Oracle enters the battlefield, choose an opponent. If that player has more cards in hand than you, draw cards equal to the difference.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Nightveil Sprite attacks, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card into your graveyard.)', 'Flying\\n{X}{UB}: Choose a color. Target opponent exiles the top X cards of their library. For each card of the chosen color exiled this way, create a 1/1 blue and black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying.', 'Ground Assault deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', 'Gruul Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Gruul Turf enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gruul Turf enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{G}.", 'Haste\\nGoblin spells and Rogue spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nInvisible Stalker can't be blocked.", "Hexproof\\nWhenever a creature card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, you may have Lazav, Dimir Mastermind become a copy of that card, except its name is Lazav, Dimir Mastermind, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has hexproof and this ability.", 'If you would draw a card, you may instead choose land or nonland and reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a card of the chosen kind. Put that card into your hand and put all other cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\\nWhen Sepulchral Primordial enters the battlefield, for each opponent, you may put up to one target creature card from that player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", 'Jungle Shrine enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.', 'Jwar Isle Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Jwar Isle Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Krosan Verge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Krosan Verge: Search your library for a Forest card and a Plains card, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Create a 1/1 white Kor Ally creature token.\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• You gain 2 life.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, create a 2/2 green Elemental creature token.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, create a 5/5 red and green Elemental creature token.\\nWhenever Omnath, Locus of Rage or another Elemental you control dies, Omnath deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a quest counter on Khalni Heart Expedition.\\nRemove three quest counters from Khalni Heart Expedition and sacrifice it: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1.\\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, that player loses half their life, rounded up.\\nEquip {3}', 'Living weapon (When this Equipment enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 black Germ creature token, then attach this to it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\\nEquip {2}', "Marang River Prowler can't block and can't be blocked.\\nYou may cast Marang River Prowler from your graveyard as long as you control a black or green permanent.", 'Myriad Landscape enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Myriad Landscape: Search your library for up to two basic land cards that share a land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "Needle Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\\n{2}{R}{W}: Needle Spires becomes a 2/1 red and white Elemental creature with double strike until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Other Rogues you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever one or more Rogues you control deal combat damage to a player, that player mills a card for each 1 damage dealt to them. If the player mills at least one creature card this way, you draw a card. (To mill a card, a player puts the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Outlast {G} ({G}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', 'Outlast {W} ({W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has flying.', "Prowl {1}{B} (You may cast this for its prowl cost if you dealt combat damage to a player this turn with a Goblin or Rogue.)\\nWhenever a Rogue you control attacks and isn't blocked, it gets +2/+1 until end of turn.", "Prowl {3}{U} (You may cast this spell for its prowl cost if you dealt combat damage to a player this turn with a Sphinx or Rogue.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Enigma Thief enters the battlefield, for each opponent, return up to one target nonland permanent that player controls to its owner's hand.", "Prowl {5}{U} (You may cast this for its prowl cost if you dealt combat damage to a player this turn with a Rogue.)\\nCreate X 1/1 black Faerie Rogue creature tokens with flying, where X is the damage dealt to your opponents this turn. If this spell's prowl cost was paid, take an extra turn after this one.", "Put target attacking creature on the bottom of its owner's library. Its controller gains life equal to its toughness.", "Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It gains indestructible. If it's your turn, scry 2.", 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', "Reach, trample\\nMultani, Yavimaya's Avatar gets +1/+1 for each land you control and each land card in your graveyard.\\n{1}{G}, Return two lands you control to their owner's hand: Return Multani from your graveyard to your hand.", "Return all attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.\\nThreshold — If seven or more cards are in your graveyard, instead search your library for up to three basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to three basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library. You gain 7 life.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards and/or Gate cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal those cards, and put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Selesnya Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Slither Blade can't be blocked.", 'Struggle deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', 'Submerged Boneyard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a legendary creature.\\nDestroy target creature.\\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'This spell costs {3} less to cast if there are ten or more nonland permanents on the battlefield.\\nDestroy all nonland permanents.', 'Trample\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.', 'Treacherous Terrain deals damage to each opponent equal to the number of lands that player controls.\\nBasic landcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.)', "Triton Shorestalker can't be blocked.", 'Vigilance\\nAs long as you control six or more lands, Sylvan Advocate and land creatures you control get +2/+2.', "Vigilance\\nLand creatures you control have vigilance.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target land you control become a 3/3 Elemental creature with haste until end of turn. It's still a land.", "Vigilance\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, exile target permanent card with converted mana cost 3 or less from your graveyard.\\nWhen Trove Warden dies, put each permanent card exiled with it onto the battlefield under the control of that card's owner.", 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sun Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may return target permanent card with converted mana cost 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'When Armorcraft Judge enters the battlefield, draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'When Banishing Light enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Banishing Light leaves the battlefield.', 'When Elite Scaleguard enters the battlefield, bolster 2. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', 'When Elvish Rejuvenator enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them onto the battlefield tapped. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Kor Cartographer enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'When Master Thief enters the battlefield, gain control of target artifact for as long as you control Master Thief.', 'When Satyr Wayfinder enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', "When Scourge of Fleets enters the battlefield, return each creature your opponents control with toughness X or less to its owner's hand, where X is the number of Islands you control.", 'When Springbloom Druid enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice a land. If you do, search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "When Together Forever enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\n{1}: Choose target creature with a counter on it. When that creature dies this turn, return that card to its owner's hand.", "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'When Yavimaya Elder dies, you may search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle your library.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Elder: Draw a card.', 'Whenever Scaretiller becomes tapped, choose one —\\n• You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.\\n• Return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Whenever Zulaport Cutthroat or another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Whenever another creature dies, or a creature card is put into a graveyard from anywhere other than the battlefield, or a creature card leaves your graveyard, Syr Konrad, the Grim deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\n{1}{B}: Each player mills a card. (They each put the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Whenever another nontoken creature dies, you may create a 1/1 black Rat creature token.\\nRats you control have deathtouch.', 'Whenever one or more non-Human creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card.', 'Whenever you attack with two or more creatures, draw a card.', 'X target creatures can\'t be blocked this turn. Until end of turn, those creatures gain "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw a card."', "You may play an additional land on each of your turns.\\n{R}{G}, Return a land you control to its owner's hand: Target creature gains trample until end of turn.", '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', "{1}{R}, Discard a land card: Living Twister deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{G}: Return a tapped land you control to its owner's hand.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Cryptic Caves: Draw a card. Activate this ability only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Naya Panorama: Search your library for a basic Mountain, Forest, or Plains card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\\n{UB}{UB}{UB}{UB}, {T}, Sacrifice Dimir Locket: Draw two cards.', "{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\\n{U}{B}: Dimir Keyrune becomes a 2/2 blue and black Horror artifact creature until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", "{X}{G}{G}: Put X +1/+1 counters on target land you control. That land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land."]
